1
00:00:05,873 --> 00:00:08,242
♪ IN THE NOT-TOO-DISTANT
FUTURE ♪

2
00:00:08,275 --> 00:00:11,278
♪ WAY DOWN IN DEEP 13 ♪

3
00:00:11,312 --> 00:00:14,448
♪ DR. FORRESTER
AND TV'S FRANK ♪

4
00:00:14,482 --> 00:00:17,652
♪ WERE HATCHING
AN EVIL SCHEME ♪

5
00:00:17,685 --> 00:00:20,722
♪ THEY HIRED A TEMP
BY THE NAME OF MIKE ♪

6
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:23,858
♪ JUST A REGULAR JOE
THEY DIDN'T LIKE ♪

7
00:00:23,892 --> 00:00:26,828
♪ THEIR EXPERIMENT
NEEDED A GOOD TEST CASE ♪

8
00:00:26,862 --> 00:00:28,563
♪ SO THEY CONKED HIM
ON THE NOGGIN ♪

9
00:00:28,597 --> 00:00:30,498
♪ AND THEY SHOT HIM
INTO SPACE ♪

10
00:00:30,532 --> 00:00:33,167
GET ME DOWN!

11
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,303
♪ WE'LL SEND HIM
CHEESY MOVIES ♪

12
00:00:36,337 --> 00:00:39,473
♪ THE WORST WE CAN
FIND-- LA LA LA ♪

13
00:00:39,507 --> 00:00:42,377
♪ HE'LL HAVE TO SIT
AND WATCH THEM ALL ♪

14
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:45,747
♪ AND WE'LL MONITOR
HIS MIND-- LA LA LA ♪

15
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,583
♪ NOW KEEP IN MIND,
MIKE CAN'T CONTROL ♪

16
00:00:48,617 --> 00:00:51,920
♪ WHERE THE MOVIES BEGIN
OR END-- LA LA LA ♪

17
00:00:51,953 --> 00:00:55,022
♪ HE'LL TRY TO KEEP
HIS SANITY ♪

18
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:58,358
♪ WITH THE HELP
OF HIS ROBOT FRIENDS ♪

19
00:01:00,095 --> 00:01:01,495
♪ ROBOT ROLL CALL ♪

20
00:01:01,528 --> 00:01:02,997
CAMBOT!

21
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:04,265
GYPSY!

22
00:01:04,298 --> 00:01:06,167
TOM SERVO!

23
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,435
CROW!

24
00:01:07,468 --> 00:01:08,903
♪ IF YOU'RE WONDERING HOW ♪

25
00:01:08,937 --> 00:01:10,738
♪ HE EATS AND BREATHES ♪

26
00:01:10,772 --> 00:01:13,842
♪ AND OTHER SCIENCE
FACTS-- LA LA LA ♪

27
00:01:13,875 --> 00:01:16,878
♪ JUST REPEAT TO YOURSELF,
IT'S JUST A SHOW ♪

28
00:01:16,912 --> 00:01:19,813
♪ I SHOULD REALLY
JUST RELAX ♪

29
00:01:19,847 --> 00:01:22,883
♪ FOR MYSTERY
SCIENCE THEATER ♪

30
00:01:22,917 --> 00:01:26,053
♪ 3000 ♪

31
00:01:40,202 --> 00:01:42,137
HELLO, MAGGOTS!

32
00:01:42,170 --> 00:01:44,038
WELCOME TO BOOT CAMP

33
00:01:44,072 --> 00:01:46,842
HERE AT FORT
SATELLITE OF LOVE!

34
00:01:46,875 --> 00:01:49,210
TODAY, WE ARE GOING TO DO

35
00:01:49,243 --> 00:01:50,278
A FIELD STRIP

36
00:01:50,312 --> 00:01:53,313
OF ONE MR. TOM SERVO!

37
00:01:53,347 --> 00:01:56,350
I'M DRILL SERGEANT
CROW T. ROBOT!

38
00:01:56,383 --> 00:02:00,087
OR SIR! TO YOU
TOILET-WATER-GUZZLING

39
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,290
LITTLE MAMA'S BOYS!
YOU GOT THAT, SON?

40
00:02:02,323 --> 00:02:04,725
- SIR, YES SIR.
- I DIDN'T HEAR YOU,
LADY-BRITCHES!

41
00:02:04,758 --> 00:02:06,160
I SAID SIR, YES SIR.

42
00:02:06,193 --> 00:02:07,462
CAN WE JUST GET ON
WITH THIS, CROW?

43
00:02:07,495 --> 00:02:08,797
I WANNA WATCH <i>SISTERS.</i>

44
00:02:08,830 --> 00:02:10,165
YOU'RE NOT GOING NOWHERE,

45
00:02:10,198 --> 00:02:11,398
YOU WUSSY-RED CUPCAKE!

46
00:02:11,432 --> 00:02:12,867
UNLESS YOU'RE GONNA RUN
HOME TO YOUR MAMA, HUH?

47
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:14,702
- OOH! OOH, I'M SCARED.
- HEY, CROW?

48
00:02:14,735 --> 00:02:15,970
COME ON.

49
00:02:16,003 --> 00:02:17,738
I'M THE DRILL SERGEANT HERE,

50
00:02:17,772 --> 00:02:20,140
YOU TOE-HEADED,
CONTACT-LENS-WEARING

51
00:02:20,175 --> 00:02:21,943
PIECE OF TOAST!
NOW GIVE ME THE OATH!

52
00:02:21,977 --> 00:02:23,512
UH, THIS IS MY ROBOT.

53
00:02:23,545 --> 00:02:25,680
THERE ARE MANY LIKE IT,
BUT THIS ONE IS MINE.

54
00:02:25,713 --> 00:02:28,348
AND WHAT IS THE NAME
OF YOUR ROBOT, BOY?

55
00:02:28,382 --> 00:02:30,218
SERVO. TOM SERVO!

56
00:02:30,252 --> 00:02:32,820
I DON'T BELIEVE
I WAS ADDRESSING YOU,

57
00:02:32,853 --> 00:02:34,522
MAYONNAISE!

58
00:02:34,555 --> 00:02:36,557
WHY DON'T YOU JUST
MAKE YOURSELF COMFORTABLE

59
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:39,293
DOWN THERE ON THE FLOOR
AND GIVE ME 20, CORPORAL!

60
00:02:39,327 --> 00:02:40,628
UH, CAUSE I CAN'T.

61
00:02:40,662 --> 00:02:41,963
WELL,

62
00:02:41,997 --> 00:02:45,600
NOW YOU JUST BOUGHT
YOURSELF 200!

63
00:02:45,633 --> 00:02:46,767
COME ON, DICKWEED!

64
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,902
UH, WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

65
00:02:47,935 --> 00:02:49,570
I HEARD THAT, PYLE!

66
00:02:49,603 --> 00:02:50,972
YOU PIECE OF FILTH!

67
00:02:51,005 --> 00:02:52,740
- SEVERAL PIECES, ACTUALLY.
- OH.

68
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,182
HELLO, JOKER.

69
00:03:01,215 --> 00:03:03,183
PYLE, YOU ARE
IN A WORLD OF--

70
00:03:03,217 --> 00:03:04,618
HEY, THE MAD SCIENTISTS
ARE CALLING.

71
00:03:04,652 --> 00:03:06,420
OUTSTANDING.

72
00:03:06,453 --> 00:03:07,855
AH, MIKE.

73
00:03:07,888 --> 00:03:09,957
I SEE YOU'VE DECIDED
TO GO PSYCHO.

74
00:03:09,990 --> 00:03:11,458
GODSPEED.

75
00:03:11,492 --> 00:03:14,128
ANYWAY, OUR INVENTION
EXCHANGE THIS WEEK

76
00:03:14,162 --> 00:03:16,965
ADDRESSES A NEED I'M SURE
EVERYONE CAN RELATE TO.

77
00:03:16,998 --> 00:03:18,733
AND HERE'S OUR OWN
TV'S FRANK

78
00:03:18,767 --> 00:03:19,933
TO TELL US MORE ABOUT IT.

79
00:03:19,967 --> 00:03:21,702
- FRANK.
- THANK YOU, DR. F.

80
00:03:21,735 --> 00:03:23,838
SAY, DON'T YOU
JUST HATE IT WHEN

81
00:03:23,872 --> 00:03:26,073
YOU'RE SUFFERING FROM
SOME HORRIBLE AILMENT,

82
00:03:26,107 --> 00:03:27,542
AND THE ONLY THING
THAT CAN CURE YOU

83
00:03:27,575 --> 00:03:29,010
IS AN ORGAN TRANSPLANT?

84
00:03:29,043 --> 00:03:30,345
I HATE THAT!

85
00:03:30,378 --> 00:03:32,680
THEN, WHAT'S WORSE,
YOU GO TO THE HOSPITAL.

86
00:03:32,713 --> 00:03:35,417
YOU HAVE TO WAIT
DAYS, WEEKS, MONTHS,

87
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:37,552
SOMETIMES EVEN YEARS
TO GET THAT ORGAN.

88
00:03:37,585 --> 00:03:39,620
THAT BUGS THE HECK
OUT OF ME.

89
00:03:39,653 --> 00:03:42,123
THAT'S WHY WE'VE COME UP
WITH THE VEND-A-GUT.

90
00:03:42,157 --> 00:03:43,557
THE FIRST VENDING MACHINE

91
00:03:43,592 --> 00:03:45,893
THAT DISPENSES
REAL HUMAN ORGANS.

92
00:03:45,927 --> 00:03:47,628
NOW, GETTING A DONOR ORGAN

93
00:03:47,662 --> 00:03:50,332
WILL BE AS SIMPLE
AS BUYING A SNICKERS BAR.

94
00:03:50,365 --> 00:03:52,100
NOW, FOR THE SAKE
OF THIS DEMONSTRATION,

95
00:03:52,133 --> 00:03:54,402
I TOOK THE LIBERTY
OF REMOVING FRANK'S LIVER.

96
00:03:54,435 --> 00:03:55,737
- AND NOW--
- YOU DID?

97
00:03:55,770 --> 00:03:56,837
WELL, DON'T WORRY,

98
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:58,172
I ALSO TOOK THE PRECAUTION

99
00:03:58,205 --> 00:03:59,573
OF INSERTING
YOUR LIFE SAVINGS

100
00:03:59,607 --> 00:04:00,742
INTO THE VEND-A-GUT.

101
00:04:00,775 --> 00:04:03,210
NOW, ALL YOU HAVE
TO DO IS PRESS B-2.

102
00:04:03,243 --> 00:04:06,213
AND, VOILA,
A BRAND-NEW LIVER.

103
00:04:06,247 --> 00:04:09,317
LET'S SEE, B-2.

104
00:04:12,953 --> 00:04:15,890
OH, DAMN THESE THINGS!

105
00:04:15,923 --> 00:04:17,525
[ORGAN SQUISHES]

106
00:04:20,362 --> 00:04:22,730
HEY, THIS IS GREAT!

107
00:04:24,398 --> 00:04:26,467
NOW, ALL I HAVE TO DO
IS INSERT THIS LIVER

108
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:29,237
INTO MY BODY.

109
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:31,572
HOW DO I DO THAT?

110
00:04:31,605 --> 00:04:33,642
BACK UP TO YOU, MIKE.

111
00:04:33,675 --> 00:04:35,377
WELL, OUR INVENTION
IS BASED UPON THE FACT

112
00:04:35,410 --> 00:04:37,578
THAT WE, AS A NATION,
AND AS A PEOPLE,

113
00:04:37,612 --> 00:04:39,547
HAVE GOTTEN AWAY
FROM OUR RURAL ROOTS.

114
00:04:39,580 --> 00:04:40,748
HECK, YOU KNOW,
WHEN I GREW UP,

115
00:04:40,782 --> 00:04:42,483
I WAS SURROUNDED
BY THE HUSTLE AND BUSTLE

116
00:04:42,517 --> 00:04:44,185
OF A BLEAK URBAN LANDSCAPE.

117
00:04:44,218 --> 00:04:45,320
OH, GIVE IT A REST, MIKE.

118
00:04:45,353 --> 00:04:47,022
YOU GREW UP IN SOMERSET,
WISCONSIN.

119
00:04:47,055 --> 00:04:49,123
RIGHT, ANYWAY, OUR INVENTION
SEEKS TO GIVE EVERYONE,

120
00:04:49,157 --> 00:04:52,327
NO MATTER WHERE THEY LIVE,
A TASTE OF SIMPLE FARM LIVING.

121
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,928
IT'S FRIDGE UDDERS.

122
00:04:53,962 --> 00:04:56,597
NOW, YOU CAN MILK YOUR FRIDGE
FOR EVERYTHING IT'S WORTH.

123
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:57,965
IT COMES WITH FOUR TEATS.

124
00:04:57,998 --> 00:04:59,433
- TEATS!
- TEATS!
-HE SAID TEATS!

125
00:04:59,467 --> 00:05:00,635
- WOW, WE CAN SAY THAT, TOO.
-TEATS, TEATS, TEATS--

126
00:05:00,668 --> 00:05:02,403
THIS ONE OVER HERE,
REGULAR MILK.

127
00:05:02,437 --> 00:05:04,438
THIS ONE HERE, SKIM MILK.

128
00:05:04,472 --> 00:05:05,640
CHOCOLATE MILK.

129
00:05:05,673 --> 00:05:07,042
AND RIGHT HERE,
CRUSHED ICE.

130
00:05:07,075 --> 00:05:08,408
OW! WHOO! HEY, UH,

131
00:05:08,442 --> 00:05:10,578
SAY, MIKE,
LET'S GET DRUNK LATER

132
00:05:10,612 --> 00:05:12,213
AND GO FRIDGE-TIPPING,
WHAT DO YOU SAY?

133
00:05:12,247 --> 00:05:14,048
I DON'T THINK SO.

134
00:05:14,082 --> 00:05:15,115
[FRIDGE MOOS]
- STEADY, AMANA.

135
00:05:15,148 --> 00:05:16,683
WHAT DO YOU THINK, SIRS?

136
00:05:17,852 --> 00:05:19,087
DR. FORRESTER,

137
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,555
MY BODY HAS REJECTED
MY NEW LIVER.

138
00:05:21,588 --> 00:05:23,692
OH, HERE, FRANK,
FILL THIS OUT

139
00:05:23,725 --> 00:05:25,860
AND PUT IT NEXT
TO THE MACHINE.

140
00:05:25,893 --> 00:05:27,795
WELL, I DON'T WANNA
WAIT THAT LONG!

141
00:05:27,828 --> 00:05:30,498
WELL THEN, JUST GET ANOTHER
LIVER FROM THE MACHINE!

142
00:05:30,532 --> 00:05:31,898
YOU HAPPEN TO HAVE

143
00:05:31,932 --> 00:05:34,868
$150.000 IN QUARTERS
ON YOU, DON'T YOU?

144
00:05:34,902 --> 00:05:36,470
AS A MATTER OF FACT, I DO.

145
00:05:36,503 --> 00:05:38,572
OH. OH.

146
00:05:38,605 --> 00:05:41,375
ANYWAY, MIKE,
YOUR MOVIE THIS WEEK

147
00:05:41,408 --> 00:05:43,812
IS FROM THE TEAM
GOLAN GLOBUS.

148
00:05:43,845 --> 00:05:45,747
SOME PRODUCERS I'VE
WANTED TO INFLICT ON YOU

149
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:47,215
FOR SOME TIME.

150
00:05:47,248 --> 00:05:48,582
IT STARS KATHY IRELAND,

151
00:05:48,615 --> 00:05:51,118
AND IT'S CALLED
<i>ALIEN FROM L.A.</i>

152
00:05:51,152 --> 00:05:53,553
ALIEN FROM L.A., THAT'S
KIND OF REDUNDANT, ISN'T IT?

153
00:05:53,587 --> 00:05:56,623
- FRANK.
- [FRANK MOANS]

154
00:05:56,657 --> 00:05:59,460
- TEAT, TEAT.
- [CROW COUGHS]

155
00:05:59,493 --> 00:06:02,530
CROW, I WARNED YOU
ABOUT FRIDGE-TIPPING.

156
00:06:02,563 --> 00:06:04,298
- TEAT TEAT TEAT--
- SERVO, PLEASE CUT IT OUT!

157
00:06:04,332 --> 00:06:07,502
OH GREAT, NOW
WE GOT MOVIE SIGN!

158
00:06:07,535 --> 00:06:08,803
TEAT TEAT TEAT.

159
00:06:22,217 --> 00:06:24,152
CROW, BUDDY, ARE YOU OKAY?

160
00:06:24,185 --> 00:06:26,020
- OH, YEAH.
- YOU OKAY?

161
00:06:26,053 --> 00:06:27,288
HE'S FINE.

162
00:06:27,322 --> 00:06:29,657
HERE, GET IN YOUR
THING, THERE.

163
00:06:29,690 --> 00:06:31,892
WANDA, THE CREEP
BROKE UP WITH YOU

164
00:06:31,925 --> 00:06:33,427
OVER YOUR
ANSWERING MACHINE.

165
00:06:33,460 --> 00:06:34,495
HE HATES YOUR
ANSWERING MACHINE.

166
00:06:34,528 --> 00:06:36,730
I JUST WANNA KNOW
WHY HE BROKE UP.

167
00:06:36,763 --> 00:06:38,800
HE DOESN'T LIKE YOU.

168
00:06:38,833 --> 00:06:41,335
THANKS, STACY.

169
00:06:41,368 --> 00:06:42,637
YOU SHOULD'VE GONE BLONDER.

170
00:06:42,670 --> 00:06:44,605
KIEFER SUTHERLAND IS HOT!

171
00:06:44,638 --> 00:06:47,575
- WOW.
- OH, THERE'S THE CUE CARD!

172
00:06:47,608 --> 00:06:49,077
HE'S HERE!

173
00:06:49,110 --> 00:06:51,045
[GASPS] SHE'S NUDE!

174
00:06:51,078 --> 00:06:52,380
OH, YEAH.

175
00:06:52,413 --> 00:06:56,250
I'M SO HIGH.

176
00:06:56,283 --> 00:06:58,085
[SERVO HUMS ALONG]

177
00:06:59,953 --> 00:07:01,055
WHAT IS THIS,
HIGH HOLIDAY?

178
00:07:01,088 --> 00:07:03,723
WHERE THE HECK
IS EVERYBODY?

179
00:07:03,757 --> 00:07:04,825
HI!

180
00:07:04,858 --> 00:07:05,993
YOU GOT MY MESSAGE, RIGHT?

181
00:07:06,027 --> 00:07:07,762
YEAH, I DID, ROBBIE.

182
00:07:07,795 --> 00:07:09,030
I JUST WANTED TO--

183
00:07:09,063 --> 00:07:11,098
WANTED TO WHAT, HARASS ME
ABOUT BREAKING UP?

184
00:07:11,132 --> 00:07:13,333
NO, I JUST
WANNA KNOW WHY!

185
00:07:13,367 --> 00:07:15,202
WELL, HOW DARE YOU TRY
TO COMMUNICATE WITH ME.

186
00:07:15,235 --> 00:07:16,437
WHAT DID I DO WRONG?

187
00:07:16,470 --> 00:07:19,407
YOU DIDN'T DO
ANYTHING WRONG, WANDA.

188
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:21,942
I THOUGHT YOU
REALLY LIKED ME.

189
00:07:21,975 --> 00:07:24,178
YOU SAID I WAS SPECIAL.

190
00:07:24,212 --> 00:07:26,413
SO, NATURALLY,
I WANNA KNOW WHY.

191
00:07:26,447 --> 00:07:27,682
IT'S YOUR
HELIUM ADDICTION.

192
00:07:27,715 --> 00:07:30,250
FOR ONE THING, YOU
NEVER WANNA GO ANYWHERE.

193
00:07:30,283 --> 00:07:31,618
I DO SO!

194
00:07:31,652 --> 00:07:34,188
I KNOW, TWO BLOCKS,
TO THE BEACH.

195
00:07:34,222 --> 00:07:35,823
YOU DIDN'T WANT TO GO
ON THAT CAMPING TRIP

196
00:07:35,857 --> 00:07:37,057
TO THE GRAND CANYON

197
00:07:37,090 --> 00:07:38,525
OR ROCK CLIMBING
IN YOSEMITE.

198
00:07:38,558 --> 00:07:40,828
- HUH.
- OR THE FOURTH OF JULY
PARTY IN ENSENADA.

199
00:07:40,862 --> 00:07:42,028
THIS GUY'S FUN!

200
00:07:42,062 --> 00:07:44,165
I GET CARSICK.

201
00:07:44,198 --> 00:07:46,600
I TOLD YOU
I'D FLY YOU THERE.

202
00:07:46,633 --> 00:07:49,203
I'M SCARED OF FLYING,
YOU KNOW THAT.

203
00:07:49,237 --> 00:07:51,005
- [SERVO SOBS]
- YOU'RE SCARED OF EVERYTHING.

204
00:07:51,038 --> 00:07:52,607
OKAY.

205
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,875
- WE COULD'VE WALKED.
- I HATE WALKING!

206
00:07:54,908 --> 00:07:55,977
WHAT ELSE IS WRONG
WITH ME?

207
00:07:56,010 --> 00:07:57,478
LOOK, WHAT'S THE POINT?

208
00:07:57,512 --> 00:07:59,613
YOU OBVIOUSLY HAVE
A SERIOUS PROBLEM.

209
00:07:59,647 --> 00:08:01,182
SHE'S EMOTING--
SHE'S GONNA BLOW!

210
00:08:01,215 --> 00:08:02,883
LOOK OUT!

211
00:08:02,917 --> 00:08:04,052
HIS NIPPLES ARE SHRINKING.

212
00:08:04,085 --> 00:08:05,653
THERE'S ONLY TWO WEEKS
LEFT IN AUGUST,

213
00:08:05,687 --> 00:08:08,122
AND I WANNA SALVAGE
SOME OF IT, ALL RIGHT?

214
00:08:08,155 --> 00:08:10,323
ROBBIE, PLEASE!

215
00:08:10,357 --> 00:08:11,858
WE CAN TALK ABOUT IT!

216
00:08:11,892 --> 00:08:13,393
CAN I HAVE
MY BLUE DRESS BACK?

217
00:08:13,427 --> 00:08:15,328
I CAN CHANGE!
I WANNA CHANGE!

218
00:08:15,362 --> 00:08:17,565
JUST TELL ME WHAT YOU
DON'T LIKE ABOUT ME.

219
00:08:17,598 --> 00:08:20,333
WOW, SHE'S GOT A LOT
OF PRIDE AND DIGNITY, HUH?

220
00:08:20,367 --> 00:08:22,770
- YEAH, SURE.
- PLEASE, ROBBIE!

221
00:08:22,803 --> 00:08:24,438
GIVE ME A CHANCE!

222
00:08:24,472 --> 00:08:26,740
WHAT DON'T YOU LIKE ABOUT ME,
AND I'LL CHANGE.

223
00:08:26,773 --> 00:08:28,442
HEY, GUYS, IT'S <i>BAYWATCH!</i>

224
00:08:28,475 --> 00:08:30,477
- WHOO!
- <i>BAYWATCH!</i>

225
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:31,845
- LIEUTENANT
WHAT'S-HER-NAME!

226
00:08:31,878 --> 00:08:33,480
--AND YOUR VOICE GIVES ME
A HEADACHE, IS THAT ENOUGH?

227
00:08:33,513 --> 00:08:36,717
AND YOU GIVE ME
WHISKER BURNS!

228
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:38,385
HOW COME YOU NEVER
TOLD ME THIS BEFORE?

229
00:08:38,418 --> 00:08:40,087
HUH?

230
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,855
WHY'D YOU EVEN GO OUT
WITH ME IN THE FIRST PLACE

231
00:08:41,888 --> 00:08:43,023
IF I'M SUCH A GEEK?

232
00:08:43,057 --> 00:08:44,592
BECAUSE I'M TURNED ON
BY SQUEEZE TOYS.

233
00:08:44,625 --> 00:08:47,262
WANDA, I'M REALLY SORRY
I HURT YOU.

234
00:08:47,295 --> 00:08:48,395
I DIDN'T MEAN TO.

235
00:08:48,428 --> 00:08:49,730
IT'S JUST WHAT I DO WELL.

236
00:08:49,763 --> 00:08:50,965
BUT YOU ARE WHO YOU ARE,

237
00:08:50,998 --> 00:08:52,567
AND WE'RE JUST NOT
RIGHT FOR EACH OTHER.

238
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,235
I MEAN, I'M RIGHT,
BUT YOU'RE NOT.

239
00:08:56,737 --> 00:08:58,907
SEE, THIS SHOULD
HAVE A BRAIN IN IT.

240
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:00,273
GOOD-BYE.

241
00:09:00,307 --> 00:09:02,343
GETTING DUMPED
IN ABOUT AN HOUR.

242
00:09:02,377 --> 00:09:03,877
YEAH, SURE.

243
00:09:03,912 --> 00:09:05,680
OKAY.

244
00:09:05,713 --> 00:09:07,615
HUH, NOT A CHEST HAIR
BETWEEN THEM, EH?

245
00:09:07,648 --> 00:09:08,748
NOPE.

246
00:09:08,782 --> 00:09:10,417
YEAH, I THINK
WE'RE STILL TOGETHER.

247
00:09:10,450 --> 00:09:13,753
JUST ANOTHER BUILDING BLOCK
TO OUR RELATIONSHIP.

248
00:09:13,787 --> 00:09:15,022
SAKS!

249
00:09:15,055 --> 00:09:16,490
HOUSEWARES IS ON ONE.

250
00:09:16,523 --> 00:09:17,758
CLOTHING IS ON ONE.

251
00:09:17,792 --> 00:09:20,227
ADMINISTRATION IS ON ONE.

252
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:22,997
AH, PARIS IN THE SPRINGTIME.

253
00:09:24,665 --> 00:09:27,502
ALL THIS REJECTION
IS REALLY GETTING TO ME.

254
00:09:27,535 --> 00:09:28,868
GET OUT OF MY CAR.

255
00:09:28,902 --> 00:09:30,103
I MEAN, IT SEEMS
EVER SINCE I WAS A KID,

256
00:09:30,137 --> 00:09:31,338
I'VE BEEN REJECTED.

257
00:09:31,372 --> 00:09:33,440
- HI!
- HOWARD STERN!

258
00:09:35,475 --> 00:09:37,210
EVEN MY OWN DAD.

259
00:09:37,243 --> 00:09:38,545
HE LEFT ME.

260
00:09:38,578 --> 00:09:40,313
HE'S AN EXPLORER, WANDA.

261
00:09:40,347 --> 00:09:42,617
IT'S HIS JOB TO TRAVEL
AND NOT BE HOME.

262
00:09:42,650 --> 00:09:44,285
FOR TEN YEARS?

263
00:09:44,318 --> 00:09:46,953
WELL, SO HE'S
BEEN REAL BUSY.

264
00:09:46,987 --> 00:09:48,888
AND WHAT ABOUT MY MOM?

265
00:09:48,922 --> 00:09:50,925
SHE'S LEFT.

266
00:09:50,958 --> 00:09:52,760
SHE GOT HIT BY A CAR
AND DIED, WANDA.

267
00:09:52,793 --> 00:09:53,995
SHE DIDN'T HAVE A CHOICE.

268
00:09:54,028 --> 00:09:57,097
OR DID SHE?

269
00:09:57,130 --> 00:09:58,232
SORRY.

270
00:09:58,265 --> 00:10:00,200
BUT YOUR MOM RAN
RIGHT OUT IN FRONT OF ME.

271
00:10:00,233 --> 00:10:01,568
OH, YOU'RE RIGHT.

272
00:10:01,602 --> 00:10:04,072
SHE DIDN'T HAVE A CHOICE.

273
00:10:04,105 --> 00:10:06,440
BUT MY DAD DID.

274
00:10:06,473 --> 00:10:07,575
WHERE'S WANDA?

275
00:10:07,608 --> 00:10:08,977
WHERE'S WALDO?

276
00:10:09,010 --> 00:10:10,812
NO ONE WANTS ME.

277
00:10:10,845 --> 00:10:12,112
FOR ANYTHING.

278
00:10:12,145 --> 00:10:13,380
SPORTS ILLUSTRATED
ON THE PHONE, CATHY.

279
00:10:13,413 --> 00:10:14,582
I WANT YOU, HONEY.

280
00:10:14,615 --> 00:10:15,850
I WANT YOU TO GET
YOUR BUTT OUT OF THIS CAR

281
00:10:15,883 --> 00:10:17,352
AND COME GIVE ME A HAND,
I'M DYING HERE.

282
00:10:17,385 --> 00:10:19,153
SEE, I'M SOUTHERN,
AND I'M SASSY.

283
00:10:19,187 --> 00:10:20,353
NOW KISS MY GRITS.

284
00:10:20,387 --> 00:10:21,588
WHOA... WHOA...

285
00:10:21,622 --> 00:10:23,023
WHOA-OH!

286
00:10:23,057 --> 00:10:26,293
WHOA.

287
00:10:26,327 --> 00:10:29,730
WOW! GREAT
PRODUCTION DESIGN.

288
00:10:29,763 --> 00:10:31,132
I'M IN CONFLICT.

289
00:10:31,165 --> 00:10:33,333
I'M EXPERIENCING
INNER TURMOIL.

290
00:10:34,668 --> 00:10:35,770
HEY, MADAME CURIE,

291
00:10:35,803 --> 00:10:38,538
COULD YOU GET
MY FRIES OVER HERE?

292
00:10:38,572 --> 00:10:40,708
I WONDER WHAT I'D
LOOK LIKE IN A SWIMSUIT.

293
00:10:40,742 --> 00:10:43,077
I'M WANDA SAKNUSSEMM,

294
00:10:43,110 --> 00:10:45,545
AND I'M NOT GONNA BE
AFRAID TO CHANGE MY LIFE.

295
00:10:45,578 --> 00:10:46,647
OH NO, DON'T LET HER SING,

296
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:47,848
PLEASE, PLEASE, OH PLEASE.

297
00:10:47,882 --> 00:10:49,083
THIS TIME I'M GONNA DO IT.

298
00:10:49,117 --> 00:10:50,785
THIS TIME, I'M...

299
00:10:50,818 --> 00:10:54,288
UH-OH, WHAT WAS
I THINKING ABOUT?

300
00:10:54,322 --> 00:10:55,923
PLEASE, GOD.

301
00:10:55,957 --> 00:10:57,425
MOTHER THERESA,
PLEASE HOLD.

302
00:10:57,458 --> 00:11:00,293
KATHY'S ON LINE ONE.

303
00:11:00,327 --> 00:11:02,397
--ANYTHING AT ALL, REALLY.

304
00:11:02,430 --> 00:11:03,563
HI, KATHY!

305
00:11:03,597 --> 00:11:06,167
ANYTHING.

306
00:11:07,468 --> 00:11:09,937
[SERVO CHANTS]

307
00:11:12,907 --> 00:11:15,042
WHAT WAS THAT?

308
00:11:15,075 --> 00:11:16,310
GOLAN-GLOBUS? NO!

309
00:11:16,343 --> 00:11:18,278
OH NO!

310
00:11:21,082 --> 00:11:23,517
KATHY, YOU SHOULDN'T'VE
GONE ON THAT DIET.

311
00:11:23,550 --> 00:11:25,318
LADIES, DO YOUR THIGHS
LOOK LIKE THIS?

312
00:11:25,352 --> 00:11:26,687
GET RID OF THAT
UGLY CELLULITE

313
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,322
WITH A PICKAX!

314
00:11:30,958 --> 00:11:33,227
UGH, SOMETIMES
I FEEL LIKE THAT.

315
00:11:36,530 --> 00:11:37,832
HE'S PASSING A STONE.

316
00:11:40,633 --> 00:11:41,802
PAUL SCHAFFER!

317
00:11:41,835 --> 00:11:43,570
HI, DAVE.

318
00:11:45,807 --> 00:11:47,040
OKAY, I'LL TAKE IT,

319
00:11:47,073 --> 00:11:49,177
BUT THE CURRENT TENANTS
MUST GO.

320
00:11:51,412 --> 00:11:54,013
THIS IS GREAT, WANDA WILL
NEVER FIND ME HERE.

321
00:11:56,183 --> 00:11:58,452
[LAUGHS] FOLKS, THOUGHT
YOU'D ALL LIKE A BREAK

322
00:11:58,485 --> 00:12:00,888
FROM THE WHOLE
KATHY IRELAND THING.

323
00:12:03,490 --> 00:12:04,758
DON'T MAKE ME
COME IN THERE!

324
00:12:04,792 --> 00:12:06,727
HE LOOKS LIKE
CLINT HOWARD.

325
00:12:09,697 --> 00:12:11,632
EW, WHAT CAME OUT OF ME?

326
00:12:15,770 --> 00:12:18,272
INTERESTING LITTLE...
PUSH THIS...

327
00:12:18,305 --> 00:12:19,407
BING-BONG.

328
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:21,375
WHO IS IT?

329
00:12:27,515 --> 00:12:30,217
GOING SIDEWAYS,
MR. SAKNUSSEMM?

330
00:12:35,622 --> 00:12:37,525
MAYBE YOU COULD TAKE CARE
OF YOUR SCRATCHING PROBLEM

331
00:12:37,558 --> 00:12:40,060
BEFORE WE SET UP THE SHOT.

332
00:12:40,093 --> 00:12:43,363
HOPE I LOOK ALL RIGHT FOR
MY MEETING WITH THE SUN GOD.

333
00:12:49,002 --> 00:12:51,905
[LIGHTSABER HUMS]

334
00:12:51,938 --> 00:12:54,175
BOY, IT'S BLUE IN EGYPT.

335
00:12:54,208 --> 00:12:56,510
BLUER THAN I REMEMBER!

336
00:13:02,817 --> 00:13:05,152
I WOULD'VE BEEN SATISFIED
WITH A STORAGE LOCKER.

337
00:13:05,185 --> 00:13:08,055
THIS IS GREAT!

338
00:13:08,088 --> 00:13:10,958
TYPICAL NEW YORK
FIVE STORY WALK UP HERE.

339
00:13:12,425 --> 00:13:14,595
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
SURVIVOR!

340
00:13:17,097 --> 00:13:18,998
WE GOT ONE,
WE GOT ONE, WHOO!

341
00:13:19,032 --> 00:13:20,767
WHAT KIND OF A THING...
NUTTY THING...

342
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,737
WHOA!

343
00:13:26,540 --> 00:13:28,942
KISS KISS FROM THE ALIEN!

344
00:13:30,677 --> 00:13:31,912
DEAR MOM,

345
00:13:31,945 --> 00:13:34,582
I LANDED A BIG PART
IN A GOLAN-GLOBUS FILM.

346
00:13:34,615 --> 00:13:37,317
THEY'RE PAYING ME $35.

347
00:13:38,885 --> 00:13:40,087
DEAR MISS...

348
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,288
SAH...

349
00:13:41,322 --> 00:13:42,823
KANUMIN...

350
00:13:42,857 --> 00:13:46,427
SENUMNUMANUM.

351
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:48,495
THE PEOPLE OF ISTANBUL
REJECT YOU.

352
00:13:48,528 --> 00:13:50,430
THANK YOU FOR YOUR
INTEREST IN OUR COUNTRY.

353
00:13:54,668 --> 00:13:56,170
NEITHER RAIN NOR SLEET

354
00:13:56,203 --> 00:13:58,605
WHAT SLEET?
THAT'S GREAT GANJ, MAN.

355
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:05,545
COOL, A DC-3!

356
00:14:05,578 --> 00:14:06,947
FIRST ROLLED OFF
THE ASSEMBLY LINE

357
00:14:06,980 --> 00:14:08,182
IN 1936.

358
00:14:08,215 --> 00:14:09,783
OLDEST PASSENGER PLANE
STILL USED

359
00:14:09,817 --> 00:14:13,720
FOR REGULAR
COMMERCIAL SERVICE.

360
00:14:13,753 --> 00:14:15,188
OH, AND THAT'S
ONE OF THE FIRST

361
00:14:15,222 --> 00:14:16,423
FRONT-WHEEL-DRIVE
FORD VANS--

362
00:14:16,457 --> 00:14:18,492
SHUT UP, CROW. SHUT UP.

363
00:14:18,525 --> 00:14:20,593
HEY, DOWN IN FRONT.

364
00:14:24,465 --> 00:14:26,133
WOW, THAT GUY
RAN A LONG WAY.

365
00:14:26,167 --> 00:14:27,668
TURNED WHITE!

366
00:14:27,702 --> 00:14:28,968
PROBABLY A WHOLE
DIFFERENT PERSON.

367
00:14:29,002 --> 00:14:30,670
NOT COMPLETELY DIFFERENT.

368
00:14:30,703 --> 00:14:32,707
WANDA SAK... NUSSEMM?

369
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:34,442
NO, IT CLEARED UP,
BUT THANKS.

370
00:14:34,475 --> 00:14:35,910
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT.

371
00:14:35,943 --> 00:14:37,310
I BET IT'S MY
BROTHER-IN-LAW.

372
00:14:37,343 --> 00:14:38,478
YOU'RE WANDA SAKNUSSEMM?

373
00:14:38,512 --> 00:14:39,813
GOD, NO!

374
00:14:39,847 --> 00:14:41,348
--GET HER BUTT OUT HERE,
I NEED THOSE FOUR SHAKES.

375
00:14:41,382 --> 00:14:42,950
UH, SUSAN,
I HAD THE SALAD.

376
00:14:42,983 --> 00:14:45,018
I DID TOO, GWEN.

377
00:14:45,052 --> 00:14:47,822
- I'LL ORDER
THE CHEESEBURGER.
- THREE BURGERS.

378
00:14:47,855 --> 00:14:49,188
WOW, YOU'D FIGURE
A SUPERMODEL

379
00:14:49,222 --> 00:14:50,590
COULD AFFORD
A WHOLE SHIRT.

380
00:14:50,623 --> 00:14:53,093
OH, EXCUSE ME,
WANDA SAKNUSSEMM?

381
00:14:53,127 --> 00:14:54,495
WITH THE ANNOYING
VOICE AND ALL?

382
00:14:54,528 --> 00:14:56,463
UH, YEAH,
I'M WANDA SAKNUSSEMM.

383
00:14:56,497 --> 00:14:58,232
SPECIAL DELIVERY
FROM AFRICA.

384
00:14:58,265 --> 00:14:59,667
WOULD YOU LIKE
TO SIGN HERE, PLEASE?

385
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,235
WHAT A LOVELY
PLACE SETTING, OH.

386
00:15:01,268 --> 00:15:02,502
THERE WE GO.

387
00:15:02,535 --> 00:15:04,203
THERE'S A GOOD GIRL.

388
00:15:04,237 --> 00:15:06,940
DON'T BLOW IT, UH,
THERE WE GO.

389
00:15:06,973 --> 00:15:08,275
UH-- I DID IT!

390
00:15:08,308 --> 00:15:11,512
THAT'S GREAT,
THANKS VERY MUCH.

391
00:15:11,545 --> 00:15:12,980
RIGHT.

392
00:15:17,718 --> 00:15:19,587
THERE'S YOUR SPECIAL SAUCE.

393
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:22,623
$3.25 AN HOUR,
I'M GONNA SHOVE THIS JOB.

394
00:15:25,825 --> 00:15:27,493
THAT SIGN JUST
REALLY SEDUCES YOU

395
00:15:27,527 --> 00:15:29,463
INTO BUYING A BURGER,
DOESN'T IT?

396
00:15:29,497 --> 00:15:31,032
IT'S SO SMALL.

397
00:15:31,065 --> 00:15:32,867
OH, IT'S FOLDED!

398
00:15:32,900 --> 00:15:35,735
DEAR...WAN...DA.

399
00:15:35,768 --> 00:15:37,270
OH MY GOD.

400
00:15:37,303 --> 00:15:38,472
THREE SYLLABLES?

401
00:15:38,505 --> 00:15:40,573
WHAT'S THE MATTER?

402
00:15:40,607 --> 00:15:42,308
MY FATHER'S DEAD.

403
00:15:42,342 --> 00:15:44,378
THAT'S TOO BAD,
NOW PICK UP!

404
00:15:44,412 --> 00:15:46,513
SAYS HE FELL DOWN
A BOTTOMLESS PIT.

405
00:15:55,288 --> 00:15:56,823
DESPITE HER LACK
OF FLYING CREDENTIALS,

406
00:15:56,857 --> 00:15:59,058
WANDA PILOTS AWAY
ACROSS THE ATLANTIC.

407
00:15:59,092 --> 00:16:01,062
SEE, THAT'S THE BEAUTY
OF THE DC-3,

408
00:16:01,095 --> 00:16:02,528
ITS SPERRY GYROSCOPIC
AUTOPILOT MADE IT QUITE

409
00:16:02,562 --> 00:16:04,698
- ESSENTIAL FOR--
- SHUT YOUR CAKE HOLE.

410
00:16:04,732 --> 00:16:05,932
OH.

411
00:16:05,965 --> 00:16:07,133
HEY! IT'S THE BLUE MOSQUE.

412
00:16:07,167 --> 00:16:08,568
NO, THE BLUE MOSQUE
IS ON A HILL.

413
00:16:08,602 --> 00:16:09,837
HAVE YOU BEEN TO ISTANBUL?

414
00:16:09,870 --> 00:16:11,638
THIS ISN'T EVEN ISTANBUL!

415
00:16:11,672 --> 00:16:13,907
GOOD POINT.

416
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:15,875
THEY'RE BRINGING
STOOL SAMPLES TO THE DOCTOR.

417
00:16:15,908 --> 00:16:17,543
[BOTS CHUCKLE]

418
00:16:19,613 --> 00:16:21,848
[MAN WHISPERS]

419
00:16:21,882 --> 00:16:23,217
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.

420
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:24,885
HIS COLLEAGUES THOUGHT
HE WAS CRAZY.

421
00:16:24,918 --> 00:16:26,087
THEY LAUGHED AT HIM.

422
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,688
THEY LIKE HIS
OBSERVATIONAL STUFF.

423
00:16:27,722 --> 00:16:29,457
HE DEDICATED
THE REST OF HIS LIFE...

424
00:16:29,490 --> 00:16:31,958
STEPS! OKAY,
I CAN HANDLE STEPS.

425
00:16:31,992 --> 00:16:34,695
--SELF-RESPECT.

426
00:16:34,728 --> 00:16:36,163
JERRY GARCIA
TAKES HER BAGS.

427
00:16:36,197 --> 00:16:38,332
SO ALL THIS TIME,
HE'S BEEN SEARCHING

428
00:16:38,365 --> 00:16:40,500
FOR THE CENTER OF THE EARTH.

429
00:16:40,533 --> 00:16:41,835
YES.

430
00:16:41,868 --> 00:16:43,903
HIS EXCAVATION IS DOWN
IN THE BASEMENT.

431
00:16:43,937 --> 00:16:46,607
RIGHT NEXT
TO THE POOL TABLE.

432
00:16:49,610 --> 00:16:50,777
HEY, GRIZZLY ADAMS,

433
00:16:50,810 --> 00:16:51,978
YOU WAITING FOR A TIP
OR SOMETHING?

434
00:16:52,012 --> 00:16:54,882
- GET OUT OF HERE, YOU.
- HEY.

435
00:16:54,915 --> 00:16:57,017
- WHOA.
- DAD HAD A DAUGHTER!

436
00:16:57,050 --> 00:16:58,585
I'M SURPRISED TO SEE THIS.

437
00:16:58,618 --> 00:17:00,120
THAT'S HER
DRIVER'S LICENSE PHOTO.

438
00:17:00,153 --> 00:17:01,255
YOUR FATHER CARED
A LOT ABOUT YOU.

439
00:17:01,288 --> 00:17:03,090
WELL...

440
00:17:03,123 --> 00:17:04,425
THEY DRUGGED HER
TO DO THIS MOVIE.

441
00:17:04,458 --> 00:17:07,593
HE SURE SHOWED IT
IN A WEIRD WAY.

442
00:17:07,627 --> 00:17:09,763
- HE WAS A...
- RODEO CLOWN.

443
00:17:09,797 --> 00:17:12,365
...STRANGE MAN.

444
00:17:12,398 --> 00:17:14,267
I'VE BEEN THINKING TOO MUCH,
MY PUZZLER HURTS.

445
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:17,270
YOU LOOK LIKE YOU COULD
DO WITH SOME REST.

446
00:17:17,303 --> 00:17:18,505
BOY.

447
00:17:18,538 --> 00:17:19,607
SHE LOOKS LIKE COUSIN ITT.

448
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:22,708
IT WAS A LONG TRIP
TO AFRICA.

449
00:17:22,743 --> 00:17:26,147
ARGH, COME CLOSER,
ME WANDA, ARGH.

450
00:17:26,180 --> 00:17:28,315
BUT I'M GLAD
YOU INVITED ME,

451
00:17:28,348 --> 00:17:29,550
MR. MAHONEY.

452
00:17:29,583 --> 00:17:31,785
WHEN I SQUINT, YOU LOOK
LIKE IAN ANDERSON.

453
00:17:31,818 --> 00:17:33,253
IT'S PROBABLY THE ONLY
CHANCE I'LL HAVE

454
00:17:33,287 --> 00:17:34,922
TO GET TO KNOW HIM.

455
00:17:34,955 --> 00:17:37,523
DID THEY GIVE HER HASH
ON THE WAY OVER?

456
00:17:37,557 --> 00:17:40,893
HE LEFT SO LONG AGO.

457
00:17:40,927 --> 00:17:43,497
DID YOU TRY
TO FIND MY DAD?

458
00:17:43,530 --> 00:17:45,065
ARGH, GET BACK HERE,
KATHY GAL,

459
00:17:45,098 --> 00:17:47,200
WHERE YA GOING, SWEETIE?

460
00:17:47,233 --> 00:17:50,003
I GO DOWN THERE EVERY DAY.

461
00:17:50,037 --> 00:17:52,005
LOOK FOR HIM.

462
00:17:52,038 --> 00:17:55,175
- IT ALL SEEMS SO UNLIKELY.
- [SERVO SNORES]

463
00:17:55,208 --> 00:17:56,610
YEAH, THAT'S GREAT, CLAUDE.

464
00:17:56,643 --> 00:17:59,045
SHE'S PROBABLY TIRED,
COULD YOU GET OUT OF THE ROOM?

465
00:17:59,078 --> 00:18:01,215
I WOULD'VE GIVEN ANYTHING

466
00:18:01,248 --> 00:18:02,817
TO SEE HIM AGAIN.

467
00:18:02,850 --> 00:18:05,685
EXCEPT PANCAKES.

468
00:18:05,718 --> 00:18:08,255
DO YOU NEED TO GO HORSIES
BEFORE YOU GO TO BED?

469
00:18:09,790 --> 00:18:11,492
WELL, ANYWAY,
I'VE GOT TO GO.

470
00:18:11,525 --> 00:18:13,593
I'VE GOT TO FINISH TIE-DYING
MY BEDSPREAD UPSTAIRS.

471
00:18:13,627 --> 00:18:15,862
STAR WOLF LEFT SOME
SOY MILK IN THE FRIDGE

472
00:18:15,895 --> 00:18:17,730
AND SOME TOFU.

473
00:18:18,998 --> 00:18:20,833
SWEET DREAMS, WANDA.

474
00:18:20,867 --> 00:18:22,735
GOT A GUIDEBOOK
FOR GREATER ISTANBUL

475
00:18:22,768 --> 00:18:23,903
UPSTAIRS, IF YOU WANT.

476
00:18:23,937 --> 00:18:25,872
WELL, I'LL JUST
LET YOU SLEEP.

477
00:18:29,777 --> 00:18:32,980
AND SHE SLEEPS FOR
A THOUSAND YEARS!

478
00:18:38,652 --> 00:18:40,420
HAUNTED SUN PORCH!

479
00:18:40,453 --> 00:18:42,522
AAH! SWIMSUIT ISSUE!

480
00:18:44,525 --> 00:18:47,360
THE WHOLE WORLD
SMELLS LIKE MY EYES.

481
00:18:49,162 --> 00:18:51,063
SAIGON. SHUCKS.

482
00:18:51,097 --> 00:18:53,100
I CAN'T BELIEVE
I'M STILL IN SAIGON.

483
00:18:56,503 --> 00:18:58,272
DAD'S YEARBOOK!

484
00:18:58,305 --> 00:18:59,607
HE WAS VOTED MOST LIKELY

485
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,073
TO HAVE AN ANNOYING
DAUGHTER!

486
00:19:01,107 --> 00:19:03,777
MAN'S ULTIMATE ANCESTORS

487
00:19:03,810 --> 00:19:05,912
WERE ALIENS

488
00:19:05,945 --> 00:19:08,748
KNOWN AS ATLANTEANS.

489
00:19:08,782 --> 00:19:09,817
DON'T LAUGH.

490
00:19:09,850 --> 00:19:10,983
NO, THAT'S
A STAGE DIRECTION!

491
00:19:11,017 --> 00:19:12,418
THEY ARRIVED ON EARTH

492
00:19:12,452 --> 00:19:14,622
WITH THE IDEA
OF COLONIZING.

493
00:19:14,655 --> 00:19:16,088
BUT THEY COULDN'T
GET GREEN CARDS.

494
00:19:16,122 --> 00:19:18,558
THE ATLANTEANS'
GIANT SPACESHIP

495
00:19:18,592 --> 00:19:20,960
SERVED AS THEIR
FLOATING CITY.

496
00:19:20,993 --> 00:19:23,530
ACTING'S EASY WHEN YOU
CAN READ YOUR LINES!

497
00:19:23,563 --> 00:19:25,032
--INTO THE BOWELS
OF THE EARTH,

498
00:19:25,065 --> 00:19:27,133
DURING A VOLCANIC
CATASTROPHE.

499
00:19:27,167 --> 00:19:30,403
KATHY, KATHY,
WE'RE FILMING, KATHY.

500
00:19:30,437 --> 00:19:32,705
--BUT PERHAPS,

501
00:19:32,738 --> 00:19:35,142
NOT THE ATLANTEAN PEOPLE.

502
00:19:35,175 --> 00:19:37,610
SO, DAD WAS A DELUSIONAL
PSYCHOTIC.

503
00:19:37,643 --> 00:19:40,380
THEY MIGHT STILL LIVE

504
00:19:40,413 --> 00:19:42,048
AT THE CENTER

505
00:19:42,082 --> 00:19:44,283
OF THE EARTH.

506
00:19:44,317 --> 00:19:45,452
I DON'T GET IT.

507
00:19:45,485 --> 00:19:48,155
WHAT'S HIS POINT?

508
00:19:48,188 --> 00:19:50,290
TOO HEAVY, DAD.

509
00:19:55,262 --> 00:19:57,763
HEY, IT'S A CULTURE THAT
WORSHIPS JOHN CANDY.

510
00:19:57,797 --> 00:20:00,567
AND LOOK, UP THERE,
NICK BOCKWINKLE'S BELT BUCKLE.

511
00:20:03,470 --> 00:20:05,038
UH, KATHY, IT'S YOUR DAD,

512
00:20:05,072 --> 00:20:08,075
I NEED SOME
TOILET PAPER IN HERE.

513
00:20:08,108 --> 00:20:10,043
UM, THIS DOOR
SOUNDS BROWN.

514
00:20:12,745 --> 00:20:14,280
OH, I'M DISAPPOINTED.

515
00:20:14,313 --> 00:20:16,917
NOT WHAT I EXPECTED AT ALL.

516
00:20:16,950 --> 00:20:18,485
HELLO?

517
00:20:18,518 --> 00:20:22,022
MR. GOLAN-GLOBUS, THIS
ACTING STUFF IS HARD!

518
00:20:23,623 --> 00:20:26,760
I HAVE A RESERVATION
FOR 8:30.

519
00:20:30,963 --> 00:20:32,832
OH, NOW THIS
IS THE KATHY IRELAND

520
00:20:32,865 --> 00:20:33,933
I KNOW AND LOVE.

521
00:20:33,967 --> 00:20:36,102
- HUNGA HUN--
- HEY, HEY HEY.

522
00:20:36,135 --> 00:20:37,137
- HEY, HEY.
- SORRY.

523
00:20:37,170 --> 00:20:39,338
WHOA!

524
00:20:39,372 --> 00:20:42,008
THAT'S A GUY.

525
00:20:42,042 --> 00:20:43,977
THAT'S NOT.

526
00:20:48,548 --> 00:20:50,483
THE ORIGINAL
FILENE'S BASEMENT.

527
00:20:52,485 --> 00:20:54,387
WHERE'S THE STORE
DIRECTORY?

528
00:20:56,957 --> 00:20:58,625
♪ HAS ANYBODY HERE ♪

529
00:20:58,658 --> 00:21:01,060
♪ SEE MY OLD FRIEND JOHN? ♪

530
00:21:03,997 --> 00:21:05,032
HMM?

531
00:21:05,065 --> 00:21:08,368
[BOTS COUGH]

532
00:21:08,402 --> 00:21:09,637
JANET LEIGH?

533
00:21:09,670 --> 00:21:12,072
WHY DID DAD HAVE A PICTURE
OF JANET LEIGH?

534
00:21:14,875 --> 00:21:17,010
MAYBE I SHOULD DO THAT
WITH MY HAIR.

535
00:21:17,043 --> 00:21:19,612
YOU KNOW, GET A BOB.

536
00:21:19,647 --> 00:21:20,880
HELLO?

537
00:21:20,913 --> 00:21:22,115
WHAT ARE YOU DOING
BEHIND THAT GLASS?

538
00:21:22,148 --> 00:21:23,817
YOU LOOK SO SMALL.

539
00:21:27,453 --> 00:21:28,822
I LIKE ACTING.

540
00:21:28,855 --> 00:21:31,492
ESPECIALLY THE SCENES
WHEN I DON'T HAVE TO TALK.

541
00:21:32,858 --> 00:21:36,095
ANDY? HELEN?
ARE YOU IN THERE?

542
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,775
SHORT ROUND,
GET ME MY STUFF.

543
00:21:54,413 --> 00:21:56,550
THIS IS KATHY IRELAND
FOR COLEMAN LANTERNS.

544
00:21:56,583 --> 00:21:58,718
[CROW GIGGLES]

545
00:21:58,752 --> 00:22:00,553
WELL, IT WAS ROUND
ABOUT THAT TIME

546
00:22:00,587 --> 00:22:01,922
OLD KATHY IRELAND WENT

547
00:22:01,955 --> 00:22:03,357
A-BURROWIN' FOR SAFETY

548
00:22:03,390 --> 00:22:06,092
DEEP IN THE BOWELS
OF THE EARTH.

549
00:22:06,125 --> 00:22:09,062
- THE HOT INDIANA JONES
CHRONICLES.
- DAD?

550
00:22:10,930 --> 00:22:13,267
OH, LOOK WHAT DAD
DID WITH THE PANELING.

551
00:22:13,300 --> 00:22:15,902
VERY NICE!

552
00:22:20,807 --> 00:22:22,575
[ROCKS CLATTER]

553
00:22:22,608 --> 00:22:24,010
DAD?

554
00:22:24,043 --> 00:22:25,612
LOOK, YOUR DAD'S
NOT RESPONSIBLE

555
00:22:25,645 --> 00:22:28,348
FOR EVERYTHING THAT
HAPPENS IN THE WORLD.

556
00:22:33,587 --> 00:22:35,688
<i>LOOKING FOR MR. GOOD-DAD.</i>

557
00:22:44,832 --> 00:22:46,400
STEP OUT OF THE CAR, PLEASE.

558
00:22:46,433 --> 00:22:47,933
[GIGGLES] IT'S FUN.

559
00:22:51,538 --> 00:22:53,173
THAT DOESN'T GO
WITH MY OUTFIT.

560
00:22:53,207 --> 00:22:55,308
EW.

561
00:22:55,342 --> 00:22:57,277
OOH, BOWLING.

562
00:22:57,310 --> 00:22:59,012
- OH BOY.
- EXCUSE ME, PARDON ME.

563
00:22:59,045 --> 00:23:00,913
- OH, I'M A PERFECT FOOL.
- CRIMINY.

564
00:23:00,947 --> 00:23:02,715
AAH!

565
00:23:02,748 --> 00:23:05,285
IT'S SO IMPLAUSIBLE, AAH!

566
00:23:05,318 --> 00:23:08,822
RUBE GOLDBERG.

567
00:23:08,855 --> 00:23:11,357
- MOUSE TRAP.
- KATHY, WATCH YOUR MOUTH.

568
00:23:13,360 --> 00:23:15,795
GOOD ONE, KATHY.

569
00:23:15,828 --> 00:23:18,598
[WANDA SCREAMS]

570
00:23:18,632 --> 00:23:21,333
AAH AAH AAH! ...AAH.

571
00:23:25,205 --> 00:23:28,007
DON'T LOOK AT MY
UNDERPAAAANTS!

572
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:30,510
AM I IN <i>VERTIGO </i>NOOOOW?

573
00:23:35,548 --> 00:23:38,152
WHOOPS, SHE POOTED.

574
00:23:38,185 --> 00:23:40,787
SHE'S HAVING A MEETING WITH
WILE E. COYOTE DOWN THERE.

575
00:23:42,622 --> 00:23:43,823
KATHY?

576
00:23:43,857 --> 00:23:46,292
HELLO?

577
00:23:46,325 --> 00:23:47,627
KATHY?

578
00:23:47,660 --> 00:23:49,997
KATHY?

579
00:23:50,030 --> 00:23:52,465
OH POO, I'M IN
THE PIT OF HELL.

580
00:23:55,202 --> 00:23:57,370
OH, NOW I'M GONNA
HAVE TO THINK SOME MORE.

581
00:23:59,873 --> 00:24:02,675
IF THIS KEEPS UP, SHE'LL NEVER
MAKE IT ON <i>DOWN THE SHORE.</i>

582
00:24:02,708 --> 00:24:04,643
DAD, IS THAT YOU?

583
00:24:07,280 --> 00:24:10,217
OH, TELL THE PROP PEOPLE
TO CUT THAT OUT!

584
00:24:12,952 --> 00:24:14,720
OH, A PLAGUE UPON
THIS HOWLING.

585
00:24:14,753 --> 00:24:17,623
THEY ARE LOUDER THAN
THE WEATHER OR OUR OFFICE.

586
00:24:33,340 --> 00:24:34,440
BOY, YOU KNOW,
THAT KATHY IRELAND.

587
00:24:34,473 --> 00:24:36,142
SHE'S GOT A REAL
CUTE SHAPE, DOESN'T SHE?

588
00:24:36,175 --> 00:24:37,810
YEAH, YEAH, KIND OF
REMINDS ME OF THAT ONE MODEL.

589
00:24:37,843 --> 00:24:39,212
YOU KNOW, TALLISH ONE.

590
00:24:39,245 --> 00:24:40,713
UM, WHO, ELLE MACPHERSON?

591
00:24:40,747 --> 00:24:42,248
NO, NO NO NO,
I'M THINKING OF THAT ONE,

592
00:24:42,282 --> 00:24:43,817
YOU SEE HER ON
THE MAGAZINES AND ALL.

593
00:24:43,850 --> 00:24:45,452
OH, I KNOW WHO
YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.

594
00:24:45,485 --> 00:24:46,853
CLAUDIA SCHIFFER.

595
00:24:46,887 --> 00:24:49,155
NO, NO NO, I SEE HER
ON THE TV PROGRAM.

596
00:24:49,188 --> 00:24:50,457
YOU KNOW, THAT YOU
SEE ON THE TV?

597
00:24:50,490 --> 00:24:51,558
- RIGHT, RIGHT.
- OH!

598
00:24:51,592 --> 00:24:52,692
YOU MEAN IMAN?

599
00:24:52,725 --> 00:24:54,027
NO, NO NO,
THIS ONE'S REAL--

600
00:24:54,060 --> 00:24:55,528
GOT A PRETTY HAIR THING
GOING, YOU KNOW?

601
00:24:55,562 --> 00:24:56,730
- YEAH.
- REAL WHITE TEETH AND SUCH.

602
00:24:56,763 --> 00:24:57,930
OH, JILL GOODACRE.

603
00:24:57,963 --> 00:24:59,698
NO NO-NO-NO,
COME ON, THIS ONE

604
00:24:59,732 --> 00:25:01,400
THIS ONE WEARS ALL THOSE
FASHIONS AND WHATNOT.

605
00:25:01,433 --> 00:25:03,370
- YEAH.
- UH, SOUNDS MAYBE LIKE

606
00:25:03,403 --> 00:25:05,472
EILEEN FORD
OR JOHN CASABLANCAS.

607
00:25:05,505 --> 00:25:07,473
OH, I CAN JUST SEE HER,
YOU KNOW, SHE'S IN THAT VIDEO,

608
00:25:07,507 --> 00:25:09,175
AND SHE'S GOT, LIKE,
A STRANGE NAME.

609
00:25:09,208 --> 00:25:10,610
UH, YEAH YEAH,
SORT OF FOREIGN,

610
00:25:10,643 --> 00:25:12,745
LIKE, UH, MAYBE FROM GERMANY
OR ENGLAND OR SOMETHING.

611
00:25:12,778 --> 00:25:14,147
LINDA EVANGELISTA?

612
00:25:14,180 --> 00:25:15,782
- NO.
- NO NO NO.

613
00:25:15,815 --> 00:25:17,717
UH, CAROL ALT?

614
00:25:17,750 --> 00:25:19,485
YASMINE? KATE MOSS?

615
00:25:19,518 --> 00:25:20,953
KRISTIN MCMENAMY? STOP ME.

616
00:25:20,987 --> 00:25:22,288
NO NO, THE NAME'S
KIND OF LIKE A BREAD.

617
00:25:22,322 --> 00:25:25,225
I'M THINKING IT'S LIKE
CLANILLA OR PLANTAGENET.

618
00:25:25,258 --> 00:25:27,127
MM-HMM, YEAH YEAH YEAH,
BUT BOY IS SHE PRETTY, THOUGH.

619
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:28,328
OH, REAL PRETTY.

620
00:25:28,362 --> 00:25:30,130
WELL, IS SHE, LIKE,
70'S SWIMSUIT TYPE?

621
00:25:30,163 --> 00:25:32,932
LIKE CHERYL TIEGS-IAN
OR FAWCETT-IAN?

622
00:25:32,965 --> 00:25:34,333
NO? IS SHE-- IS SHE MORE

623
00:25:34,367 --> 00:25:35,935
LAUREN HUTTON,
CROSSOVER TYPE,

624
00:25:35,968 --> 00:25:37,337
OR BEVERLY JOHNSON-ESQUE?

625
00:25:37,370 --> 00:25:38,872
- NO WAY.
- NAH, I THINK SHE'S
MORE MODERN.

626
00:25:38,905 --> 00:25:40,707
SHE'S ALWAYS WEARING SOMETHING
DIFFERENT, YOU KNOW.

627
00:25:40,740 --> 00:25:42,408
KIND OF HAS A DIFFERENT
HAIR THING GOING.

628
00:25:42,442 --> 00:25:43,943
WELL, IS SHE, LIKE,
PARISIAN WAIF-ISH?

629
00:25:43,977 --> 00:25:45,912
NO EYEBROWS?
ANDROGYNOUS TYPE?

630
00:25:45,945 --> 00:25:48,748
- HMMM, NO.
- 90'S, SUPERBRAD,
HOUSE OF STYLE?

631
00:25:48,782 --> 00:25:50,350
NO, BUT I SAW HER ONCE
ON THAT TALK SHOW,

632
00:25:50,383 --> 00:25:51,785
AND SHE SEEMED REAL NICE.

633
00:25:51,818 --> 00:25:53,218
CHRISTY TURLINGTON.

634
00:25:53,253 --> 00:25:54,988
NO NO, SHE'S IN THOSE ADS,
WEARING THOSE UNDERPANTS.

635
00:25:55,022 --> 00:25:56,155
OH YEAH, YEAH,
THAT'S RIGHT.

636
00:25:56,188 --> 00:25:58,425
RACHEL HUNTER?
JERRY HALL? KIM ALEXIS?

637
00:25:58,458 --> 00:26:01,193
NO NO, THAT BAND SINGS TO HER,
ON THAT VIDEO, ON TV.

638
00:26:01,227 --> 00:26:02,695
UH, CINDY CRAWFORD,
NIKI TAYLOR.

639
00:26:02,728 --> 00:26:04,163
- NO.
- COVER GIRL NIKI TAYLOR.

640
00:26:04,197 --> 00:26:05,265
I'VE GOT IT, I'VE GOT IT.

641
00:26:05,298 --> 00:26:06,365
- WHO?
- WHO?

642
00:26:06,398 --> 00:26:08,335
- IT'S CLARA PELLER.
- YEAH.

643
00:26:08,368 --> 00:26:09,868
THAT IS NOT CLARA PELLER.

644
00:26:09,902 --> 00:26:11,805
NOPE, NO, I REMEMBER,
THAT'S IT, CLARA PELLER.

645
00:26:11,838 --> 00:26:13,507
IT'S NOT CLARA PELLER,
CLARA PELLER'S

646
00:26:13,540 --> 00:26:14,873
THE "WHERE'S THE BEEF"
LADY, REMEMBER?

647
00:26:14,907 --> 00:26:16,342
SHE'S BEEN DEAD FOR
A COUPLE OF YEARS.

648
00:26:16,375 --> 00:26:17,610
NO, MIKE, I THINK
CROW'S RIGHT.

649
00:26:17,643 --> 00:26:19,078
I REMEMBER SEEING
THAT CLARA PELLER

650
00:26:19,112 --> 00:26:20,413
IN HER UNDERPANTS
ON THAT VIDEO.

651
00:26:20,447 --> 00:26:22,082
LOOK, WE'LL BE BACK UNTIL
WE STRAIGHTEN THIS OUT.

652
00:26:22,115 --> 00:26:23,883
YOU DID NOT SEE CLARA PELLER
IN HER UNDERPANTS!

653
00:26:23,917 --> 00:26:25,252
- I DID TOO!
- THAT'S IMPOSSIBLE!

654
00:26:25,285 --> 00:26:26,920
- I DID TOO!
- YOW!

655
00:26:34,293 --> 00:26:35,595
YEP, CLARA PELLER.

656
00:26:35,628 --> 00:26:37,097
NO, SHE'S-- NO.

657
00:26:37,130 --> 00:26:38,998
YOU-- SHE WASN'T
WETTING HER LIPS, NO.

658
00:26:39,032 --> 00:26:41,000
WHAT, IS THIS <i>SAD MAX?</i>

659
00:26:44,670 --> 00:26:46,105
OH, HE'S FROM
THE ORKIN ARMY,

660
00:26:46,138 --> 00:26:47,873
AND SOMETHING HAPPENED.

661
00:26:47,907 --> 00:26:50,210
IT WON'T BE EASY TRYING
TO STEAL MY CLAIM.

662
00:26:50,243 --> 00:26:51,745
CAUSE I'M AUSTRALIAN.

663
00:26:51,778 --> 00:26:54,480
GUESS YOU'RE GONNA
HAVE TO PLUG ME FOR IT.

664
00:26:54,513 --> 00:26:57,117
LIVIU CIULEI DIRECTS
<i>OUR TOWN </i>AT THE GUTHRIE.

665
00:26:57,150 --> 00:26:58,685
LOOKS EASY TO ME!

666
00:26:58,718 --> 00:27:01,087
ONE YANK OF THE TRIGGER,
AND YOU DIE!

667
00:27:01,120 --> 00:27:02,555
I GOTTA DO SOMETHING.

668
00:27:02,588 --> 00:27:03,990
IRON MY PANTS? NO.

669
00:27:04,023 --> 00:27:05,258
REDO MY EYELINER? NO, NO,

670
00:27:05,292 --> 00:27:07,193
THAT'S NOT IT, THINK!

671
00:27:07,227 --> 00:27:09,262
TELL US WHERE
THE MAIN VEIN IS!

672
00:27:09,295 --> 00:27:10,730
NO.

673
00:27:10,763 --> 00:27:12,065
TELL US!

674
00:27:12,098 --> 00:27:14,833
PLEASE? COME ON!

675
00:27:14,867 --> 00:27:16,235
OH!

676
00:27:16,268 --> 00:27:18,070
OH, LOOK AT THAT!

677
00:27:18,103 --> 00:27:19,972
I DID SOMETHING!

678
00:27:22,408 --> 00:27:25,578
<i>HOME ALONE 3!</i>
<i>THE DESTRUCTION OF JARED-SYN.</i>

679
00:27:35,488 --> 00:27:38,290
OH, RIGHT, WE WAIT ALL
THIS TIME TO SEE BLOOMERS?

680
00:27:40,093 --> 00:27:42,828
DAD?

681
00:27:42,862 --> 00:27:45,065
UH, DIDN'T YOU
WAIT ON ME ONE TIME?

682
00:27:45,098 --> 00:27:46,398
YOU OKAY?

683
00:27:46,432 --> 00:27:48,535
MY BOYFRIEND SAYS I HAVE
UGLY HAIR AND A WEIRD VOICE--

684
00:27:48,568 --> 00:27:51,838
I'M OKAY, ARE YOU OKAY?

685
00:27:51,872 --> 00:27:54,273
YEAH, PLEASE DON'T EVER
OPEN YOUR MOUTH AGAIN.

686
00:27:57,743 --> 00:28:00,813
ARE YOU GONNA HURT THEM?

687
00:28:00,847 --> 00:28:02,215
- WHY NOT?
- I'M AUSTRALIAN, SEE?

688
00:28:02,248 --> 00:28:05,285
BECAUSE IT'S NOT RIGHT.

689
00:28:05,318 --> 00:28:06,820
OR NICE.

690
00:28:06,853 --> 00:28:09,088
THEY'LL KILL ME
IF I DON'T.

691
00:28:09,122 --> 00:28:10,290
YOU KNOW, IN AUSTRALIA,

692
00:28:10,323 --> 00:28:12,258
MY VOICE IS AS
ANNOYING AS YOURS.

693
00:28:12,292 --> 00:28:14,293
--MISTER.

694
00:28:16,128 --> 00:28:19,398
WELL, LOOK, I GOTTA
KILL SOMEBODY.

695
00:28:19,432 --> 00:28:21,233
I'D BETTER NOT
REGRET THIS.

696
00:28:21,267 --> 00:28:23,202
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
WE PROVIDE THE SCENES.

697
00:28:23,235 --> 00:28:26,973
YOU PROVIDE
THE MOTIVATION!

698
00:28:27,007 --> 00:28:28,842
WHAT'S THAT?

699
00:28:28,875 --> 00:28:30,843
WHAT IT LOOKS LIKE,
A TROLL-MULE.

700
00:28:30,877 --> 00:28:33,078
- IT'S DONALD PLEASENCE.
- THEY KILLED HIM?

701
00:28:33,112 --> 00:28:35,148
NO, IT'S HIBERNATING.

702
00:28:35,182 --> 00:28:37,183
- COME ON.
- WELL, THAT MAKES IT-- HUH?

703
00:28:38,350 --> 00:28:40,420
WHERE ARE WE?

704
00:28:40,453 --> 00:28:42,388
ATLANTIS, WHERE ELSE?

705
00:28:42,422 --> 00:28:44,157
CAN WE GO TO CNN CENTER?

706
00:28:44,190 --> 00:28:45,625
CAN I MEET TED TURNER?

707
00:28:45,658 --> 00:28:48,260
- THE BRAVES PLAYING?
- ATLANTIS?

708
00:28:48,293 --> 00:28:49,662
UH-OH, I JUST REALIZED

709
00:28:49,695 --> 00:28:51,730
I HAVE MASSIVE
INTERNAL BLEEDING.

710
00:28:51,765 --> 00:28:54,600
THAT'S IMPOSSIBLE.

711
00:28:54,633 --> 00:28:56,068
ISN'T IT?

712
00:28:56,102 --> 00:28:57,703
WHERE DID YOU
THINK WE WERE?

713
00:28:57,737 --> 00:28:59,272
JUST TRYING
TO LOOK BUSY HERE.

714
00:28:59,305 --> 00:29:00,373
I'M AUSTRALIAN.

715
00:29:00,407 --> 00:29:02,708
YOU REALLY LIVE
UNDERGROUND, DON'T YOU?

716
00:29:02,742 --> 00:29:04,577
GROUND.

717
00:29:04,610 --> 00:29:05,845
DON'T YOU?

718
00:29:05,878 --> 00:29:07,580
DO YOU HAVE
PEARLE-VISION HERE?

719
00:29:07,613 --> 00:29:10,183
YEAH, SURE.

720
00:29:10,217 --> 00:29:12,218
OF COURSE.

721
00:29:16,522 --> 00:29:18,290
I'M LOOKING FOR MY DAD.

722
00:29:18,323 --> 00:29:19,758
I LEFT HIM
BY THE TACO STAND,

723
00:29:19,792 --> 00:29:21,660
AND NOW I CAN'T FIND HIM.

724
00:29:21,693 --> 00:29:24,230
AND I GUESS
HE'S IN ATLANTIS.

725
00:29:24,263 --> 00:29:26,132
AND I DON'T KNOW
WHERE TO START.

726
00:29:26,165 --> 00:29:28,502
♪ LET'S START
AT THE VERY BEGINNING ♪

727
00:29:28,535 --> 00:29:31,603
WELL, THIS IS THE ATLANTIS
WASTELAND.

728
00:29:31,637 --> 00:29:35,242
EW, HE JUST KISSED
A HAMBURGER WRAPPER.

729
00:29:35,275 --> 00:29:36,943
IT'S A DAY'S RIDE.

730
00:29:36,977 --> 00:29:40,480
WE PRIZE JUJUBES.

731
00:29:40,513 --> 00:29:42,482
DO YOU HAVE ANY PERT PLUS?

732
00:29:42,515 --> 00:29:46,018
YOU'RE NOT GONNA LEAVE ME
HERE WITH THESE GUYS?

733
00:29:46,052 --> 00:29:47,353
LOOK, I GOTTA
BOUNCE TO THE CITY

734
00:29:47,387 --> 00:29:48,522
TO FILE MY CLAIM

735
00:29:48,555 --> 00:29:50,390
BEFORE SOMEBODY ELSE
TRIES TO STEAL IT.

736
00:29:50,423 --> 00:29:52,258
THANKS A LOT FOR
HELPING ME OUT,

737
00:29:52,292 --> 00:29:53,560
BUT SEE YOU LATER.

738
00:29:53,593 --> 00:29:55,328
- AGAIN, I'M AUSTRALIAN.
- HEY, WAIT A MINUTE!

739
00:29:55,362 --> 00:29:56,562
YOU OWE ME, DON'T YOU?

740
00:29:56,595 --> 00:29:57,730
WHOA, THAT'S A SWITCHEROO.

741
00:29:57,763 --> 00:29:59,298
I COULD HAVE
LET THEM KILL YOU.

742
00:29:59,332 --> 00:30:00,867
BUT I DIDN'T, DID I?

743
00:30:00,900 --> 00:30:02,735
NO, I SAVED YOUR LIFE.

744
00:30:02,768 --> 00:30:04,170
[ALL] SHUT UP!

745
00:30:04,203 --> 00:30:06,005
- PLEASE.
- WOULD YOU AT LEAST
TAKE ME TO ATLANTIS?

746
00:30:06,038 --> 00:30:07,307
I MEAN,

747
00:30:07,340 --> 00:30:10,075
THAT'S NOT ASKING
A LOT, AFTER ALL.

748
00:30:10,108 --> 00:30:11,310
IS IT?

749
00:30:11,343 --> 00:30:14,347
YOU WORE THAT SEASHELL
BIKINI, DIDN'T YOU?

750
00:30:14,380 --> 00:30:16,615
OKAY.

751
00:30:16,648 --> 00:30:17,917
[CAR WHIRS]

752
00:30:17,950 --> 00:30:19,252
WELL, GET IN.

753
00:30:19,285 --> 00:30:22,155
WHEN YOU HEARD THAT NOISE,
I WAS TURNING IT ON, SEE.

754
00:30:22,188 --> 00:30:24,390
YOU KNOW, IF GANDALF HAD
ONE OF THOSE VEHICLES,

755
00:30:24,423 --> 00:30:27,660
HE'D NEVER HAVE DIED
AT THE HANDS OF THE BALROG.

756
00:30:27,693 --> 00:30:29,562
WHOA! IT'S A SAMURAI.

757
00:30:29,595 --> 00:30:31,330
[WANDA MOANS]

758
00:30:31,363 --> 00:30:34,267
THAT WAS WONDERFUL.

759
00:30:34,300 --> 00:30:36,903
WHOOPS.

760
00:30:36,937 --> 00:30:38,003
DO YOU NEED--

761
00:30:38,037 --> 00:30:40,072
UH, I'M SORRY, MISTER.

762
00:30:40,105 --> 00:30:41,875
CAN I GIVE YOU
MONEY FOR GAS?

763
00:30:41,908 --> 00:30:43,610
- WILL THAT HELP?
- COME ON.

764
00:30:43,643 --> 00:30:44,710
GET IN.

765
00:30:44,743 --> 00:30:46,712
OR "ON," ACTUALLY.

766
00:30:49,548 --> 00:30:51,417
WAIT A SECOND.

767
00:30:51,450 --> 00:30:55,222
GET IN ON THAT SIDE.

768
00:30:55,255 --> 00:30:58,190
WOULD YOU GET IN OVER THERE,
PLEASE, STANLEY?

769
00:31:01,928 --> 00:31:04,663
TIRES LOOK LIKE
ACORN SQUASH.

770
00:31:04,697 --> 00:31:06,365
- [BOTS HUM]
- BETTER PUT THESE ON.

771
00:31:06,398 --> 00:31:08,333
GETS KIND OF MUDDY
OUT HERE.

772
00:31:08,367 --> 00:31:10,603
OH, SORRY, I WASN'T AUSTRALIAN
THERE FOR A SECOND.

773
00:31:10,637 --> 00:31:12,572
COME ON, SWEETHEART.

774
00:31:12,605 --> 00:31:14,607
- [MAN MUTTERS]
- MY GLASSES.

775
00:31:14,640 --> 00:31:17,777
OH, THERE THEY ARE! OKAY.

776
00:31:17,810 --> 00:31:19,612
WHERE ARE YOU FROM, ANYWAY?

777
00:31:19,645 --> 00:31:20,947
LONG STORY.

778
00:31:20,980 --> 00:31:23,850
THEY'RE IN SCHLEP CAR.

779
00:31:23,883 --> 00:31:25,818
[SERVO HUMS]

780
00:31:28,087 --> 00:31:31,390
[WANDA WHIMPERS]

781
00:31:31,423 --> 00:31:32,458
SHUT UP! SHUT UP!

782
00:31:32,492 --> 00:31:33,492
SHUT UP! SHUT UP!

783
00:31:33,525 --> 00:31:34,660
SHUT UP! SHUT UP!
SHUT UP! SHUT UP!

784
00:31:34,693 --> 00:31:36,128
...DEAD OR ALIVE OR WHAT.

785
00:31:36,162 --> 00:31:38,397
- SHUT UP.
- THEN I GOT UP, SO
I REALIZED I WAS ALIVE.

786
00:31:38,430 --> 00:31:39,665
- SHUT UP.
- AND I WAS OKAY,

787
00:31:39,698 --> 00:31:42,835
SO I STARTED MOVING AROUND,
AND IT WAS REALLY SCARY.

788
00:31:42,868 --> 00:31:45,738
HERE, PUT THIS HOSE
IN YOUR MOUTH.

789
00:31:45,772 --> 00:31:48,307
BUT THEN I STUMBLED ONTO YOU
AND THOSE TWO OTHER GUYS.

790
00:31:48,340 --> 00:31:50,543
AND THEN I SAVED YOUR LIFE.

791
00:31:50,577 --> 00:31:52,045
DOES THAT
CLEAR IT UP FOR YOU?

792
00:31:52,078 --> 00:31:53,980
- WE ARE DEVO!
- YEAH, SURE.

793
00:31:54,013 --> 00:31:56,315
YOU'RE FROM A SURFACE
WORLD PLACE CALLED L.A.,

794
00:31:56,348 --> 00:31:58,785
AND YOU'RE IN ATLANTIS,
LOOKING FOR YOUR DAD.

795
00:32:00,620 --> 00:32:03,422
SISTER, YOU'RE CRAZY.

796
00:32:03,455 --> 00:32:05,925
- WELL, YOU'RE STUPID.
- YOU THINK I'M LYING?

797
00:32:05,958 --> 00:32:07,260
I THINK YOU BELIEVE IT.

798
00:32:07,293 --> 00:32:09,662
HEY, DO THEY HAVE ANY
RAY STEVENS TAPES HERE?

799
00:32:09,695 --> 00:32:11,297
I CAN'T BELIEVE YOU'D THINK

800
00:32:11,330 --> 00:32:13,465
I'D ACTUALLY MAKE UP
A STORY LIKE THAT.

801
00:32:13,498 --> 00:32:17,137
YOU LIVE WHATEVER
DREAM YOU WANT.

802
00:32:17,170 --> 00:32:18,738
NONE OF MY BUSINESS.

803
00:32:22,242 --> 00:32:24,777
AND A PACK OF MARLBORO BOX
IF YOU GOT THEM.

804
00:32:24,810 --> 00:32:27,280
[ROBOT MUTTERS]

805
00:32:27,313 --> 00:32:29,015
OOH, NICE SERVICE
UNDERGROUND.

806
00:32:31,650 --> 00:32:33,352
THANKS, BIG SPENDER.

807
00:32:33,385 --> 00:32:34,687
BOY.

808
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:37,323
- WOW, 99 FOR UNLEADED!
- OKAY, COME ON BABY.

809
00:32:41,060 --> 00:32:42,328
AAH-AAH-AAH!

810
00:32:42,362 --> 00:32:45,832
DON'T RIDE THE WILD MOUSE,
IT'S NOT SAFE!

811
00:32:45,865 --> 00:32:48,300
--YOU'RE ASKING
FOR TROUBLE.

812
00:32:48,333 --> 00:32:50,603
[MIKE MUMBLES]

813
00:32:50,637 --> 00:32:52,338
--YOU'RE AN ALIEN.

814
00:32:52,372 --> 00:32:54,873
♪ CHICKS AND DUCKS AND GEESE
BETTER SCURRY ♪

815
00:32:54,907 --> 00:32:57,577
COME ON, COME ON,
SWEETHEART, COME ON!

816
00:32:57,610 --> 00:32:59,445
HMM?

817
00:32:59,478 --> 00:33:02,048
♪ THERE'S A WORLD
GOING ON ♪

818
00:33:02,082 --> 00:33:04,217
♪ UNDERGROUND ♪

819
00:33:05,518 --> 00:33:07,853
I DON'T WANNA HEAR IT!
DIE IF YOU LIKE.

820
00:33:07,887 --> 00:33:09,122
I'M GRUFF AND ROUGH!

821
00:33:09,155 --> 00:33:11,223
AND NOT READY TO BE LOVED!

822
00:33:11,257 --> 00:33:14,193
[BOTS SING]

823
00:33:17,763 --> 00:33:20,165
IT'S WEIRD, BUT I GUESS...

824
00:33:20,198 --> 00:33:21,733
THEY ALWAYS THINK LIKE YOU
WERE TROLLS LIVING IN--

825
00:33:21,767 --> 00:33:23,335
WOULD YOU STOP
YOUR JABBERING?

826
00:33:23,368 --> 00:33:26,472
NOT SINCE TRACY AND HEPBURN.

827
00:33:26,505 --> 00:33:28,307
YOU SEE, WHERE I COME FROM--

828
00:33:28,340 --> 00:33:30,610
WHAT IS THAT OVER THERE?

829
00:33:30,643 --> 00:33:32,045
WHAT DOES IT LOOK LIKE?

830
00:33:32,078 --> 00:33:33,713
IT'S A MATTE PAINTING!

831
00:33:36,048 --> 00:33:38,752
THAT LOOKS LIKE
AN UNDERGROUND CITY.

832
00:33:38,785 --> 00:33:40,218
DUHR-HEY.

833
00:33:48,093 --> 00:33:49,162
I GOTTA CALL TO MAKE SURE

834
00:33:49,195 --> 00:33:50,295
THE PLACE I GOTTA
FILE MY CLAIM

835
00:33:50,328 --> 00:33:51,697
IS STILL OPEN.

836
00:33:51,730 --> 00:33:52,832
WAIT HERE.

837
00:33:52,865 --> 00:33:54,833
OKAY. WAIT!

838
00:33:54,867 --> 00:33:55,968
I'LL MEET YOU BY THE

839
00:33:56,002 --> 00:33:57,803
GREAT AMERICAN
HOT DOG EXPERIENCE

840
00:33:57,837 --> 00:33:59,438
IN AN HOUR.

841
00:33:59,472 --> 00:34:00,607
DO I LOVE YOU?

842
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:02,208
I DON'T EVEN KNOW YOUR NAME.

843
00:34:02,242 --> 00:34:04,510
IT'S TED NUGENT. THE NUGE.

844
00:34:04,543 --> 00:34:06,578
GUTEN EDWAY.

845
00:34:06,612 --> 00:34:09,148
- WAIT!
- WHAT?

846
00:34:09,182 --> 00:34:10,282
LOVE ME?

847
00:34:10,315 --> 00:34:12,050
I'M WANDA SAKNUSSEMM.

848
00:34:12,085 --> 00:34:13,920
GUS.

849
00:34:13,953 --> 00:34:16,688
SO WHAT.

850
00:34:16,722 --> 00:34:18,290
UH, KATHY, COULD YOU
GET IN THE SHOT?

851
00:34:18,323 --> 00:34:20,192
COME ON, COME ON,
COME ON OVER.

852
00:34:20,225 --> 00:34:21,893
WORK WITH US, HONEY.

853
00:34:21,927 --> 00:34:23,528
HI, WHAT'S ON?

854
00:34:23,562 --> 00:34:25,865
<i>--SPEAKING THROUGH HIS</i>
<i>REPRESENTATIVE SPOKESMAN,</i>

855
00:34:25,898 --> 00:34:27,600
<i>DENIED ALL GOSSIP.</i>

856
00:34:27,633 --> 00:34:29,835
IS EVERYONE DOWN HERE
A FALSE AUSTRALIAN?

857
00:34:29,868 --> 00:34:31,870
<i>IN OTHER NEWS TODAY,</i>
<i>MANY BABIES WERE</i>

858
00:34:31,903 --> 00:34:33,705
<i>SUDDENLY BORN</i>
<i>IN ZED SECTOR.</i>

859
00:34:33,738 --> 00:34:35,442
AND IN SPORT, OCEANIA

860
00:34:35,475 --> 00:34:38,677
SCORED ANOTHER VICTORY
OVER MANCHESTER UNITED.

861
00:34:38,710 --> 00:34:40,813
[CROW SNIFFS]

862
00:34:40,847 --> 00:34:44,317
♪ ONCE I HAD A LOVE,
AND IT WAS A GAS ♪

863
00:34:48,687 --> 00:34:50,823
COME ON, PRODUCTIONS
OF <i>GODSPELL</i>

864
00:34:50,857 --> 00:34:52,392
ARE PUNISHABLE BY DEATH.

865
00:34:52,425 --> 00:34:54,360
GOOD.

866
00:34:55,862 --> 00:34:58,330
GUYS, IT'S TAD
FROM <i>ALL MY CHILDREN!</i>

867
00:35:00,032 --> 00:35:02,168
IS THE WATER
WARM ENOUGH, WENDY?

868
00:35:07,407 --> 00:35:09,542
IF YOU NEED ME,
ASK FOR PATCHES.

869
00:35:12,010 --> 00:35:14,547
- WHO WAS THAT?
- BIG TROUBLE.

870
00:35:14,580 --> 00:35:16,348
A HALL MONITOR,
AND YOU DON'T GOT A PASS.

871
00:35:16,382 --> 00:35:18,250
--REMINDS ME
OF THE WICKED WITCH.

872
00:35:20,753 --> 00:35:22,120
EXTRA, EXTRA!

873
00:35:22,155 --> 00:35:24,457
I WILL WORK FOR FOOD.

874
00:35:24,490 --> 00:35:25,958
GOVERNMENT
DENIES THE TRUTH!

875
00:35:25,992 --> 00:35:27,993
I THOUGHT I HAD
A WEIRD VOICE.

876
00:35:28,027 --> 00:35:30,462
NO ONE BELIEVES WHAT'S
PRINTED IN THOSE PAPERS.

877
00:35:30,497 --> 00:35:33,565
FILL IT WITH STORIES
ABOUT ALIENS EVERY DAY.

878
00:35:33,598 --> 00:35:35,100
YOU KNOW I'M AUSTRALIAN?

879
00:35:35,133 --> 00:35:36,202
--KNOW WHAT YOU MEAN.

880
00:35:36,235 --> 00:35:37,437
LIKE LITTLE
GREEN MARTIANS

881
00:35:37,470 --> 00:35:39,738
FROM OUTER SPACE
THAT LANDED.

882
00:35:39,772 --> 00:35:41,040
ALIENS, FROM WHERE?

883
00:35:41,073 --> 00:35:42,508
♪ WOKE UP,
GOT OUT OF BED ♪

884
00:35:42,542 --> 00:35:43,943
♪ DRAGGED A COMB
ACROSS MY HEAD ♪

885
00:35:43,977 --> 00:35:45,377
WHAT'S THAT?

886
00:35:45,410 --> 00:35:46,778
OH, I FORGOT!

887
00:35:46,812 --> 00:35:48,680
YOU DON'T KNOW
WHAT OUTER SPACE IS.

888
00:35:48,713 --> 00:35:50,650
UNTIL YOU'VE TAKEN
NYQUIL WITH SUDAFED.

889
00:35:50,683 --> 00:35:52,585
HOW DID YOU LIVE
ALL YOUR LIFE?

890
00:35:52,618 --> 00:35:54,487
WELL, I HUNG OUT
WITH WARHOL.

891
00:35:54,520 --> 00:35:56,388
THAT'S SAD, ISN'T IT?

892
00:35:56,422 --> 00:35:57,957
I MEAN,

893
00:35:57,990 --> 00:36:00,727
NOT TO HAVE SEEN
BLUE SKIES?

894
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:02,328
THE SUN?

895
00:36:02,362 --> 00:36:04,397
THE STARS?

896
00:36:04,430 --> 00:36:06,032
AND MALIBU BEACH!

897
00:36:06,065 --> 00:36:08,433
WELL, I SAW
<i>SIZZLE BEACH U.S.A. </i>ONCE.

898
00:36:08,467 --> 00:36:10,202
LAY OFF THE
SURFACE WORLD STUFF.

899
00:36:10,235 --> 00:36:12,638
SHE'S BEING
VERY GEOCENTRIC RIGHT NOW.

900
00:36:14,940 --> 00:36:16,142
WHY DOES EVERYONE WEAR

901
00:36:16,175 --> 00:36:18,677
FUNNY MAKEUP
AND WEIRD CLOTHES?

902
00:36:18,710 --> 00:36:20,145
WOULD YOU COME ON?

903
00:36:20,178 --> 00:36:22,215
IT'S EXENE!

904
00:36:22,248 --> 00:36:24,883
NO, I THINK IT'S VANITY.

905
00:36:24,917 --> 00:36:27,453
MALIBU BEACH?

906
00:36:27,487 --> 00:36:29,988
IT'S TAKING KIND OF
A DICKENS-ESQUE TURN, HUH?

907
00:36:32,023 --> 00:36:33,592
REALLY, IT'S SO
DICKENS-ESQUE

908
00:36:33,625 --> 00:36:34,827
IT'S ALMOST DICKENSIAN.

909
00:36:34,860 --> 00:36:37,363
THIS IS KIND OF
A HIGH-RENT DISTRICT.

910
00:36:39,865 --> 00:36:42,735
NORM!

911
00:36:42,768 --> 00:36:43,937
HEY, IT'S A NELSON!

912
00:36:43,970 --> 00:36:46,472
IT'S GUNNAR, I THINK.

913
00:36:49,575 --> 00:36:51,410
WE'RE OPEN, I SUPPOSE.

914
00:36:51,443 --> 00:36:54,647
WOW, THIS PLACE
IS REALLY CREEPY!

915
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:56,882
THEY GOT REAL GOOD
MOZZARELLA STICKS HERE,

916
00:36:56,915 --> 00:37:00,653
SO SHUT UP.

917
00:37:00,687 --> 00:37:02,822
SO YOUR GIRLFRIEND
OWNS THIS PLACE?

918
00:37:02,855 --> 00:37:04,523
WELL, SHE OWNS
THE FRANCHISE,

919
00:37:04,557 --> 00:37:06,558
IT'S OWNED BY A HUGE
MULTINATIONAL

920
00:37:06,592 --> 00:37:10,162
BASED OUT OF SWITZERLAND.

921
00:37:10,195 --> 00:37:13,265
HEY, EDGAR WINTER,
TABLE FOR TWO, PLEASE?

922
00:37:13,298 --> 00:37:15,100
YOU GOT THEM
LITTLE FISH CRACKERS?

923
00:37:15,133 --> 00:37:16,502
WELL, LOOK WHO'S HERE.

924
00:37:16,535 --> 00:37:18,870
- WHO? OH.
- HOW YOU DOING, ROEYIS?

925
00:37:18,903 --> 00:37:21,073
HOW DO I LOOK
LIKE I'M DOING?

926
00:37:21,107 --> 00:37:23,242
WELL, YOU LOOK PALE.

927
00:37:23,275 --> 00:37:26,745
I DONE STRUCK IT RICH,
ROEYIS.

928
00:37:26,778 --> 00:37:27,947
THAT'S WHY I'M BACK.

929
00:37:30,582 --> 00:37:32,718
YEAH, LIKE ALWAYS.

930
00:37:32,752 --> 00:37:34,587
THIS GUY'S SPLIT WITHOUT
PAYING HIS BILL.

931
00:37:34,620 --> 00:37:36,188
LEFT HIS CLOTHES BEHIND.

932
00:37:36,222 --> 00:37:37,890
LOOKS TO ME LIKE
YOU COULD USE THEM.

933
00:37:37,923 --> 00:37:40,425
WELL, SHE SEEMS NICE.

934
00:37:41,893 --> 00:37:43,595
SUPPOSE THIS COULD BE
A BIG MINING TOWN?

935
00:37:43,628 --> 00:37:45,130
COULD BE.

936
00:37:45,163 --> 00:37:46,765
HEY, COULD YOU
PUT THE GAME ON?

937
00:37:46,798 --> 00:37:49,735
- THE GAME!
- THE GAME, THE BIG GAME!

938
00:37:51,870 --> 00:37:53,638
HOW CAN THERE BE
WEAKNESSES TO SOMETHING

939
00:37:53,672 --> 00:37:56,175
THAT HAS NEVER HAPPENED?

940
00:37:56,208 --> 00:37:59,512
THIS TO ME IS GOOD TV.

941
00:37:59,545 --> 00:38:01,747
KIND OF A WEIRD
<i>DAYS OF OUR LIVES.</i>

942
00:38:01,780 --> 00:38:04,083
I DON'T KNOW ANY TROLL MINER
NAMED BAZ BODIN.

943
00:38:04,117 --> 00:38:06,385
OH! I KNOW, IT'S
ABEL GANCE'S <i>NAPOLEON.</i>

944
00:38:06,418 --> 00:38:09,355
NOT VERY GOOD.

945
00:38:09,388 --> 00:38:11,423
WE HAVE OUR SOURCES.

946
00:38:11,457 --> 00:38:12,992
THEN NAME THEM, DONALD.

947
00:38:13,025 --> 00:38:15,093
YOU'RE CHANGING
THE SUBJECT, CONSUL.

948
00:38:15,127 --> 00:38:16,795
- I'D LIKE TO ASSURE EVERYONE--
- KIND OF WEIRD.

949
00:38:16,828 --> 00:38:19,498
--THAT, CONTRARY TO ANY
RUMORS AND GOSSIP,

950
00:38:19,532 --> 00:38:20,900
THAT MAY BE CIRCULATING,

951
00:38:20,933 --> 00:38:22,368
- I'M BOY GEORGE.
- THAT WE HAVE NOT

952
00:38:22,402 --> 00:38:24,003
CAPTURED ANY ALIEN BEINGS

953
00:38:24,037 --> 00:38:26,672
FROM A REPORTED
SURFACE WORLD.

954
00:38:26,705 --> 00:38:28,707
MR. ROGERS IN <i>CABARET.</i>

955
00:38:28,740 --> 00:38:30,075
--SIMPLY NO TRUTH
TO THE RUMORS.

956
00:38:30,108 --> 00:38:32,210
THIS WEEK WITH
DAVID BRINKLEY!

957
00:38:32,243 --> 00:38:35,080
- OY!
- WITH DAY-VID BRINKLEY!

958
00:38:35,113 --> 00:38:37,617
WELL, BACK TO YOU GUYS,
UP IN THE BOOTH.

959
00:38:37,650 --> 00:38:40,052
LYING SACK OF CRAP.

960
00:38:40,085 --> 00:38:41,687
[GASPS]

961
00:38:46,358 --> 00:38:47,860
- HELLO?
- HELLO?

962
00:38:47,893 --> 00:38:51,263
OH! OH...

963
00:38:51,297 --> 00:38:52,865
BOING! BOING! BOING!

964
00:38:52,898 --> 00:38:55,133
BOING! BOING!

965
00:38:55,167 --> 00:38:57,268
I CAN'T BELIEVE I GOT
AN INTERVIEW!

966
00:38:58,837 --> 00:39:00,907
SHE'S REBOOTING.

967
00:39:03,008 --> 00:39:04,943
NOW THAT KILLED SOME TIME.

968
00:39:04,977 --> 00:39:07,178
[ELECTRONIC VOICE]

969
00:39:11,383 --> 00:39:14,620
TEST YOUR SEX APPEAL!

970
00:39:14,653 --> 00:39:17,122
<i>--AND THE UNIT WILL ATTEMPT</i>
<i>TO IMPROVE YOUR LOOKS.</i>

971
00:39:17,155 --> 00:39:19,058
- SHE'S GONNA PURGE!
- NO!

972
00:39:19,092 --> 00:39:21,027
<i>STEP ON PEDAL PROVIDED.</i>

973
00:39:24,663 --> 00:39:26,198
NO, KATHY, THAT'S THE BIDET!

974
00:39:30,235 --> 00:39:32,270
HI, JUST WANTED TO TELL YOU,
DON'T USE THE STEAM THING--

975
00:39:32,303 --> 00:39:33,705
AAH!

976
00:39:33,738 --> 00:39:35,908
<i>--1000 HAS DONE</i>
<i>ALL IT CAN.</i>

977
00:39:35,942 --> 00:39:37,777
<i>THANK YOU, STEP ASIDE.</i>

978
00:39:37,810 --> 00:39:40,245
HEY, YOU LOOK REALLY NICE.

979
00:39:40,278 --> 00:39:41,447
BROUGHT YOU
SOMETHING TO WEAR,

980
00:39:41,480 --> 00:39:42,582
LOOKED TO ME LIKE
YOU NEEDED IT.

981
00:39:42,615 --> 00:39:44,683
MIRANDA RICHARDSON
HANDS HER AN UGLY COAT.

982
00:39:44,717 --> 00:39:46,318
BITCHING.

983
00:39:46,352 --> 00:39:48,887
THAT'S REALLY NICE OF YOU.

984
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:51,790
COULDN'T STAND WEARING
THAT DRESS ANOTHER MINUTE.

985
00:39:51,823 --> 00:39:55,093
MM, STUARTS, I CAN SEE WHY.

986
00:39:55,127 --> 00:39:58,097
IT SAYS "ALL
ATLANTEAN FIBERS."

987
00:39:59,732 --> 00:40:02,167
[BOTS] YES-- CHANGE--
CHANGE YOUR CLOTHES--

988
00:40:02,200 --> 00:40:04,903
GUYS, COME ON.

989
00:40:04,937 --> 00:40:07,873
I'VE NEVER SEEN MATERIAL
LIKE THIS BEFORE.

990
00:40:07,907 --> 00:40:09,007
WHAT IS IT?

991
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:12,043
UH, IT'S NEW?

992
00:40:12,077 --> 00:40:13,312
WHERE ARE YOU FROM?

993
00:40:13,345 --> 00:40:14,680
UM, NEW TOWN?

994
00:40:14,713 --> 00:40:16,748
UH, FROM OUT OF TOWN.

995
00:40:16,782 --> 00:40:19,752
IT'S DANGEROUS FOR STRANGERS
IN ATLANTIS THESE DAYS.

996
00:40:21,087 --> 00:40:22,788
PEOPLE GET KIDNAPPED.

997
00:40:22,822 --> 00:40:25,925
NO ONE EVER
HEARS OF THEM AGAIN.

998
00:40:25,958 --> 00:40:28,193
YOU SHOULD BE CAREFUL.

999
00:40:28,227 --> 00:40:30,662
YOU'RE THE TYPE THAT WOULD
ATTRACT A LOT OF ATTENTION.

1000
00:40:30,695 --> 00:40:32,698
I'LL BE CAREFUL.

1001
00:40:32,732 --> 00:40:34,600
NOW, CAN I GO PLAY?

1002
00:40:34,633 --> 00:40:35,868
THANKS, ROEYIS.

1003
00:40:35,902 --> 00:40:39,272
I'LL BE DOWNSTAIRS,
IF YOU NEED ANYTHING.

1004
00:40:39,305 --> 00:40:43,175
A SCENE FROM
<i>THE CHILDREN'S HOUR.</i>

1005
00:40:43,208 --> 00:40:45,710
OH, DAD.

1006
00:40:45,743 --> 00:40:48,247
WHY WOULD YOU WANT TO COME
TO A PLACE LIKE THIS?

1007
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:50,917
IT'S A PLANNED
GOLF COMMUNITY.

1008
00:40:50,950 --> 00:40:53,585
I'VE GOT TO FIND YOU
AND GET US OUT OF HERE.

1009
00:40:56,622 --> 00:40:59,057
I THINK THE GOVERNMENT'S DOING
ALL RIGHT FOR ITSELF, HUH?

1010
00:40:59,090 --> 00:41:01,560
YOU ARE AN ALIEN SPY
SENT DOWN BY YOUR WORLD

1011
00:41:01,593 --> 00:41:03,262
TO PREPARE AN INVASION
OF ATLANTIS.

1012
00:41:03,295 --> 00:41:05,630
I AM NOT AN ALIEN SPY
SENT DOWN BY MY WORLD

1013
00:41:05,663 --> 00:41:06,798
TO PREPARE AN INVASION
OF ATLANTIS!

1014
00:41:06,832 --> 00:41:08,767
I AM THE LAW HERE
IN ATLANTIS.

1015
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:10,702
YOU WILL CONFESS
THE TRUTH TO ME.

1016
00:41:10,735 --> 00:41:12,203
AND OUR WORLDS WILL--

1017
00:41:12,237 --> 00:41:14,173
CALL FOR MORE
SMOKE, PLEASE!

1018
00:41:14,207 --> 00:41:15,908
[ALL COUGH]

1019
00:41:19,712 --> 00:41:20,847
AAH!

1020
00:41:27,987 --> 00:41:29,588
- NO, NO.
- COME ON, YOU LOOK GREAT,
HE LOOKS GREAT.

1021
00:41:29,622 --> 00:41:31,190
- HE DOES LOOK GREAT.
- DOESN'T HE? COME ON.

1022
00:41:31,223 --> 00:41:32,490
OKAY, YOU OWE ME
A BIG FAVOR, NELSON.

1023
00:41:32,525 --> 00:41:33,592
- [CROW WHISTLES]
- SHUT UP, CROW,

1024
00:41:33,625 --> 00:41:34,660
AND DON'T LOOK AT MY BUTT.

1025
00:41:34,693 --> 00:41:35,928
CAN WE JUST GET ON
WITH THIS, PLEASE?

1026
00:41:35,962 --> 00:41:37,797
OKAY, MCCAMBOT, JUST LIKE
WE PRACTICED IT,

1027
00:41:37,830 --> 00:41:39,332
MY WILD, IRISH IRELAND.

1028
00:41:39,365 --> 00:41:42,067
OY, IN THE GAELIC,
"ERIN GO BRAUGH-LESS."

1029
00:41:42,100 --> 00:41:43,402
CROW, DON'T START,
COME ON.

1030
00:41:43,435 --> 00:41:44,770
- SORRY.
- HERE WE GO.

1031
00:41:44,803 --> 00:41:47,038
♪♪ [ACCORDION]

1032
00:41:47,072 --> 00:41:49,608
♪ OH KATHY, OH KATHY,
MY WILD IRELAND LASSIE ♪

1033
00:41:49,642 --> 00:41:51,577
♪ YOU'RE NOT JUST
AN ISLAND TO ME ♪

1034
00:41:51,610 --> 00:41:53,678
- THANK YOU.
- ♪ WITH YOUR SPARKING
GREEN EYES ♪

1035
00:41:53,712 --> 00:41:55,180
♪ AND SKIN ALABASTER ♪

1036
00:41:55,213 --> 00:41:58,083
♪ YOU'VE STOLEN
MY HEART, YOU SEE ♪

1037
00:41:58,117 --> 00:42:00,920
♪ OH KATHY, WHO SQUEAKS
WITH THE VOICE OF AN ANGEL ♪

1038
00:42:00,953 --> 00:42:03,422
♪ I DON'T THINK
YOU'RE SO BIG-A-BONED ♪

1039
00:42:03,455 --> 00:42:06,425
♪ I'D LIKE TO COME OVER
AND ROLL IN YOUR CLOVER ♪

1040
00:42:06,458 --> 00:42:08,193
♪ AND KISS YOUR
BLARNEY STONE ♪

1041
00:42:08,227 --> 00:42:09,662
COME ON, BIG BOY!

1042
00:42:09,695 --> 00:42:10,930
YOU GUYS, COME ON.

1043
00:42:10,963 --> 00:42:12,497
- WHAT?
- NO IMPROVISING.

1044
00:42:12,530 --> 00:42:14,400
SORRY, I WAS JUST
GOING WITH MY FEELINGS,

1045
00:42:14,433 --> 00:42:15,500
YOU BIG MUSH.

1046
00:42:15,533 --> 00:42:17,002
LET'S JUST SKIP
TO THE CHORUS.

1047
00:42:17,035 --> 00:42:18,437
OKAY.

1048
00:42:18,470 --> 00:42:21,107
♪ KATHY, KATHY ♪

1049
00:42:21,140 --> 00:42:24,008
♪ MY SWEET LASSIE ♪

1050
00:42:24,042 --> 00:42:26,745
♪ I'LL ADORE YOU ♪

1051
00:42:26,778 --> 00:42:29,113
♪ TILL THE END OF TIME ♪

1052
00:42:29,147 --> 00:42:30,548
THAT'S A LITTLE PREDICTABLE,
ISN'T IT, NELSON?

1053
00:42:30,582 --> 00:42:31,750
COME ON,
JUST DO YOUR PART.

1054
00:42:31,783 --> 00:42:33,752
- OKAY, OH--
- NO, IN THE VOICE.

1055
00:42:33,785 --> 00:42:36,255
♪ OH MIKEY, OH MIKEY,
IT'S YOU THAT I LIKEY ♪

1056
00:42:36,288 --> 00:42:38,857
♪ YOU'RE THE
BITCHING DREAM ♪

1057
00:42:38,890 --> 00:42:40,258
♪ WITH THOSE
BABY BLUE THINGS ♪

1058
00:42:40,292 --> 00:42:41,593
♪ AND THE STUFF
THAT YOU WEAR ♪

1059
00:42:41,627 --> 00:42:43,595
♪ AND YOUR SHOES
ARE REALLY CHOICE ♪

1060
00:42:43,628 --> 00:42:45,063
SORRY, I...

1061
00:42:45,097 --> 00:42:46,732
MIKE, MIKE, IT'S ME, TOM.

1062
00:42:46,765 --> 00:42:48,567
MIKE, NO NO, MIKE,
MIKE, TOM HERE!

1063
00:42:48,600 --> 00:42:50,002
- TOM, MIKE, THE CHORUS!
- WHAT?

1064
00:42:50,035 --> 00:42:52,003
OH, THE CHORUS!

1065
00:42:52,037 --> 00:42:54,307
♪ KATHY, KATHY ♪

1066
00:42:54,340 --> 00:42:57,175
♪ YOU'VE MADE ME DAFFY ♪

1067
00:42:57,208 --> 00:42:59,845
♪ I WILL LOVE YOU ♪

1068
00:42:59,878 --> 00:43:02,848
♪ TILL THE END OF TIME ♪

1069
00:43:02,882 --> 00:43:05,517
♪ OH KATHY, COMPACT
AND DELICIOUS, YOUNG KATHY ♪

1070
00:43:05,550 --> 00:43:08,420
♪ 'TIS ONLY FOR YOU
THAT I PINE ♪

1071
00:43:08,453 --> 00:43:11,257
♪ I'LL MAKE ALL OF YOUR
ENEMIES DIE FOR THEIR SINS ♪

1072
00:43:11,290 --> 00:43:13,892
♪ AND I'LL LOVE YOU
TILL MOVIE SIGN ♪

1073
00:43:13,925 --> 00:43:15,360
[BUZZER]

1074
00:43:15,393 --> 00:43:18,130
OH, IT IS MOVIE SIGN,
LET'S GO!

1075
00:43:30,342 --> 00:43:33,245
- THAT WAS COOL.
- LOVELY!

1076
00:43:36,515 --> 00:43:37,783
THEN I LOST MY HEAD.

1077
00:43:37,817 --> 00:43:39,518
OH, FORGET IT.

1078
00:43:39,552 --> 00:43:41,287
WHAT'S A YEAR
WITH NO WORD?

1079
00:43:41,320 --> 00:43:44,288
OOH!

1080
00:43:44,323 --> 00:43:45,490
I KNOW WHAT HURT YOU.

1081
00:43:45,523 --> 00:43:47,225
NO, YOU DON'T!

1082
00:43:47,258 --> 00:43:50,395
DOES SHE REALIZE HOW
INCREDIBLY AUSTRALIAN I AM?

1083
00:43:53,098 --> 00:43:55,400
HUH, SHE MUST BE GOING
TO VISIT WILLIAM BURROUGHS.

1084
00:43:57,468 --> 00:43:59,303
HMM, YOU KNOW,
EVENTUALLY ATLANTIS

1085
00:43:59,338 --> 00:44:01,107
IS GONNA HAVE TO SHIFT
TO A SERVICE ECONOMY.

1086
00:44:01,140 --> 00:44:02,540
- YEAH.
- I'M THINKING.

1087
00:44:02,573 --> 00:44:04,308
♪ ONE NIGHT IN BANGKOK ♪

1088
00:44:04,343 --> 00:44:06,945
♪ MAKES A HARD MAN
HUMBLE! ♪

1089
00:44:06,978 --> 00:44:09,382
I GOTTA WAIT UNTIL TOMORROW
TO FILE MY CLAIM.

1090
00:44:09,415 --> 00:44:10,582
FLOW MY CLAM?

1091
00:44:10,615 --> 00:44:11,717
SO I FIGURED I'LL--

1092
00:44:11,750 --> 00:44:13,618
I'LL HELP YOU
LOOK FOR YOUR DAD.

1093
00:44:13,652 --> 00:44:16,922
GEE, THANKS, GUS.

1094
00:44:16,955 --> 00:44:19,692
I'M ONLY DOING IT SO'S
I CAN GET RID OF YOU.

1095
00:44:19,725 --> 00:44:20,892
YOU'RE A PAIN IN THE NECK,

1096
00:44:20,925 --> 00:44:22,293
AND YOU'RE
CRAMPING MY STYLE.

1097
00:44:22,327 --> 00:44:24,763
- OY.
- COME ON, LET'S GET
SOMETHING TO EAT.

1098
00:44:24,797 --> 00:44:26,498
- OY.
- YOU ALIENS EAT,
DON'T YOU?

1099
00:44:26,532 --> 00:44:28,667
YEAH, I'M STARVING.

1100
00:44:28,700 --> 00:44:32,103
DIVORCE? BANKRUPTCY?
HARASSED BY CREDITORS?

1101
00:44:34,373 --> 00:44:35,507
I GOTTA FIGURE OUT A WAY--

1102
00:44:35,540 --> 00:44:38,110
WELCOME TO THE RENAISSANCE
FESTIVAL!

1103
00:44:40,712 --> 00:44:42,280
♪ DON'T TELL MY HEART ♪

1104
00:44:42,313 --> 00:44:44,082
♪ MY ACHY BREAKY HEART ♪

1105
00:44:44,115 --> 00:44:46,618
I JUST... DON'T...

1106
00:44:48,387 --> 00:44:50,522
IT LOOKS LIKE
BALLETS TRACADERO.

1107
00:44:50,555 --> 00:44:52,825
BET YOU YOU'VE NEVER BEEN
TO A PLACE LIKE THIS BEFORE.

1108
00:44:52,858 --> 00:44:54,793
WELL, CHILI'S GETS
PRETTY NUTS.

1109
00:44:57,830 --> 00:45:00,198
LET ME TELL YOU
ABOUT OUR SPECIALS.

1110
00:45:00,232 --> 00:45:02,167
TAKE YOUR ORDER NOW.

1111
00:45:04,837 --> 00:45:07,372
I'LL HAVE THE SPECIAL.

1112
00:45:07,405 --> 00:45:08,773
WHAT DO YOU WANT?

1113
00:45:08,807 --> 00:45:11,510
CAN'T READ THE SPECIAL--
OH, OH.

1114
00:45:11,543 --> 00:45:12,945
UH,

1115
00:45:12,978 --> 00:45:14,580
MAKE IT TWO.

1116
00:45:14,613 --> 00:45:17,082
COMING RIGHT DOWN.

1117
00:45:17,115 --> 00:45:19,685
I'VE GOTTA RUB MORE
SALIVA IN ME HAIR.

1118
00:45:24,723 --> 00:45:27,793
LOOKS LIKE
A PETER GREENAWAY SET.

1119
00:45:27,827 --> 00:45:30,262
TINA TURNER
DEMANDS A TABLE!

1120
00:45:30,295 --> 00:45:31,630
YES, I WANT THAT TABLE
OVER THERE.

1121
00:45:31,663 --> 00:45:33,298
YES, THAT ONE, DO YOU SEE?

1122
00:45:33,332 --> 00:45:35,233
YES.

1123
00:45:35,267 --> 00:45:36,368
THANK YOU.

1124
00:45:36,402 --> 00:45:39,403
ANY IDEAS ON HOW
TO FIND MY DAD?

1125
00:45:39,438 --> 00:45:40,905
UH, WE LOOK FOR HIM?

1126
00:45:40,938 --> 00:45:42,607
YEAH, NO, NOT YET.

1127
00:45:42,640 --> 00:45:44,208
I DON'T THINK TOO WELL
ON AN EMPTY STOMACH.

1128
00:45:44,242 --> 00:45:46,978
HE'S USING A MOUSEPAD
FOR A NAPKIN.

1129
00:45:48,813 --> 00:45:50,315
HEY, IT'S CANDY SLICE!

1130
00:45:50,348 --> 00:45:52,483
THINGS ARE REALLY
WEIRD HERE.

1131
00:45:52,517 --> 00:45:54,252
NOT LIKE THE SURFACE
WORLD, HUH?

1132
00:45:54,285 --> 00:45:55,853
OH, GOOD ONE.

1133
00:45:55,887 --> 00:45:58,023
RIGHT, THE FOOD'S HERE.

1134
00:46:05,897 --> 00:46:07,665
I SPECIFICALLY SAID
NO BACON

1135
00:46:07,698 --> 00:46:09,000
ON MY WORM SANDWICH.

1136
00:46:09,033 --> 00:46:10,935
- YUCK!
- PUMPERNICKEL!

1137
00:46:10,968 --> 00:46:13,138
--GONNA EAT THAT, ARE YOU?

1138
00:46:13,172 --> 00:46:16,575
HEY, WATCH.

1139
00:46:16,608 --> 00:46:18,577
SCREAMING WORMS?

1140
00:46:18,610 --> 00:46:20,345
MM.

1141
00:46:20,378 --> 00:46:22,247
- DELICIOUS.
- VERY AUSTRALIAN.

1142
00:46:24,483 --> 00:46:27,485
UH, I GUESS I DON'T NEED
TO SEE THE DESSERT TRAY.

1143
00:46:27,518 --> 00:46:30,255
MY DAD'S A PROFESSOR, GUS.

1144
00:46:30,288 --> 00:46:33,158
AND I BET HE'D REALLY
LIKE TO STUDY YOU.

1145
00:46:34,527 --> 00:46:35,693
HEY!

1146
00:46:36,995 --> 00:46:38,597
THINK I KNOW SOMEONE
HELP YOU OUT.

1147
00:46:38,630 --> 00:46:39,665
YOU DO?

1148
00:46:39,698 --> 00:46:41,867
YEAH, STAY PUT,
I GOTTA USE THE PHONE.

1149
00:46:41,900 --> 00:46:43,368
OH, THAT'S GREAT, GUS.

1150
00:46:43,402 --> 00:46:46,003
HE'S STICKING HER
WITH THE CHECK!

1151
00:46:46,037 --> 00:46:48,073
♪ THE FARMER IN THE DELL ♪

1152
00:46:48,107 --> 00:46:50,175
♪ THE FARMER IN THE DELL ♪

1153
00:46:50,208 --> 00:46:53,145
EH, I'M SHY.

1154
00:46:53,178 --> 00:46:55,213
SO, GET ME MOUNT PILOT.

1155
00:46:57,215 --> 00:47:00,185
KATHY SMITH, NO!

1156
00:47:00,218 --> 00:47:02,153
DID I JUST HEAR A SYRINGE?

1157
00:47:04,657 --> 00:47:07,592
SO BIG-BONED, 30 CC'S
OUGHT TO DO IT!

1158
00:47:07,625 --> 00:47:08,960
SHE'S DEFLATING.

1159
00:47:08,993 --> 00:47:10,395
NOW, SEE, THIS
IS IRRESPONSIBLE.

1160
00:47:10,428 --> 00:47:11,597
THEY'RE ENCOURAGING
PEOPLE TO GO OUT

1161
00:47:11,630 --> 00:47:13,332
AND DRUG KATHY IRELAND.

1162
00:47:17,102 --> 00:47:20,338
NOW LET'S GO BURN DOWN
THE CHELSEA HOTEL.

1163
00:47:20,372 --> 00:47:21,540
DAD?

1164
00:47:21,573 --> 00:47:23,508
I'D LIKE THE NUMBER
FOR A...

1165
00:47:23,542 --> 00:47:26,578
PROFESSOR
OVID GALBA, PLEASE.

1166
00:47:26,612 --> 00:47:29,080
I CAN TAKE YOU TO YOUR DAD.

1167
00:47:29,113 --> 00:47:30,215
COME WITH ME.

1168
00:47:30,248 --> 00:47:32,750
I'M LOOKING FOR MY DAD.

1169
00:47:32,783 --> 00:47:35,087
WELL, DO YOU HAVE
A LAST KNOWN ADDRESS?

1170
00:47:35,120 --> 00:47:37,622
UM, SORRY, I CAN'T GIVE OUT
THAT INFORMATION, SIR.

1171
00:47:40,858 --> 00:47:44,062
LIVE THE GOOD LIFE
IN THE OFF-WORLD COLONIES.

1172
00:47:45,730 --> 00:47:49,668
OH, I THINK THEY'RE
IN FUNKYTOWN.

1173
00:47:49,702 --> 00:47:51,970
FUNKYTOWN.

1174
00:47:52,003 --> 00:47:54,840
TONIGHT, SAM GIANCANA
SINGS <i>PAGLIACCI!</i>

1175
00:47:56,073 --> 00:47:57,977
TONIGHT, WE HAVE A LINEUP--

1176
00:47:58,010 --> 00:47:59,878
HEY, ARCHIE RICE.

1177
00:47:59,912 --> 00:48:02,447
--TO SATISFY YOUR LUSTS.

1178
00:48:02,480 --> 00:48:03,848
[CROWD CHEERS]

1179
00:48:03,882 --> 00:48:06,083
OH, I THOUGHT WE WERE
BEYOND THUNDERDOME.

1180
00:48:06,117 --> 00:48:09,387
YEAH, ME TOO.

1181
00:48:09,420 --> 00:48:11,457
AND ONLY ONE WALKS OUT!

1182
00:48:11,490 --> 00:48:12,590
NOW BATTING!

1183
00:48:12,623 --> 00:48:15,560
KIRBY PUCKETT!

1184
00:48:17,295 --> 00:48:19,665
YOU CAN'T HAVE ANY PUDDING
UNTIL YOU EAT YOUR MEAT!

1185
00:48:19,698 --> 00:48:22,400
HOW CAN YOU HAVE ANY PUDDING
IF YOU DON'T EAT YOUR MEAT?

1186
00:48:26,305 --> 00:48:29,340
[ANNOUNCER MURMURS]

1187
00:48:29,373 --> 00:48:31,643
WOW, EVENING AT THE IMPROV'S
REALLY CHANGED.

1188
00:48:31,677 --> 00:48:33,745
ON MY RIGHT, SMASHER!

1189
00:48:33,778 --> 00:48:37,382
YEAH, THAT'S ME.

1190
00:48:37,415 --> 00:48:39,550
HEY, WORMS! GET YOUR
ICE-COLD WORMS!

1191
00:48:39,583 --> 00:48:41,118
GET THEM WHILE
THEY'RE ALIVE!

1192
00:48:44,388 --> 00:48:47,292
<i>BLOODFIST 9,</i>
<i>THE RECKONING.</i>

1193
00:48:47,325 --> 00:48:49,628
THIS IS WHERE ALL THOSE
NEW WAVE BANDS WENT

1194
00:48:49,662 --> 00:48:53,198
WHEN THE WAVE WAS OVER.

1195
00:48:53,232 --> 00:48:55,433
THAT GUY SHOULD NOT
WEAR HORIZONTAL STRIPES.

1196
00:48:55,467 --> 00:48:57,402
- NO.
- I'M SORRY.

1197
00:48:59,672 --> 00:49:00,805
OH, AND JUST WHERE
AM I SUPPOSED

1198
00:49:00,838 --> 00:49:03,742
TO SET MY COLE SLAW NOW?

1199
00:49:03,775 --> 00:49:06,978
YOUR T-ZONE IS A MESS.

1200
00:49:07,012 --> 00:49:09,013
WHAT IS IT, SHANK?

1201
00:49:09,047 --> 00:49:10,815
A GIRL.

1202
00:49:10,848 --> 00:49:12,250
I CAN SEE THAT.

1203
00:49:12,283 --> 00:49:13,518
HEY.

1204
00:49:13,552 --> 00:49:16,655
I WANT TO KNOW WHY YOU HAVE
BROUGHT HER HERE TO ME.

1205
00:49:16,688 --> 00:49:17,990
TO MAMBINO.

1206
00:49:18,023 --> 00:49:19,590
- THE BOSS OF BOSSES.
- [CHUCKLES]

1207
00:49:19,623 --> 00:49:22,027
I OVERHEARD HER
TALKING, MAMBINO.

1208
00:49:22,060 --> 00:49:24,195
SHE CLAIMS TO BE AN AL--

1209
00:49:24,228 --> 00:49:25,997
SPEAK, SHANK.

1210
00:49:26,030 --> 00:49:27,898
WHO DID THE GIRL
CLAIM TO BE?

1211
00:49:27,932 --> 00:49:29,067
AN ACTRESS.

1212
00:49:29,100 --> 00:49:32,570
AN ALIEN.

1213
00:49:32,603 --> 00:49:34,038
THERE'S NO SUCH THING.

1214
00:49:34,072 --> 00:49:36,408
SHE NEEDS TO PERFECT
HER CLOSED-MOUTH SMILE.

1215
00:49:36,442 --> 00:49:39,912
OKAY, I'LL TAKE
HER BONES ELSEWHERE.

1216
00:49:39,945 --> 00:49:41,447
DID THIS GET GOOFY ON US?

1217
00:49:41,480 --> 00:49:43,948
I NEVER SAID
I WASN'T INTERESTED.

1218
00:49:43,982 --> 00:49:45,250
I IMPLIED IT, SURE.

1219
00:49:45,283 --> 00:49:47,352
I COULD ALWAYS USE ANOTHER

1220
00:49:47,385 --> 00:49:49,320
DARK GIRL WITH BIG BONES.

1221
00:49:49,353 --> 00:49:51,390
WASN'T HE ON <i>GOLDEN GIRLS?</i>

1222
00:49:51,423 --> 00:49:54,258
SHE'LL COST YOU
500 SHINY ONES.

1223
00:49:54,292 --> 00:49:56,395
BETTER 400 SHINY ONES.

1224
00:49:56,428 --> 00:49:57,528
400 SHINY ONES--

1225
00:49:57,562 --> 00:50:00,065
DON'T PUSH YOUR LUCK, SHANK.

1226
00:50:00,098 --> 00:50:01,900
YEAH.

1227
00:50:03,802 --> 00:50:05,170
WHOA.

1228
00:50:05,203 --> 00:50:06,905
ALL RIGHT, JUST A SEC, LET ME
GET THAT OUT OF THE WAY--

1229
00:50:06,938 --> 00:50:08,940
- AH!
- OH! MY HINDER.

1230
00:50:11,242 --> 00:50:13,345
I LIKE ME.

1231
00:50:18,950 --> 00:50:20,185
ALL CLEAR.

1232
00:50:20,218 --> 00:50:23,355
BOY, IT DOESN'T FEEL
LIKE A TUESDAY, HUH?

1233
00:50:23,388 --> 00:50:25,157
- THAT'S THE COVER OF <i>TOMMY.</i>
- COOL.

1234
00:50:25,190 --> 00:50:27,192
I HAVE GOOD
INFORMATION TO SELL

1235
00:50:27,225 --> 00:50:28,993
ABOUT AN ALIEN WRETCH.

1236
00:50:29,027 --> 00:50:30,962
CHERYL, I LOVE YOUR HAIR.

1237
00:50:30,995 --> 00:50:33,765
NOW, FOR 750 DULL ONES.

1238
00:50:33,798 --> 00:50:36,300
750 DULL ONES,
THAT'S POCKET CHANGE!

1239
00:50:43,442 --> 00:50:44,743
GENERAL RYKOV, PLEASE.

1240
00:50:44,777 --> 00:50:46,478
JUST A SECOND, JUST
CHECKING YOUR REFERENCES.

1241
00:50:46,512 --> 00:50:47,745
I'LL BE RIGHT WITH YOU.

1242
00:50:47,778 --> 00:50:50,815
YES?

1243
00:50:50,848 --> 00:50:52,983
HELLO, CRASSUS.

1244
00:50:53,017 --> 00:50:56,153
SORRY, I CAN'T HEAR
OUT OF THIS EYE.

1245
00:50:56,187 --> 00:50:58,523
YOU WANT US TO ARREST
ANOTHER ALIEN?

1246
00:50:58,557 --> 00:51:00,158
AY-LIEN.

1247
00:51:00,192 --> 00:51:01,993
WOW, KATHY'S NOT
NERDY ANYMORE.

1248
00:51:02,027 --> 00:51:03,695
NO NO NO.

1249
00:51:03,728 --> 00:51:05,330
SHE DOESN'T DO MUCH,
DOES SHE?

1250
00:51:05,363 --> 00:51:06,532
I DON'T KNOW.

1251
00:51:06,565 --> 00:51:08,233
HEY, IT'S THE BAND RUSH!

1252
00:51:08,267 --> 00:51:11,168
I DON'T TRUST SHANK.

1253
00:51:11,202 --> 00:51:13,705
I HAVE TO HIDE
THE GIRL SOMEWHERE.

1254
00:51:13,738 --> 00:51:15,673
YOU GOT ROOM AT
YOUR PLACE, GARY?

1255
00:51:18,008 --> 00:51:20,978
MAYBE IN MY BED.

1256
00:51:21,012 --> 00:51:22,313
KATHY IRELAND
GETS TREATED LIKE

1257
00:51:22,347 --> 00:51:25,217
A BARGE FULL OF MEDICAL WASTE
IN THIS MOVIE.

1258
00:51:29,120 --> 00:51:32,757
I'M MAMBINO, BOSS OF BOSSES.

1259
00:51:32,790 --> 00:51:34,092
YEAH, HEY, BOSS OF BOSSES,

1260
00:51:34,125 --> 00:51:35,793
YOU MIGHT WANNA
BLOT YOUR LIPSTICK.

1261
00:51:35,827 --> 00:51:36,928
[MAMBINO MUTTERS]

1262
00:51:36,962 --> 00:51:39,397
WHY?

1263
00:51:39,430 --> 00:51:42,367
BECAUSE THEY BUY ALIENS.

1264
00:51:42,400 --> 00:51:43,868
[WANDA GIGGLES]

1265
00:51:43,902 --> 00:51:45,137
ALIENS?

1266
00:51:45,170 --> 00:51:47,805
YOU THINK I'M AN ALIEN?

1267
00:51:49,207 --> 00:51:50,308
[CROW LAUGHS]

1268
00:51:50,342 --> 00:51:53,445
SOME PEOPLE JUST CLICK,
YOU KNOW?

1269
00:51:53,478 --> 00:51:54,947
- ALL RIGHT.
- LET'S DANCE!

1270
00:51:54,980 --> 00:51:57,048
LET'S GET READY
TO MOVE THE MOUNTAINS.

1271
00:51:57,082 --> 00:51:59,583
AND SOMEONE GET ME
AN EYELASH CURLER!

1272
00:51:59,617 --> 00:52:00,952
- HEY!
- OY!

1273
00:52:00,985 --> 00:52:04,088
- WHICH WAY?
- OVER TO THE LEFT
A LITTLE.

1274
00:52:04,122 --> 00:52:07,225
HE SHOULD'VE PICKED A BETTER
PLACE TO BE A STREET COMIC.

1275
00:52:11,497 --> 00:52:13,265
I'M LOOKING FOR
A GIRL WITH BIG BONES.

1276
00:52:13,298 --> 00:52:15,567
- YEAH, WHO ISN'T, BUDDY?
- THAT WAY.

1277
00:52:15,600 --> 00:52:18,102
WE REPRESENT
THE LOLLIPOP GUILD.

1278
00:52:18,135 --> 00:52:20,072
CATCH YOU LATER.

1279
00:52:23,242 --> 00:52:25,743
WELP, NIGHT LIFE
AIN'T NO GOOD LIFE,

1280
00:52:25,777 --> 00:52:27,778
BUT IT'S MY LIFE.

1281
00:52:27,812 --> 00:52:30,748
IT'S A THEATRE DE LA
JEUNE LUNE PRODUCTION.

1282
00:52:32,983 --> 00:52:35,520
I'VE LOST MY ACCENT,
ANYONE SEEN IT?

1283
00:52:35,553 --> 00:52:37,488
ACCENT, ABOUT THIS BIG?

1284
00:52:40,958 --> 00:52:43,962
AH, GENERAL
ADMISSION BITES.

1285
00:52:43,995 --> 00:52:46,698
BOY, A TEAM STARTS DOING WELL,
THE PLACE JUST FILLS UP, EH?

1286
00:52:46,732 --> 00:52:48,200
YEAH.

1287
00:52:48,233 --> 00:52:50,102
EDWAY! I HEARD YOU WAS DEAD.

1288
00:52:50,135 --> 00:52:53,070
I'M LOOKING FOR A GIRL
WITH BIG BONES.

1289
00:52:53,103 --> 00:52:55,640
WHERE DID I SEE THEM?

1290
00:52:59,477 --> 00:53:02,213
WHOO, DOUG HENNING GOES
UNDERCOVER, UNDERGROUND.

1291
00:53:02,247 --> 00:53:04,748
- WHERE'S THE GIRL?
- I SAW THEM GO THROUGH THERE.

1292
00:53:04,782 --> 00:53:07,118
COME ON, PLACE YOUR BETS!

1293
00:53:07,152 --> 00:53:08,987
NOW THERE'S THE GIRL
WITH THE BIG BONES.

1294
00:53:09,020 --> 00:53:11,155
SHE'S WITH THE GUY
WITH THE SMALL BONES.

1295
00:53:13,258 --> 00:53:15,927
THEN THE DANNY DEVITO
ENTOURAGE ARRIVES.

1296
00:53:17,528 --> 00:53:20,298
♪ ROUGH CLOWNS,
OUT IN THE STREET ♪

1297
00:53:20,332 --> 00:53:22,233
♪ I WANNA BITE
AND KISS YOU ♪

1298
00:53:22,267 --> 00:53:24,235
GYMKATA!

1299
00:53:24,268 --> 00:53:26,237
JOE MANTEGNA!

1300
00:53:26,270 --> 00:53:29,140
SWEETHEART SHOWING
SOME SPUNK.

1301
00:53:29,173 --> 00:53:30,742
- I HATE SPUNK!
- BIG CONFIDENCE

1302
00:53:30,775 --> 00:53:34,312
FROM AN ALIEN WHO
WALKS LIKE A TROLL.

1303
00:53:34,345 --> 00:53:36,047
DRESSES LIKE A WORM,

1304
00:53:36,080 --> 00:53:37,315
AND A VOICE

1305
00:53:37,348 --> 00:53:39,883
THAT GIVES EVERYONE
A HEADACHE.

1306
00:53:39,918 --> 00:53:41,987
- ARE YOU MY BOYFRIEND?
- I LIKE HER VOICE, MAMBINO.

1307
00:53:44,522 --> 00:53:45,957
PAUL WESTERBERG
TO THE RESCUE.

1308
00:53:45,990 --> 00:53:48,927
YAY!

1309
00:53:48,960 --> 00:53:50,695
EDWIN.

1310
00:53:50,728 --> 00:53:51,797
GUS!

1311
00:53:51,830 --> 00:53:53,197
YOU LOOK TERRIBLE IN PLAID.

1312
00:53:53,230 --> 00:53:55,133
I THOUGHT YOU WAS DEAD.

1313
00:53:55,167 --> 00:53:58,337
- WELL, I'M BACK.
- AND MORE AUSTRALIAN
THAN EVER.

1314
00:53:59,770 --> 00:54:02,107
YOU NEVER DID ANYTHING
FOR ANYONE.

1315
00:54:02,140 --> 00:54:03,842
BUT YOU ARE THE WIND
BENEATH MY WINGS.

1316
00:54:03,875 --> 00:54:06,210
YOU'RE TOO SELFISH
TO BE A HERO.

1317
00:54:06,243 --> 00:54:08,913
YEAH.

1318
00:54:11,515 --> 00:54:14,485
STEVE?

1319
00:54:14,518 --> 00:54:16,420
JOEL GREY IN
<i>DEATH CABARET 5.</i>

1320
00:54:16,453 --> 00:54:18,457
GO ON, MOVE.

1321
00:54:18,490 --> 00:54:21,458
BEFORE I MAKE YOU WISH
YOU STAYED DEAD.

1322
00:54:21,492 --> 00:54:23,828
BUT YOU SEE, I WAS NEVER
DEAD IN THE FIRST PLACE.

1323
00:54:23,862 --> 00:54:26,130
DON'T CALL ME--

1324
00:54:26,163 --> 00:54:28,767
NO, NOW HE'S GOT CLOWN WHITE
ALL OVER HIS HANDS.

1325
00:54:28,800 --> 00:54:32,437
CAN'T GET THAT OUT.

1326
00:54:32,470 --> 00:54:33,605
[GUS GRUNTS]

1327
00:54:33,638 --> 00:54:36,040
KILL HIM! KILL HIM!

1328
00:54:36,073 --> 00:54:38,810
HE COULD AT LEAST
STYLE HIS EYELASHES.

1329
00:54:40,612 --> 00:54:42,180
CORN ROLL.

1330
00:54:45,617 --> 00:54:47,452
HERE, HIT ME WITH THIS!

1331
00:54:47,485 --> 00:54:49,153
KILL HIM!

1332
00:54:49,187 --> 00:54:50,255
KILL HIM!

1333
00:54:54,325 --> 00:54:57,595
SHE'S ARMED WITH
A LADY THURINGER.

1334
00:54:57,628 --> 00:54:59,430
THIS FEELS REALLY
GOOD IN MY HAND.

1335
00:54:59,463 --> 00:55:02,333
IT'S FIRM, BUT IT GIVES.

1336
00:55:02,367 --> 00:55:04,968
UM, ARE WE IN
AN ACTION SEQUENCE?

1337
00:55:05,003 --> 00:55:07,738
NO.

1338
00:55:07,772 --> 00:55:10,108
I WAS JUST SITTING THERE,
WAITING FOR YOU,

1339
00:55:10,142 --> 00:55:11,375
WHEN THIS WOMAN WITH
TOO MUCH MAKEUP--

1340
00:55:11,408 --> 00:55:13,745
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT,
THERE'S NO TIME.

1341
00:55:13,778 --> 00:55:15,813
LET'S LOOK UP HIS
PANT LEG.

1342
00:55:15,847 --> 00:55:17,482
HUH? HEY, THAT'S WEIRD.

1343
00:55:17,515 --> 00:55:18,550
OH, SORRY.

1344
00:55:18,583 --> 00:55:19,883
--HIS NAME'S
PROFESSOR GALBA.

1345
00:55:19,917 --> 00:55:22,120
IS HE POOP DECK PAPPY
OR SOMETHING?

1346
00:55:22,153 --> 00:55:24,288
HE'S MOVED TO A DISTRICT
CALLED THE PITS.

1347
00:55:24,322 --> 00:55:25,990
- WHAT ABOUT MY DAD?
- WHOA!

1348
00:55:26,023 --> 00:55:28,025
THAT'LL MAKE YOUR
SHAMROCK SHAKE.

1349
00:55:28,058 --> 00:55:30,628
WHOA! I'M GONNA GET
MY SHILLELAGH.

1350
00:55:30,662 --> 00:55:32,530
--GO WITHOUT MY DAD, GUS.

1351
00:55:32,563 --> 00:55:34,465
WELL, SOONER OR LATER,
THEY'LL FIND YOU.

1352
00:55:34,498 --> 00:55:36,000
AND IF THEY FIND YOU,

1353
00:55:36,033 --> 00:55:37,635
- MM-HMM?
- THEY COULD KILL YOU.

1354
00:55:37,668 --> 00:55:39,270
OH, BY THE WAY,
I SAW YOUR BUTT.

1355
00:55:39,303 --> 00:55:40,972
WE GOTTA GO, UNDERSTAND?

1356
00:55:41,005 --> 00:55:43,475
NOT WITHOUT MY DAD, GUS!

1357
00:55:43,508 --> 00:55:46,778
AND HERE HE IS NOW!

1358
00:55:46,812 --> 00:55:49,547
COME ON,
DON'T GET SEPARATED.

1359
00:55:49,580 --> 00:55:52,417
♪ DA DA DA DA-DA-DA
DA-DA-DA DA-DA-DA ♪

1360
00:55:52,450 --> 00:55:53,985
[BOTS CONTINUE HUMMING]

1361
00:55:56,187 --> 00:55:58,757
OOPS.

1362
00:55:58,790 --> 00:56:00,258
I'LL MEET YOU AT ROEYIS'S!

1363
00:56:00,292 --> 00:56:03,695
WHATEVER MAY OCCUR,
I WILL FIND YOU!

1364
00:56:03,728 --> 00:56:06,030
WHOA, A LOT OF LOOSE LUMBER
THERE IN ATLANTIS.

1365
00:56:08,065 --> 00:56:09,467
SO, WHY IS IT THAT

1366
00:56:09,500 --> 00:56:11,970
THE ACTION SEQUENCES
SLOW THIS MOVIE DOWN?

1367
00:56:13,572 --> 00:56:15,607
EH, IT HURTS TO BE PRETTY.

1368
00:56:17,708 --> 00:56:18,843
SHE COULD REALLY USE A SLIP,

1369
00:56:18,877 --> 00:56:21,045
SO ATLANTEANS DON'T SEE
HER NAUGHTY BITS.

1370
00:56:23,113 --> 00:56:25,917
HMM, I NEED CAMPHO-PHENIQUE.

1371
00:56:27,085 --> 00:56:28,753
WHERE'S THE FOOD COURT?

1372
00:56:31,322 --> 00:56:32,590
OH GEE, IT'S SUSAN!

1373
00:56:32,623 --> 00:56:34,125
IF SHE SEES ME IN HER
DRESS, SHE'LL KILL ME!

1374
00:56:34,158 --> 00:56:36,393
YOU KNOW ANOTHER NICE THING
ABOUT ATLANTIS?

1375
00:56:36,427 --> 00:56:37,495
IT'S ALL UNDER ONE ROOF,

1376
00:56:37,528 --> 00:56:39,230
YOU CAN JUST SPEND
THE WHOLE DAY THERE.

1377
00:56:43,333 --> 00:56:46,470
SHE'S GOT A TAIL.

1378
00:56:46,503 --> 00:56:49,540
SHE DOES.

1379
00:56:49,573 --> 00:56:50,808
[SERVO SNIFFS]

1380
00:56:50,842 --> 00:56:53,243
I SMELL PATCHOULI.

1381
00:56:55,613 --> 00:56:56,782
OH, POOPIE!

1382
00:56:56,815 --> 00:56:59,917
THERE SHE IS! THERE SHE IS!

1383
00:56:59,950 --> 00:57:02,320
HEY, HEY!

1384
00:57:02,353 --> 00:57:04,822
WHERE DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE GOING?

1385
00:57:07,525 --> 00:57:10,128
UH, CAN I SEE
THE PROJECTIONIST PLEASE?

1386
00:57:20,138 --> 00:57:22,573
- WHERE'D SHE GO?
- THAT WAY!

1387
00:57:22,607 --> 00:57:24,408
COME ON! COME ALONG.

1388
00:57:24,442 --> 00:57:26,477
MIDDLE-DISTANCE RUNNER
SUZY HAMILTON.

1389
00:57:26,510 --> 00:57:28,480
HEY, STOP!

1390
00:57:28,513 --> 00:57:29,713
OKAY.

1391
00:57:29,747 --> 00:57:31,883
HOLD IT, I THINK YOU'RE
GONNA LIKE THIS PICTURE.

1392
00:57:31,917 --> 00:57:34,818
LOVE THAT BOD.

1393
00:57:34,852 --> 00:57:36,420
I'VE GOT AN IDEA.

1394
00:57:36,453 --> 00:57:38,623
I'LL MOVE THE PATCH
TO THE OTHER EYE.

1395
00:57:38,657 --> 00:57:39,923
IF SHANK FAILS US--

1396
00:57:39,957 --> 00:57:41,292
SPECIAL AGENT SHANK.

1397
00:57:41,325 --> 00:57:43,293
I THINK I KNOW HOW TO FIND
WANDA SAKNUSSEMM.

1398
00:57:43,327 --> 00:57:46,330
GIVING HER
THE HAIRY EYEBALL.

1399
00:57:46,363 --> 00:57:47,798
LOTTO.

1400
00:57:47,832 --> 00:57:49,833
LOTTO, GENERAL?

1401
00:57:49,867 --> 00:57:52,603
- HELLO, AND WHAT DO YOU
THINK OF THE FILM, HMM?
- LOTTO.

1402
00:57:54,872 --> 00:57:58,008
ATTENTION, SHOPPERS, THE STORE
WILL BE CLOSING IN TEN MINUTES.

1403
00:57:58,042 --> 00:58:00,512
I BET ATLANTIS HAS
EXTENDED HOURS, THOUGH.

1404
00:58:03,280 --> 00:58:06,885
BRING WHAT, BRING WHAT,
BRING WHAT, VINA?

1405
00:58:06,918 --> 00:58:09,353
YOU KNOW, THIS GUY
RISKS OVEREXPOSURE.

1406
00:58:09,387 --> 00:58:11,555
--AND LOTS OF LOTTO MONEY

1407
00:58:11,588 --> 00:58:13,057
WILL BE YOURS.

1408
00:58:13,090 --> 00:58:14,892
- BIG EYES, KATHY.
- YOU WILL BE RICH

1409
00:58:14,925 --> 00:58:16,727
BEYOND YOUR WILDEST DREAMS.

1410
00:58:16,760 --> 00:58:19,030
IT'S LIKE THE
MRS. KHRUSHCHEV CLUB HERE.

1411
00:58:19,063 --> 00:58:21,098
ISN'T THAT RIGHT, VINA?

1412
00:58:21,132 --> 00:58:22,733
SHE'S OUT THERE.

1413
00:58:22,767 --> 00:58:24,602
SOMEWHERE, ANYWHERE.

1414
00:58:24,635 --> 00:58:27,438
SHE COULD BE STANDING
RIGHT NEXT TO YOU.

1415
00:58:27,472 --> 00:58:29,773
IT'S YOU! I WON, I WON.

1416
00:58:29,807 --> 00:58:32,443
ALL RIGHT, MAKE A WISH.

1417
00:58:32,477 --> 00:58:36,213
- I SAW HER FIRST!
- SHE'S MINE!

1418
00:58:36,247 --> 00:58:39,817
OH, AND IT'S A SCRAM
FOR KATHY.

1419
00:58:39,850 --> 00:58:41,652
EXCUSE ME, OH, EXCUSE ME.

1420
00:58:41,685 --> 00:58:44,322
EXCUSE ME, EXCUSE ME.

1421
00:58:48,025 --> 00:58:49,927
[P.A. VOICE]
IT'S EASY TO PLAY LOTTO.

1422
00:58:49,960 --> 00:58:52,197
JUST FIND
THE BIG-BONED GIRL.

1423
00:58:52,230 --> 00:58:54,632
HELLO, CITIZEN.

1424
00:58:57,902 --> 00:59:01,238
OH, AND HERE COMES
KID CREOLE IN HOT PURSUIT.

1425
00:59:01,272 --> 00:59:04,742
[CROW HUMS]

1426
00:59:09,613 --> 00:59:11,983
JULIET, JULIET!

1427
00:59:12,017 --> 00:59:13,150
ATCHOO!

1428
00:59:20,492 --> 00:59:22,060
SPLENDID.

1429
00:59:22,093 --> 00:59:24,495
WELL, IT'S THE VERY LATEST
FROM LUMERIA.

1430
00:59:24,528 --> 00:59:27,598
JANET JACKSON'S
STOMACH STAND-IN.

1431
00:59:27,632 --> 00:59:30,302
BUT OF COURSE, ON YOU,
IT LOOKS ABSOLUTELY SMASHING.

1432
00:59:30,335 --> 00:59:32,337
OH NO, BRONSON PINCHOT.

1433
00:59:32,370 --> 00:59:33,470
NO, JUST THIS.

1434
00:59:33,503 --> 00:59:34,805
AH, ALL RIGHT, WELL, UH,

1435
00:59:34,838 --> 00:59:37,075
RUSTY DULL ONES OR CHARGE?

1436
00:59:37,108 --> 00:59:40,612
I HATE THAT STRUCTURE STORE.

1437
00:59:40,645 --> 00:59:43,480
THIS IS WORTH MY WALKMAN
AND MY DUMB PURSE.

1438
00:59:45,550 --> 00:59:48,018
GOD.

1439
00:59:48,052 --> 00:59:50,187
SHE WALKS LIKE JIM MCMAHON.

1440
00:59:50,220 --> 00:59:52,123
I DON'T CARE.

1441
00:59:59,463 --> 01:00:02,367
SHE'S A REGULAR SONNY SPOON.

1442
01:00:08,840 --> 01:00:10,975
GOTCHA!

1443
01:00:11,008 --> 01:00:13,410
AH, SHE'S SCREAMING
HER WAY TO SAFETY.

1444
01:00:17,282 --> 01:00:19,783
OH NO, THE LIGHT'S
CHASING AFTER HER!

1445
01:00:23,053 --> 01:00:25,723
OH, PARDON ME.
HE HURT MY SHOULDER.

1446
01:00:25,757 --> 01:00:26,823
LOOK AT THAT,
IT'S ALL DIRTY.

1447
01:00:26,857 --> 01:00:28,425
HEY.

1448
01:00:28,458 --> 01:00:30,962
HELLO, BABE.

1449
01:00:30,995 --> 01:00:33,330
- BIG BOPPER.
- HE'S THREATENING HER
WITH A PUZZLE PIECE.

1450
01:00:35,065 --> 01:00:37,968
THAT WAS REAL CUTE
BACK THERE.

1451
01:00:38,002 --> 01:00:39,903
OH, NOT THE EARWAX!

1452
01:00:39,937 --> 01:00:42,840
GO AHEAD, SCREAM
ALL YOU WANT.

1453
01:00:42,873 --> 01:00:45,943
BUT EAT ALL YOU SCREAM.

1454
01:00:45,977 --> 01:00:48,145
LET ME HEAR IT.

1455
01:00:48,178 --> 01:00:50,515
HEY, I'M WOODY HARRELSON,
AREN'T I?

1456
01:00:52,783 --> 01:00:56,320
YOU AIN'T WORTH
NOTHING TO NOBODY.

1457
01:00:56,353 --> 01:00:59,190
SPEAKING OF WORTH NOTHING,

1458
01:00:59,223 --> 01:01:01,158
HELLO? ANYONE KNOW
WHAT HAPPENED?

1459
01:01:01,192 --> 01:01:03,193
NO, BUT IT WAS VERY TENSE.

1460
01:01:05,430 --> 01:01:09,400
KIND OF BIG-BONED FOR
A TROLL, AREN'T YOU?

1461
01:01:09,433 --> 01:01:11,568
I'M NOT REALLY A TROLL.

1462
01:01:11,602 --> 01:01:13,503
YEAH RIGHT, NEITHER AM I.

1463
01:01:13,537 --> 01:01:14,838
WELL, YOU'RE NOT.

1464
01:01:14,872 --> 01:01:16,140
WHO ARE YOU?

1465
01:01:16,173 --> 01:01:19,177
I'M CHARMIN, AS IN STYLE,
GOOD LOOKS, AND PANACHE.

1466
01:01:19,210 --> 01:01:21,778
LOOK.

1467
01:01:21,812 --> 01:01:24,215
I KNOW YOU WANT ME
TO SWEEP YOU OFF YOUR FEET.

1468
01:01:24,248 --> 01:01:25,550
I'LL LOVE YOU TILL I DIE.

1469
01:01:25,583 --> 01:01:26,950
I WANT YOU TO GET
OFF MY FOOT.

1470
01:01:26,983 --> 01:01:28,887
BUT I AIN'T GOT
THE TIME RIGHT NOW.

1471
01:01:28,920 --> 01:01:30,287
I'M ON MY WAY TO ROB.

1472
01:01:30,320 --> 01:01:32,157
BOY, YOU REALLY LIKE
BLUE CHEESE, DON'T YOU.

1473
01:01:32,190 --> 01:01:33,925
YOU KNOW,
BORROW SOME FUNDS.

1474
01:01:33,958 --> 01:01:37,062
AND THAT GWEEB BACK THERE
HAS MADE ME LATE.

1475
01:01:37,095 --> 01:01:39,197
- BUT I--
- LOOK,

1476
01:01:39,230 --> 01:01:40,363
I KNOW IT'S DISAPPOINTING,

1477
01:01:40,398 --> 01:01:42,133
- BUT, UH--
- I'M NOT MARK HAMILL.

1478
01:01:42,167 --> 01:01:44,035
THERE'LL BE ANOTHER TIME.

1479
01:01:44,068 --> 01:01:46,103
ANOTHER PLACE.

1480
01:01:46,137 --> 01:01:47,372
WAIT.

1481
01:01:47,405 --> 01:01:49,340
I'M NOT THE LEAST
ATTRACTED TO YOU.

1482
01:01:49,373 --> 01:01:53,177
I'M LOST, AND SOME
PEOPLE ARE AFTER ME.

1483
01:01:53,210 --> 01:01:54,512
COULD YOU PLEASE
HELP ME OUT?

1484
01:01:54,545 --> 01:01:56,047
I KNOW IT'S A LOT TO ASK.

1485
01:01:56,080 --> 01:01:58,348
- DAMES.
- I TOLD YOU, I'M BUSY.

1486
01:01:58,382 --> 01:02:00,485
HEY, COUNT CHOCULA,
CLEAR THE SHOT, WILL YOU?

1487
01:02:00,518 --> 01:02:02,353
I'M REALLY IN TROUBLE.

1488
01:02:02,387 --> 01:02:04,355
BAD TROUBLE.

1489
01:02:11,662 --> 01:02:13,663
BATTER UP!

1490
01:02:13,697 --> 01:02:15,967
YES, MAY I HELP YOU-- AAH!

1491
01:02:17,968 --> 01:02:21,672
SHE'S GONNA RALPH!

1492
01:02:21,705 --> 01:02:23,373
OKAY, MAYBE
I MIGHT HELP YOU.

1493
01:02:23,407 --> 01:02:24,742
IT'S ONLY BECAUSE
I'M A SUCKER

1494
01:02:24,775 --> 01:02:26,010
FOR BIG-BONED DOLLS
IN TROUBLE.

1495
01:02:26,043 --> 01:02:27,778
NOW, TELL ME
YOUR PROBLEMS,

1496
01:02:27,812 --> 01:02:29,747
AND I'LL DECIDE
IF I GOT THE TIME.

1497
01:02:29,780 --> 01:02:32,048
WELL, IT ALL STARTED
WHEN I WAS TEN YEARS OLD--

1498
01:02:32,082 --> 01:02:34,285
- WAIT A SECOND.
- WHAT?

1499
01:02:34,318 --> 01:02:35,787
IS THAT REALLY YOUR VOICE?

1500
01:02:35,820 --> 01:02:38,455
JEEZ, I'D SLAP
THIS MOVIE IF I COULD.

1501
01:02:38,488 --> 01:02:39,723
--WAS ABOUT TO KILL ME,

1502
01:02:39,757 --> 01:02:41,092
AND THEN YOU SHOWED UP
TO SAVE MY LIFE, CHARMIN.

1503
01:02:41,125 --> 01:02:42,460
YOU'RE CRAZY--

1504
01:02:42,493 --> 01:02:45,195
I WANNA SHOW YOU MY KATHY
IRELAND BOOKS-ON-TAPE SOMETIME.

1505
01:02:45,228 --> 01:02:47,865
--ABOUT ME BEING AN ALIEN
FROM THE SURFACE WORLD?

1506
01:02:47,898 --> 01:02:49,233
NOW THAT YOU'VE GONE--

1507
01:02:49,267 --> 01:02:50,702
HEY, MAYBE THEY'LL RUN INTO
SPINAL TAP DOWN THERE.

1508
01:02:50,735 --> 01:02:52,068
HE SEEMS LIKE
A SELFISH PEBBLE-HEAD

1509
01:02:52,102 --> 01:02:54,705
WHO DIDN'T CARE ABOUT
ANYBODY EXCEPT HIMSELF.

1510
01:02:54,738 --> 01:02:55,940
I USED TO THINK SO.

1511
01:02:55,973 --> 01:02:57,308
OH, AND NOW YOU LIKE HIM.

1512
01:02:57,342 --> 01:02:59,910
I THINK I UNDERSTAND HIM
A LITTLE.

1513
01:02:59,943 --> 01:03:01,678
HEY, HEY, YOU
JUST LAPPED YOURSELF.

1514
01:03:01,712 --> 01:03:03,113
YOU KNOW, IT'S STILL
HARD TO GO THROUGH

1515
01:03:03,147 --> 01:03:06,583
FOR SOMEONE WHO MAY
NOT WANT TO SEE YOU.

1516
01:03:06,617 --> 01:03:08,552
SHE'S WALKING LIKE
SHERMAN HEMSLEY.

1517
01:03:11,055 --> 01:03:12,557
- YOU'RE A--
- SHAPE-SHIFTER.

1518
01:03:12,590 --> 01:03:16,027
--VERY UNUSUAL GIRL, WANDA.

1519
01:03:16,060 --> 01:03:17,528
AND I MEAN,
MORE THAN BECAUSE

1520
01:03:17,562 --> 01:03:19,163
YOUR VOICE IS SO STRANGE.

1521
01:03:19,197 --> 01:03:21,798
WHAT EXACTLY IS WRONG
WITH MY VOICE?

1522
01:03:27,705 --> 01:03:30,575
COME ON, THE SALOON
IS THIS WAY.

1523
01:03:33,110 --> 01:03:35,245
<i>HECKRAISER, PART TWO!</i>

1524
01:03:39,750 --> 01:03:41,652
NO!

1525
01:03:45,957 --> 01:03:47,258
HEY, STAY AWAY FROM HIM.

1526
01:03:47,292 --> 01:03:50,728
I THINK HE MIGHT MAYBE
BE MY BOYFRIEND MAYBE.

1527
01:03:50,762 --> 01:03:52,463
JEEZ, WHAT, DID HE
BLUE-RINSE HIS FACE?

1528
01:03:54,898 --> 01:03:57,067
[BOTS GRUNT, GROAN]

1529
01:03:58,870 --> 01:04:02,038
ALL RIGHT, KIDS,
SOMETHING REALLY SCARY!

1530
01:04:04,875 --> 01:04:07,678
OH, HE SHOULDN'T FIGHT
IN HIS HEADGEAR.

1531
01:04:14,085 --> 01:04:16,153
OH, SUDDENLY IT'S THE END
OF <i>HIGHLANDER.</i>

1532
01:04:16,187 --> 01:04:18,755
- THE SERIES, OR THE...
- THERE'S TOO MANY OF THEM.

1533
01:04:18,788 --> 01:04:22,460
OH, WHO CARES?

1534
01:04:22,493 --> 01:04:23,827
D'OH.

1535
01:04:29,867 --> 01:04:31,135
OH, WHAT DO YOU USE
ON THIS FLOOR?

1536
01:04:31,168 --> 01:04:33,170
IT'S GREAT,
I CAN SEE MYSELF.

1537
01:04:36,340 --> 01:04:38,275
WHAT THE?

1538
01:04:39,843 --> 01:04:42,347
THERE CAN BE ONLY ONE!

1539
01:04:46,117 --> 01:04:48,752
NOBODY BEATS MIDAS, NOBODY.

1540
01:04:51,522 --> 01:04:53,023
HEY, BATTER BATTER, HEY!

1541
01:04:53,057 --> 01:04:55,092
SHE'S A LOOKER!

1542
01:04:55,125 --> 01:04:57,795
NOT NOW, HONEY,
DADDY'S KILLING, PLEASE.

1543
01:04:57,828 --> 01:05:00,463
♪ A DOUBLE MURDER'S
WAITING FOR YOU ♪

1544
01:05:03,968 --> 01:05:06,637
2-CALORIE QUEST.

1545
01:05:06,670 --> 01:05:09,207
GO TELL FRANKENBERRY.

1546
01:05:10,340 --> 01:05:12,075
- WAIT FOR IT.
- [MAN HITS GROUND]

1547
01:05:15,847 --> 01:05:18,082
SO, LUNCH?

1548
01:05:18,115 --> 01:05:19,383
GUESS THAT SHOWED HIM, HUH?

1549
01:05:19,417 --> 01:05:21,952
YOU SURE DID - WHAT?

1550
01:05:25,022 --> 01:05:26,223
LOOK, WANDA,

1551
01:05:26,257 --> 01:05:27,858
OH, I'M ADAM ANT.

1552
01:05:27,892 --> 01:05:30,393
I-- I DON'T KNOW IF YOU'RE
AN ALIEN OR WHAT.

1553
01:05:30,427 --> 01:05:34,332
BUT I DO BELIEVE YOU'RE
HERE TO FIND YOUR FATHER.

1554
01:05:34,365 --> 01:05:36,200
HEY!

1555
01:05:36,233 --> 01:05:38,768
I KNOW WHERE
HER FATHER-- OH.

1556
01:05:41,705 --> 01:05:43,540
FOR WHATEVER REASON,
THE CITY'S OUT TO GET YOU,

1557
01:05:43,573 --> 01:05:45,342
SO YOU-- YOU GOTTA
GET OUT OF HERE

1558
01:05:45,375 --> 01:05:47,878
BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE
FOR EVEN ME TO SAVE YOU.

1559
01:05:47,912 --> 01:05:49,380
DO YOU MEAN ME?

1560
01:05:49,413 --> 01:05:50,748
OH, THAT'S JUST
THE OTHER PLOT.

1561
01:05:50,782 --> 01:05:52,650
YOU GET GOING,
I'LL HOLD THEM OFF.

1562
01:05:52,683 --> 01:05:53,750
BUT--

1563
01:05:53,783 --> 01:05:55,085
IT'LL BE EASIER
WITH YOU GONE.

1564
01:05:55,118 --> 01:05:56,420
IT USUALLY IS.

1565
01:05:56,453 --> 01:05:58,422
I MIGHT HAVE TO DO SOMETHING
I DON'T WANT YOU TO SEE.

1566
01:05:58,455 --> 01:05:59,757
WHAT, CHARMIN?

1567
01:05:59,790 --> 01:06:01,458
- NEVER MIND.
- JUST SQUEEZE ME.

1568
01:06:01,492 --> 01:06:03,260
--SALOON IS NEARBY.

1569
01:06:03,293 --> 01:06:04,862
JUST UP THAT ALLEY.

1570
01:06:04,895 --> 01:06:07,130
HIDE THERE, AND I'LL
MEET YOU IF I CAN.

1571
01:06:07,163 --> 01:06:09,067
UH, MY WATER JUST BROKE.

1572
01:06:09,100 --> 01:06:11,835
WILL I EVER SEE YOU AGAIN?

1573
01:06:11,868 --> 01:06:14,005
YOU NEVER KNOW, WANDA.

1574
01:06:16,273 --> 01:06:17,675
THE PROBLEMS OF TWO
SECOND-RATE ACTORS

1575
01:06:17,708 --> 01:06:19,677
DON'T AMOUNT TO A HILL OF BEANS
IN THIS CRAZY UNDERWORLD.

1576
01:06:19,710 --> 01:06:22,178
CRAZY.

1577
01:06:22,212 --> 01:06:25,048
ANOTHER TIME,
ANOTHER PLACE.

1578
01:06:25,082 --> 01:06:27,217
NOW GO ON, GET OUT OF HERE.

1579
01:06:27,250 --> 01:06:29,220
YOU TASTE LIKE
GOAT CHEESE PIZZA.

1580
01:06:29,253 --> 01:06:30,955
BYE, CHARMIN.

1581
01:06:30,988 --> 01:06:34,158
WE'LL ALWAYS HAVE
BATHOLITH.

1582
01:06:34,192 --> 01:06:36,427
MAN, YOU CAN SEE
RIGHT UP HER SKIRT.

1583
01:06:36,460 --> 01:06:40,363
ANOTHER TIME,
ANOTHER PLACE.

1584
01:06:40,397 --> 01:06:42,467
HEY, NO, AAH.

1585
01:06:42,500 --> 01:06:44,602
PLEASE, WAIT,
I'M GONNA BE SICK.

1586
01:06:47,772 --> 01:06:49,307
NOW, WHO'S MY LOVE INTEREST?

1587
01:06:49,340 --> 01:06:50,975
IS IT THE AUSTRALIAN GUY?

1588
01:06:51,008 --> 01:06:53,243
OH, I KNOW, MARC SINGER'S
GONNA BE IN THIS MOVIE.

1589
01:06:53,277 --> 01:06:56,013
[P.A. VOICE]
ONCE AGAIN, HERE
IS THE GIRL'S IMAGE.

1590
01:06:56,047 --> 01:06:58,015
GIRL ANSWERS TO THE NAME
WANDA SAKNUSSEMM.

1591
01:06:58,048 --> 01:07:00,785
OH, THAT'S MY FLIGHT.

1592
01:07:00,818 --> 01:07:03,453
YOU CAN SEE HOW EASY
IT IS SHE IS TO SPOT.

1593
01:07:03,487 --> 01:07:05,857
SO FIND WANDA AND WIN!

1594
01:07:07,625 --> 01:07:09,927
A GOVERNMENT CORPORATION.

1595
01:07:09,960 --> 01:07:11,262
WELL.

1596
01:07:11,295 --> 01:07:13,897
I GUESS SOMETIMES IT'S JUST FUN
TO SIT AND PEOPLE-WATCH.

1597
01:07:13,930 --> 01:07:15,665
- I GUESS SO.
- THAT'S ANOTHER GREAT THING
ABOUT THE UNDERWORLD,

1598
01:07:15,698 --> 01:07:17,200
- YOU CAN JUST SIT AND WATCH--
- SHUT HIM UP.

1599
01:07:17,233 --> 01:07:18,335
SHUT HIM UP!

1600
01:07:18,368 --> 01:07:19,603
LOOK, EDDIE VAN HALEN.

1601
01:07:19,637 --> 01:07:22,005
THERE SHE IS, GENERAL.

1602
01:07:22,038 --> 01:07:24,542
UH, YOU CAN TELL SHE'S
BRITISH BY HER TEETH.

1603
01:07:26,143 --> 01:07:28,445
EVEN IF I AM BIG-BONED,
WHAT'S SO WRONG WITH THAT?

1604
01:07:28,478 --> 01:07:29,480
DOESN'T MAKE ME
A BAD PERSON, DOES IT?

1605
01:07:29,513 --> 01:07:32,215
I SHOULD GO INSIDE.

1606
01:07:36,820 --> 01:07:38,622
SO, WHAT, THE MOVIE
JUST TAKE A BREAK?

1607
01:07:38,655 --> 01:07:40,223
- I GUESS SO.
- HELLO?

1608
01:07:42,727 --> 01:07:44,995
OH, AT LEAST
SHE'S PORTABLE.

1609
01:07:45,028 --> 01:07:46,197
[WANDA SCREAMS]

1610
01:07:46,230 --> 01:07:49,100
NO SCREAMING
IN THE BASEMENT, KIDS.

1611
01:07:49,133 --> 01:07:50,167
♪ OH WEE OH ♪

1612
01:07:50,200 --> 01:07:53,570
♪ WEE-OH WHOA ♪

1613
01:07:53,603 --> 01:07:55,205
♪ OH WEE OH ♪

1614
01:07:55,238 --> 01:07:57,307
HOW COME THESE VEHICLES
NEVER WORK

1615
01:07:57,340 --> 01:07:58,408
WHEN THEY'RE SUPPOSED TO?

1616
01:07:58,442 --> 01:07:59,677
HE'S ARM-WRESTLING
NO ONE THERE.

1617
01:07:59,710 --> 01:08:02,378
WHERE IS THE GIRL?

1618
01:08:02,412 --> 01:08:04,148
[DISTANT COMMOTION]

1619
01:08:07,117 --> 01:08:08,385
HI, GUS!

1620
01:08:08,418 --> 01:08:12,422
HI, WANDA!

1621
01:08:12,457 --> 01:08:14,492
HEY, WE'RE ON OUR WAY
TO THE 18TH TEE.

1622
01:08:14,525 --> 01:08:16,627
BLOODY HELL.

1623
01:08:16,660 --> 01:08:18,628
SHE'S BEEN ARRESTED.

1624
01:08:29,773 --> 01:08:31,708
- MIKE!
- MIKE!

1625
01:08:31,742 --> 01:08:34,178
- MIKE, MIKE, MIKE!
- MIKE, MIKE, MIKE!

1626
01:08:36,547 --> 01:08:37,782
REACH UNDER THE DESK, MIKE!

1627
01:08:37,815 --> 01:08:39,583
WOW, SOUNDS IMPORTANT.

1628
01:08:39,617 --> 01:08:40,717
OH, IT IS, MIKE.

1629
01:08:40,750 --> 01:08:41,852
THAT'S BECAUSE IT'S THE

1630
01:08:41,885 --> 01:08:43,787
KATHY IRELAND FABULOUS
RANGE OF EMOTIONS

1631
01:08:43,820 --> 01:08:46,890
ACTING GUESSING GAME
BY HASBRO!

1632
01:08:46,923 --> 01:08:48,492
LET'S PLAY.
THE FIRST PHOTO, MIKE,

1633
01:08:48,525 --> 01:08:50,460
PORTRAYS KATHY
IN A LIFE-TRANSFORMING CRISIS.

1634
01:08:50,493 --> 01:08:52,228
MIKE, SHE HAS
JUST BEEN INFORMED

1635
01:08:52,262 --> 01:08:53,897
BY NATIVE RUNNER THAT
HER BELOVED LONG-LOST

1636
01:08:53,930 --> 01:08:55,532
EXPLORER-SLASH-FATHER...

1637
01:08:55,565 --> 01:08:57,000
- IS DEAD! DEAD!
- DEAD! DEAD!

1638
01:08:57,033 --> 01:08:58,735
SHE IS ALONE,
ABANDONED, BEREFT,

1639
01:08:58,768 --> 01:09:00,437
BE-ORPHANED, BEELZEBUB,
BEA ARTHUR, WHATEVER.

1640
01:09:00,470 --> 01:09:01,738
AND HER FACE DISPLAYS--

1641
01:09:01,772 --> 01:09:03,840
THIS IS FOR 50 POINTS,
MR. MIKE NELSON.

1642
01:09:03,873 --> 01:09:05,608
HOLD ON, HOLD ON, DO I HAVE
THE GAME RIGHT HERE,

1643
01:09:05,642 --> 01:09:07,043
YOU LITTLE MONKEYS?
I'M SUPPOSED TO GUESS

1644
01:09:07,077 --> 01:09:08,512
KATHY IRELAND'S EMOTION, HUH?

1645
01:09:08,545 --> 01:09:10,380
ALL RIGHT, I'LL SAY, UM,

1646
01:09:10,413 --> 01:09:12,683
SOUL-WRENCHING SADNESS
MIXED WITH HORROR

1647
01:09:12,717 --> 01:09:13,750
IN THE FACE OF THE VOID.

1648
01:09:13,783 --> 01:09:16,087
AND THE ANSWER IS...

1649
01:09:16,120 --> 01:09:17,522
YOU GOTTA FLIP
THAT THING THERE.

1650
01:09:17,555 --> 01:09:18,588
OH, THIS?

1651
01:09:18,622 --> 01:09:19,657
AND THE ANSWER IS!

1652
01:09:19,690 --> 01:09:20,723
DULL SURPRISE.

1653
01:09:20,757 --> 01:09:23,160
SORRY, MOVE ON,
MR. NELSON.

1654
01:09:23,193 --> 01:09:25,228
YOU'RE 200 POINTS
IN THE HOLE, MIKE,

1655
01:09:25,262 --> 01:09:27,130
LET'S MOVE INTO
THE LIGHTNING ROUND.

1656
01:09:27,163 --> 01:09:29,367
THAT'S RIGHT.
BEGIN HERE, MIKE.

1657
01:09:29,400 --> 01:09:31,802
KATHY DECIDES
TO TRANSFORM HER LIFE.

1658
01:09:31,835 --> 01:09:32,937
HER EMOTION?

1659
01:09:32,970 --> 01:09:35,205
CHURCHILLIAN
DETERMINATION.

1660
01:09:35,238 --> 01:09:37,040
DULL SURPRISE!

1661
01:09:37,073 --> 01:09:39,243
NEXT, HERE KATHY HAS FALLEN

1662
01:09:39,277 --> 01:09:41,145
SEVERAL HUNDRED FEET
INTO A HOLE.

1663
01:09:41,178 --> 01:09:42,278
HER EMOTION?

1664
01:09:42,312 --> 01:09:43,647
UH,

1665
01:09:43,680 --> 01:09:45,215
SHOCK AND HORROR?

1666
01:09:45,248 --> 01:09:47,952
DULL SURPRISE!

1667
01:09:47,985 --> 01:09:50,653
ALL RIGHT, HERE KATHY YANKS
A GOLF CART ONTO HERSELF.

1668
01:09:50,687 --> 01:09:52,155
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT A MINUTE.
WAIT A MINUTE.

1669
01:09:52,188 --> 01:09:54,157
HOW MANY MORE CARDS DO WE--
HEY, CAN YOU WAIT A MINUTE?

1670
01:09:54,190 --> 01:09:55,725
HOW MANY MORE CARDS
DO WE HAVE?

1671
01:09:55,758 --> 01:09:57,928
- 60 OR 70.
- THAT'S ALL.

1672
01:09:57,962 --> 01:10:00,230
ALL RIGHT, WELL, WE'D
BETTER GET STARTED.

1673
01:10:00,263 --> 01:10:01,698
I'M GONNA SAY DULL SURPRISE.

1674
01:10:01,732 --> 01:10:02,933
- DULL SURPRISE!
- DING DING DING!

1675
01:10:02,967 --> 01:10:04,468
- UH, DULL SURPRISE?
- YES!

1676
01:10:04,502 --> 01:10:07,470
DULL SURPRISE, DULL SURPRISE,
DULL SURPRISE, DULL SURPRISE,

1677
01:10:07,503 --> 01:10:09,640
DULL SURPRISE, BOY, I'M REALLY
RACKING UP THE POINTS!

1678
01:10:09,673 --> 01:10:11,542
DULL SURPRISE, DULL SURPRISE,
WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK!

1679
01:10:11,575 --> 01:10:12,910
DULL SURPRISE,
DULL SURPRISE!

1680
01:10:19,883 --> 01:10:21,152
I BELIEVE THE ALIENS ARE
SPIES BEING SENT DOWN--

1681
01:10:21,185 --> 01:10:22,218
DULL SURPRISE.

1682
01:10:22,252 --> 01:10:24,053
VERY GOOD, VERY GOOD, MIKE.

1683
01:10:24,087 --> 01:10:25,622
WE MUST MOBILIZE FOR WAR.

1684
01:10:25,655 --> 01:10:27,825
WE MUST LAUNCH
A MASSIVE RETALIATION.

1685
01:10:27,858 --> 01:10:29,993
YOU'RE OVERREACTING,
GENERAL.

1686
01:10:30,027 --> 01:10:32,028
THEY'RE HERE TO ENSLAVE US.

1687
01:10:32,062 --> 01:10:34,332
- EXCUSE ME, SORRY.
- MAKE TROLLS OUT OF US.

1688
01:10:34,365 --> 01:10:35,365
DIDN'T KNOW THIS WAS
A READ-THROUGH, I'M SORRY.

1689
01:10:35,398 --> 01:10:38,035
I MUST AGREE WITH
CONSUL CRASSUS.

1690
01:10:38,068 --> 01:10:40,370
- WORF!
- THE ALIENS ARE HERE
BY ACCIDENT.

1691
01:10:40,403 --> 01:10:42,205
WOW, ANYBODY KNOW HOW
TO TURN THIS THING OFF?

1692
01:10:42,238 --> 01:10:44,275
WHAT DO YOU SUGGEST
WE DO, CRASSUS?

1693
01:10:44,308 --> 01:10:46,743
SINCE THE ALIENS ARRIVED
ACCIDENTALLY, YOUR LORDSHIP,

1694
01:10:46,777 --> 01:10:48,578
AS YOU MOST SHREWDLY
OBSERVED,

1695
01:10:48,612 --> 01:10:49,913
MAYBE HE COULD DRESS
FOR THE MEETING.

1696
01:10:49,947 --> 01:10:52,182
I SUGGEST WE HELP THEM RETURN
TO THE SURFACE WORLD.

1697
01:10:52,215 --> 01:10:54,685
YOUR PANTYHOSE ARE
ON TOO TIGHT, CRASSUS.

1698
01:10:54,718 --> 01:10:56,687
I BEG YOUR PARDON, RYKOV?

1699
01:10:56,720 --> 01:10:59,490
- LET THE ALIENS FREE.
- WIN CASH PRIZES.

1700
01:10:59,523 --> 01:11:02,627
I FOR ONE DON'T WANT TO BE
RECLASSIFIED AS A TROLL.

1701
01:11:02,660 --> 01:11:04,060
WE WILL RELEASE THEM
ONLY IF THEY AGREE

1702
01:11:04,093 --> 01:11:06,197
NOT TO REVEAL OUR EXISTENCE
TO THEIR WORLD,

1703
01:11:06,230 --> 01:11:07,397
AND NO ONE ELSE
IS TO COME DOWN.

1704
01:11:07,430 --> 01:11:08,532
SEE, I'M A TRAINED DOCTOR.

1705
01:11:08,565 --> 01:11:10,700
WE HAVE NO CHOICE
BUT TO TRUST.

1706
01:11:10,733 --> 01:11:12,870
- TRUST ALIENS?
- HEY, THEY'RE GUEST WORKERS.

1707
01:11:12,903 --> 01:11:15,838
YOUR LORDSHIP, YOU CANNOT
POSSIBLY LISTEN TO CRASSUS.

1708
01:11:15,872 --> 01:11:17,742
YOU KNOW HE'S GOT
THOSE ODD TENDENCIES.

1709
01:11:17,775 --> 01:11:19,477
- OH POOPIE.
- AND WE'VE ALL BEEN
DISCUSSING THE FACT

1710
01:11:19,510 --> 01:11:20,978
THAT HE DYES HIS HAIR.

1711
01:11:21,012 --> 01:11:23,847
THE GENERAL ASIDE,
YOUR LORDSHIP,

1712
01:11:23,880 --> 01:11:25,848
WE ARE NOT MURDERERS.

1713
01:11:25,882 --> 01:11:27,852
- SIR, ACTUALLY WE ARE.
- WE CANNOT LET THEM DIE.

1714
01:11:27,885 --> 01:11:29,853
BRING ME THE ALIENS.

1715
01:11:29,887 --> 01:11:32,923
I'LL FIRST SPEAK TO WANDA.

1716
01:11:32,957 --> 01:11:34,190
THEN DECIDE

1717
01:11:34,223 --> 01:11:35,958
WHETHER TO FREE THEM

1718
01:11:35,993 --> 01:11:38,695
OR TERMINATE.

1719
01:11:38,728 --> 01:11:39,997
COMING ROUND AGAIN.

1720
01:11:40,030 --> 01:11:41,298
OH, AND BY THE WAY, COULD
SOMEBODY GET ME A BUCKET?

1721
01:11:41,332 --> 01:11:43,333
I'M FEELING QUEASY.

1722
01:11:48,105 --> 01:11:49,907
ARE THEY IN
CAPTAIN RON'S BOAT?

1723
01:11:49,940 --> 01:11:52,275
OH, NEVER SAY THAT AGAIN.

1724
01:11:52,308 --> 01:11:53,943
COME ON.

1725
01:11:53,977 --> 01:11:57,580
IT'S OPEN.

1726
01:11:57,613 --> 01:12:00,250
WHY DIDN'T I JUST GET
A DUPLICATE OF THAT KEY?

1727
01:12:02,018 --> 01:12:03,487
- YOUR LORDSHIP?
- YO?

1728
01:12:03,520 --> 01:12:06,190
THIS IS THE WANDA.

1729
01:12:06,223 --> 01:12:07,958
COME HERE, CHILD.

1730
01:12:07,992 --> 01:12:09,527
COME CLOSER.

1731
01:12:09,560 --> 01:12:11,128
PATTIE LABELLE
AS AMADEUS.

1732
01:12:11,162 --> 01:12:13,463
SO YOU ARE THE WANDA.

1733
01:12:13,497 --> 01:12:14,798
YES?

1734
01:12:14,832 --> 01:12:17,633
I'M WANDA SAKNUSSEMM.

1735
01:12:17,667 --> 01:12:19,035
WHY ARE YOU HERE?

1736
01:12:19,068 --> 01:12:20,703
UM, PASS.

1737
01:12:22,940 --> 01:12:24,508
WHERE DO YOU BUY
A TOKEN AROUND HERE,

1738
01:12:24,542 --> 01:12:26,677
FOR CRYING OUT LOUD.

1739
01:12:26,710 --> 01:12:27,978
YOU KNOW, ACTUALLY,
THE TRANSIT SYSTEM

1740
01:12:28,012 --> 01:12:29,413
IN ATLANTIS
IS VERY EFFICIENT--

1741
01:12:29,447 --> 01:12:31,382
- SHUT UP!
- IT WAS PATTERNED AFTER
THE METRO IN PARIS.

1742
01:12:31,415 --> 01:12:33,283
- OR LE METRO IN FRENCH.
- SHUT UP.

1743
01:12:33,317 --> 01:12:36,187
WHAT'S GONNA HAPPEN TO HER?

1744
01:12:36,220 --> 01:12:38,188
LORD OVER IS TRYING
TO DECIDE

1745
01:12:38,222 --> 01:12:41,492
WHETHER TO RELEASE YOU
AND YOUR DAUGHTER

1746
01:12:41,525 --> 01:12:44,260
OR TO TERMINATE YOUR LIVES.

1747
01:12:44,293 --> 01:12:46,063
OH. OH!

1748
01:12:46,097 --> 01:12:47,998
WELL, HOW'S THE LOOK?

1749
01:12:48,032 --> 01:12:50,133
FRUMPY BUT PROFESSIONAL.

1750
01:12:50,167 --> 01:12:51,602
NO, I MEAN IN THERE.

1751
01:12:51,635 --> 01:12:54,638
OH, EVERYTHING
DEPENDS ON WANDA.

1752
01:12:54,672 --> 01:12:57,107
WANDA, WANDA WHO?

1753
01:12:57,140 --> 01:12:59,375
I'M NO EXPLORER

1754
01:12:59,410 --> 01:13:01,378
- OR ADVENTURER.
- YES YOU ARE.

1755
01:13:01,412 --> 01:13:04,515
- AND I'M NOT HERE
TO HURT YOUR WORLD.
- BOGUS.

1756
01:13:04,548 --> 01:13:07,117
- I JUST WANNA FIND MY DAD.
- UH, WHERE'D WE FIND THIS ONE?

1757
01:13:07,150 --> 01:13:09,720
AND THAT'S WHY I'M HERE.

1758
01:13:09,753 --> 01:13:12,155
AND FOR NO OTHER
REASON, SIR.

1759
01:13:12,188 --> 01:13:14,892
OH, PLEASE.

1760
01:13:14,925 --> 01:13:18,462
WANDA? GOT A NICE BIG THERMOS
OF COFFEE HERE FOR YOU.

1761
01:13:18,495 --> 01:13:20,530
I'M WANDA SAKNUSSEMM.

1762
01:13:20,563 --> 01:13:22,132
DON'T WEAR IT OUT-NUSSEMM.

1763
01:13:22,165 --> 01:13:24,768
A WAITRESS FROM L.A. WHO
SHOULD'VE NEVER COME HERE.

1764
01:13:26,170 --> 01:13:27,270
HERE IT COMES.

1765
01:13:27,303 --> 01:13:29,807
AND I JUST REALLY
WANT TO GO HOME NOW.

1766
01:13:29,840 --> 01:13:31,475
- HEY!
- WH-- OH.

1767
01:13:31,508 --> 01:13:34,377
THEY ARE GOING TO MAKE
BROWN-EYED TROLLS OUT OF US.

1768
01:13:34,410 --> 01:13:37,380
OH, SHUT UP, RYKOV.

1769
01:13:37,413 --> 01:13:40,750
ZING.

1770
01:13:40,783 --> 01:13:41,885
COME ON, SAY IT.

1771
01:13:41,918 --> 01:13:43,020
SAY IT, HERE IT COMES.

1772
01:13:43,053 --> 01:13:44,555
DADDY?

1773
01:13:44,588 --> 01:13:46,223
HI, WANDA.

1774
01:13:51,162 --> 01:13:53,363
[ALL] WHOA! AAH!

1775
01:13:53,397 --> 01:13:55,032
HUH, CRIMINY.

1776
01:13:55,065 --> 01:13:56,733
NOW SEE, THIS IS WHAT
HAPPENS WHEN

1777
01:13:56,767 --> 01:13:58,535
YOU TRY TO FIND
THE BIRTH PARENTS.

1778
01:13:58,568 --> 01:14:01,305
SEE?

1779
01:14:01,338 --> 01:14:02,973
BE HOME EARLY!

1780
01:14:05,408 --> 01:14:08,345
WAIT! WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

1781
01:14:08,378 --> 01:14:09,547
PAPA, DON'T PREACH.

1782
01:14:09,580 --> 01:14:12,082
NO! HE'S MY DAD.

1783
01:14:12,115 --> 01:14:14,250
- SO YOU'RE WANDA'S DAD.
- YES, I AM.

1784
01:14:14,283 --> 01:14:17,287
WELL, SHE'S GONE THROUGH A LOT
OF TROUBLE TO FIND YOU.

1785
01:14:17,320 --> 01:14:18,888
STAY PUT WHILE I RECKON
US A WAY OUT.

1786
01:14:18,922 --> 01:14:22,325
HOW LONG HAVE YOU
BEEN SEEING HIM?

1787
01:14:22,358 --> 01:14:24,127
SO, HOW'S YOUR MOTHER?

1788
01:14:24,160 --> 01:14:25,195
- DEAD.
- OH.

1789
01:14:25,228 --> 01:14:27,663
WHY DID YOU COME
LOOKING FOR ME, WANDA?

1790
01:14:32,568 --> 01:14:35,372
BECAUSE YOU'RE MY DAD.

1791
01:14:35,405 --> 01:14:37,073
AH, I SEE, AND, UH,

1792
01:14:37,107 --> 01:14:40,177
YOU CAN PROVE THAT?

1793
01:14:40,210 --> 01:14:41,612
I--

1794
01:14:41,645 --> 01:14:42,913
I'M SORRY--

1795
01:14:42,947 --> 01:14:44,815
IT DOESN'T MATTER NOW.

1796
01:14:47,083 --> 01:14:49,018
YOU'RE MORE THAN
I DESERVE.

1797
01:14:51,322 --> 01:14:54,525
- YEAH.
- EW! WHAT IS THAT?

1798
01:14:54,558 --> 01:14:55,925
GUM SHINE.

1799
01:14:55,958 --> 01:14:58,062
THIS WAY, WE GOTTA BOUNCE!

1800
01:14:58,095 --> 01:14:59,530
WELL THEN, BOUNCE IT IS.

1801
01:14:59,563 --> 01:15:00,863
BOING BOING BOING BOING.

1802
01:15:00,897 --> 01:15:02,798
LOOKS LIKE GRACIE ALLEN
IS BURIED THERE.

1803
01:15:06,237 --> 01:15:09,038
IT'S A GOVERNMENT
HOUSE, THEN?

1804
01:15:09,072 --> 01:15:11,007
WHAT'S THE MATTER?
DID YOU FORGET SOMETHING?

1805
01:15:11,040 --> 01:15:12,977
DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA
HOW REMARKABLE THIS IS?

1806
01:15:13,010 --> 01:15:14,878
- THEY'RE RENTING.
- IT'S A BUILDING.

1807
01:15:14,912 --> 01:15:16,145
NO, IT'S NOT.

1808
01:15:16,178 --> 01:15:17,713
THIS IS A SPACECRAFT.

1809
01:15:17,747 --> 01:15:19,750
CRASHED HERE
TEN MILLENNIA AGO.

1810
01:15:19,783 --> 01:15:21,985
- YEAH RIGHT, POPS.
- FROM OUTER SPACE.

1811
01:15:22,018 --> 01:15:23,553
OUTER SPACE, COME ON!

1812
01:15:23,587 --> 01:15:26,790
OLD MAN, TOYS
IN THE ATTIC, YOU KNOW?

1813
01:15:26,823 --> 01:15:28,558
IS THE TRACKING
SYSTEM WORKING?

1814
01:15:28,592 --> 01:15:30,727
I KNOW WHERE THEY'RE
HEADED NOW, GENERAL.

1815
01:15:30,760 --> 01:15:32,997
I'LL DIRECT YOU
FROM HERE, BY REMOTE.

1816
01:15:33,030 --> 01:15:34,063
DID YOU WANT
AISLE OR WINDOW?

1817
01:15:34,097 --> 01:15:36,700
GOOD WORK, TOLA.

1818
01:15:36,733 --> 01:15:39,402
SO, CRASSUS, I WAS RIGHT ABOUT
THE ALIENS BEING SPIES.

1819
01:15:39,435 --> 01:15:40,870
OH, JUST DO YOUR JOB, RYKOV.

1820
01:15:40,903 --> 01:15:42,338
KILL THE GIRL
AND HER FATHER.

1821
01:15:42,372 --> 01:15:45,575
- RYKOV IN CRISIS.
- I WILL.

1822
01:15:45,608 --> 01:15:47,643
AND THEN I'LL COME BACK
FOR YOU.

1823
01:15:47,677 --> 01:15:51,080
I HEARD THAT!

1824
01:15:51,113 --> 01:15:52,415
WHOA, UH, LOWER
THAN I THOUGHT.

1825
01:15:52,448 --> 01:15:55,852
UNBELIEVABLE, GOOD THING
YOU ACTUALLY MADE IT.

1826
01:15:55,885 --> 01:15:59,322
IT'S KLANDINKTU!

1827
01:15:59,355 --> 01:16:01,123
WHO IS HE?

1828
01:16:01,157 --> 01:16:03,593
HE'S ONLY THE BESTEST DAD
IN THE WHOLE WIDEST WORLD!

1829
01:16:09,165 --> 01:16:11,735
GENERAL, THE ALIENS
ARE APPROACHING

1830
01:16:11,768 --> 01:16:13,137
THE OUTSKIRTS OF THE CITY.

1831
01:16:13,170 --> 01:16:14,237
OH YEAH.

1832
01:16:14,270 --> 01:16:15,738
STATICS AT 58.

1833
01:16:15,772 --> 01:16:18,642
INTERCEPT AT 5.34.

1834
01:16:18,675 --> 01:16:21,143
DRIVER, HEAD FOR
THE OUTSKIRTS OF THE CITY.

1835
01:16:21,177 --> 01:16:23,013
AND DON'T TAKE THE FREEWAY,
IT'S ALL TORN UP.

1836
01:16:23,047 --> 01:16:24,715
ACTUALLY, THE ATLANTEANS
ARE VERY SUPPORTIVE

1837
01:16:24,748 --> 01:16:25,982
OF REFERENDUM BOND ISSUES.

1838
01:16:26,015 --> 01:16:27,517
- THE HIGHWAYS WOULD BE--
- SHUT UP!

1839
01:16:27,550 --> 01:16:29,085
THE GENERAL'S VEHICLE
HAS TURNED

1840
01:16:29,118 --> 01:16:30,420
FOR THE OUTSKIRTS, SIR.

1841
01:16:30,453 --> 01:16:31,755
FOLLOW THE GENERAL.

1842
01:16:31,788 --> 01:16:32,888
JUST DON'T LOSE HER.

1843
01:16:32,922 --> 01:16:36,493
AND PASS ME A SHERRY!

1844
01:16:36,527 --> 01:16:39,162
PROFESSOR SAKNUSSEMM,
I HAVE TO DISAGREE WITH YOU.

1845
01:16:39,195 --> 01:16:41,030
ACCORDING TO MY DATA,
THE INCLINE

1846
01:16:41,063 --> 01:16:42,598
OF THE SURFACE WORLD
HAS CHANGED--

1847
01:16:42,632 --> 01:16:44,500
ROBERT FULGHUM THINKS
HE KNOWS EVERYTHING.

1848
01:16:44,533 --> 01:16:47,070
--THE EASTER REGIONS, THE MAP
OF THE CENTER OF THE WORLD.

1849
01:16:47,103 --> 01:16:49,138
I DON'T DOUBT YOUR
KNOWLEDGE, PROFESSOR.

1850
01:16:49,172 --> 01:16:50,740
BUT I'VE SPENT MY LIFE

1851
01:16:50,773 --> 01:16:53,243
STUDYING AND SEARCHING
FOR THE CENTER OF THE EARTH,

1852
01:16:53,277 --> 01:16:54,443
AND I OBVIOUSLY
DID FIND IT,

1853
01:16:54,477 --> 01:16:55,812
AND IT WASN'T
IN THIS DIRECTION.

1854
01:16:55,845 --> 01:16:57,813
HE'S USING SOMEONE'S
FEET TO STEER.

1855
01:16:57,847 --> 01:16:59,750
I HAVE ALL
THE EQUIPMENT YOU NEED

1856
01:16:59,783 --> 01:17:01,818
FOR YOUR ASCENSION
TO THE SURFACE OF THE WORLD.

1857
01:17:01,852 --> 01:17:03,387
- UNT I'M A WEREWOLF!
- IT'S EITHER MY WAY

1858
01:17:03,420 --> 01:17:07,190
OR NO WAY.

1859
01:17:07,223 --> 01:17:09,827
♪ SHE'S A MANIAC
MA-- ♪

1860
01:17:09,860 --> 01:17:11,662
- WATCH OUT.
- OOH.

1861
01:17:11,695 --> 01:17:13,830
- DAD?
- MRS. LOCKHORN!

1862
01:17:13,863 --> 01:17:15,332
--CAN GET US BACK HOME?

1863
01:17:15,365 --> 01:17:16,433
WE'LL SEE, HONEY.

1864
01:17:16,467 --> 01:17:18,268
IT'S STRAIGHT ON
AHEAD, GUTEN.

1865
01:17:18,302 --> 01:17:21,838
AND DON'T SCRATCH
MY WORM WAGON.

1866
01:17:21,872 --> 01:17:25,275
I BET, IN ATLANTIS,
SALT IS REALLY CHEAP.

1867
01:17:25,308 --> 01:17:28,912
- HUH?
- ISN'T IT CHEAP EVERYWHERE?

1868
01:17:28,945 --> 01:17:30,147
DAD?

1869
01:17:30,180 --> 01:17:32,115
CAN I HAVE A RAISE
IN MY ALLOWANCE?

1870
01:17:34,183 --> 01:17:36,353
WE NOW RETURN TO THE BIG
YOGURT MACHINE.

1871
01:17:38,588 --> 01:17:41,825
WOW, SWEETHEART.

1872
01:17:41,858 --> 01:17:44,027
SO IT'S NOT REALLY
A BOTTOMLESS PIT.

1873
01:17:44,060 --> 01:17:46,062
- IT'S A TOPLESS HOLE.
- PRETTY MUCH.

1874
01:17:46,095 --> 01:17:47,397
END OF THE JOURNEY, EH?

1875
01:17:47,430 --> 01:17:48,498
GOING HOME!

1876
01:17:48,532 --> 01:17:50,400
BOTTOM OF THE WORLD, MA!

1877
01:17:50,433 --> 01:17:51,902
A VACATION.

1878
01:17:51,935 --> 01:17:54,437
IT'S PRETTY IMPRESSIVE,
ISN'T IT?

1879
01:17:54,470 --> 01:17:56,005
IT'S MAGNIFICENT.

1880
01:17:56,038 --> 01:17:57,740
HE'S THE BEST.

1881
01:18:02,345 --> 01:18:04,247
AH, YEAH, WHAT
A BEAUTIFUL DAY.

1882
01:18:04,280 --> 01:18:06,683
ACCORDING
TO MY CALCULATIONS--

1883
01:18:06,717 --> 01:18:08,185
WE'LL NEVER WORK AGAIN.

1884
01:18:08,218 --> 01:18:10,820
--BLASTED ME RIGHT
UP TO THE SURFACE.

1885
01:18:10,853 --> 01:18:12,122
MY GOD, WHY DIDN'T YOU GO?

1886
01:18:12,155 --> 01:18:13,690
I WANTED TO STAY HOME
AND WATCH THE GAME.

1887
01:18:13,723 --> 01:18:15,558
--AND HE SHUT ME DOWN.

1888
01:18:15,592 --> 01:18:18,228
I WAS RUINED AND TOSSED OUT
OF THE UNIVERSITY.

1889
01:18:18,262 --> 01:18:20,163
AH, GOT YOUR NOSE!

1890
01:18:20,197 --> 01:18:21,832
I WAS THROWN OUT
OF THE UNIVERSITY TOO,

1891
01:18:21,865 --> 01:18:23,867
BUT I WOULDN'T
LET THAT STOP ME.

1892
01:18:23,900 --> 01:18:26,437
YES, YES.

1893
01:18:26,470 --> 01:18:28,205
SOME OF US GIVE UP OUR DREAMS

1894
01:18:28,238 --> 01:18:29,873
MORE EASILY THAN OTHERS,
I SUPPOSE.

1895
01:18:29,907 --> 01:18:31,642
I DREAMED OF BEING
A BALLERINA,

1896
01:18:31,675 --> 01:18:32,975
BUT IT WAS TOO IMPRACTICAL.

1897
01:18:33,008 --> 01:18:35,078
--A DIFFERENCE, PROFESSOR,
BETWEEN GIVING UP

1898
01:18:35,112 --> 01:18:37,713
AND LEAVING SOMETHING
UNFINISHED.

1899
01:18:37,747 --> 01:18:41,083
HERE'S YOUR INTERPLAQUE.

1900
01:18:41,117 --> 01:18:44,153
YOU KNOW, I NEVER FINISHED
ANYTHING IN MY LIFE.

1901
01:18:44,187 --> 01:18:46,857
NOT EVEN MY AUSTRALIAN
ACCENT CLASSES.

1902
01:18:46,890 --> 01:18:49,292
TIME I DID.

1903
01:18:49,325 --> 01:18:50,893
HEY, HE'S GOING
TO THE BATHROOM.

1904
01:18:50,927 --> 01:18:52,362
--GO BACK TO ROEYIS.

1905
01:18:52,395 --> 01:18:54,330
WHAT'S RORUS?

1906
01:18:54,363 --> 01:18:56,633
IF SHE'LL TAKE ME.

1907
01:18:56,667 --> 01:18:57,967
OH, THAT ONE REALLY
WHITE LADY.

1908
01:18:58,000 --> 01:19:00,903
SHE'LL MAKE YOU RICHER
THAN ANY MINE DOES.

1909
01:19:03,707 --> 01:19:04,875
I'M A SCIENTIST!

1910
01:19:04,908 --> 01:19:06,042
WANDA.

1911
01:19:06,075 --> 01:19:07,177
SAY GOODBYE TO YOUR
LITTLE FRIEND.

1912
01:19:07,210 --> 01:19:09,278
IT'S TIME FOR DINNER.

1913
01:19:09,312 --> 01:19:11,615
GOODBYE, VAGUE CHARACTER!

1914
01:19:11,648 --> 01:19:13,650
THANKS FOR EVERYTHING, GUS!

1915
01:19:18,555 --> 01:19:19,823
IT'S TIME TO GO.

1916
01:19:19,857 --> 01:19:21,290
NO ONE'S GOING ANYWHERE.

1917
01:19:21,323 --> 01:19:24,260
TILL YOU CLEAN UP YOUR ROOMS.

1918
01:19:24,293 --> 01:19:26,630
YOU BLEW THE DEAL WHEN
YOU TRIED TO ESCAPE.

1919
01:19:26,663 --> 01:19:30,433
YES, YOU BLEW THE DEAL,
YES YES.

1920
01:19:30,467 --> 01:19:33,102
NOW WE HAVE ORDERS
TO EXECUTE YOU.

1921
01:19:34,470 --> 01:19:36,907
WELL, JUST SO YOU
DON'T KILL ME-- HEY!

1922
01:19:36,940 --> 01:19:38,175
I THOUGHT YOU
WANTED US TO LEAVE.

1923
01:19:38,208 --> 01:19:39,708
HEY, HEY, HEY HEY HEY,
WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?

1924
01:19:39,742 --> 01:19:41,645
I'M SORRY, PROFESSOR.

1925
01:19:41,678 --> 01:19:44,080
THAT'S OKAY-- OOH!

1926
01:19:44,113 --> 01:19:45,982
YOU SAW NOTHING.

1927
01:19:46,015 --> 01:19:48,552
TAKE THE GENERAL AWAY.

1928
01:19:48,585 --> 01:19:50,020
WHOA.

1929
01:19:50,053 --> 01:19:52,355
BITCHING LEFT HOOK, CRASSUS.

1930
01:19:52,388 --> 01:19:54,925
[ALL] JUST LEAVE!

1931
01:19:54,958 --> 01:19:57,027
I THINK SHE'S GOING TO BE A
LITTLE UPSET WHEN SHE WAKES UP.

1932
01:19:57,060 --> 01:19:58,695
I'M JOKING IN THE FORM
OF UNDERSTATEMENT.

1933
01:19:58,728 --> 01:19:59,762
I CAN DO THAT,
I'M AN ACTOR.

1934
01:19:59,795 --> 01:20:01,097
--YOU GET INTO TROUBLE
FOR THIS?

1935
01:20:01,130 --> 01:20:02,932
IT'S A SMALL PRICE TO PAY,
NOW MOVE QUICKLY.

1936
01:20:02,965 --> 01:20:04,700
HOLD ON TIGHT
TO ONE ANOTHER.

1937
01:20:04,733 --> 01:20:06,468
GET INTO THE CYCLONIC
COOKING THING.

1938
01:20:06,503 --> 01:20:08,905
I LOVE YOU, HONEY.

1939
01:20:08,938 --> 01:20:10,973
[MONKEY GRUNTS]

1940
01:20:13,410 --> 01:20:15,612
NEXT TIME, CAN WE
FLY FIRST CLASS?

1941
01:20:18,113 --> 01:20:20,083
ANYTHING HAPPENING YET?

1942
01:20:20,117 --> 01:20:21,785
REMEMBER OUR DEAL,
PROFESSOR!

1943
01:20:21,818 --> 01:20:24,020
- NOT A WORD TO ANYONE!
- SO LONG, SUCKERS!

1944
01:20:24,053 --> 01:20:26,188
WE DON'T EXIST!

1945
01:20:37,567 --> 01:20:39,302
WELL, AUNTY PEARL,

1946
01:20:39,335 --> 01:20:41,103
- MINNIE PEARL?
- HOWDY!

1947
01:20:41,137 --> 01:20:43,240
I HAD THIS
REALLY WEIRD DREAM.

1948
01:20:43,273 --> 01:20:44,607
I WAS IN
A GOLAN-GLOBUS FILM.

1949
01:20:44,640 --> 01:20:46,977
- I WENT TO AFRICA.
- WITH SHAFT!

1950
01:20:47,010 --> 01:20:49,345
I FELL DOWN
A BOTTOMLESS PIT.

1951
01:20:49,378 --> 01:20:51,413
INTO THE CENTER
OF THE EARTH.

1952
01:20:51,447 --> 01:20:52,748
AND I ENDED UP

1953
01:20:52,782 --> 01:20:54,150
IN THIS CITY
CALLED ATLANTIS.

1954
01:20:54,183 --> 01:20:56,753
I WAS REALLY
ANNOYING THERE, TOO.

1955
01:20:56,787 --> 01:20:59,855
I FOUND DAD.

1956
01:20:59,890 --> 01:21:01,758
PRETTY WEIRD, HUH?

1957
01:21:01,792 --> 01:21:03,025
HI, HONEY.

1958
01:21:03,058 --> 01:21:05,095
I'M HOME.

1959
01:21:05,128 --> 01:21:06,797
HOW'RE YOU?

1960
01:21:08,932 --> 01:21:10,300
OH, DADDY.

1961
01:21:10,333 --> 01:21:14,237
IT WASN'T A DREAM.

1962
01:21:14,270 --> 01:21:15,672
A DREAM COME TRUE.

1963
01:21:15,705 --> 01:21:18,242
I'VE BECOME CONRAD JANIS.

1964
01:21:18,275 --> 01:21:20,043
I LOVE YOU.

1965
01:21:20,077 --> 01:21:23,447
OH, A LITTLE TOO HARD
THERE, HONEY.

1966
01:21:23,480 --> 01:21:25,482
AND SANTA'S COMING!

1967
01:21:25,515 --> 01:21:26,783
UH-HUH.

1968
01:21:26,817 --> 01:21:29,218
HMM, UH, MAYBE THEY
SHOULD COVER THAT UP.

1969
01:21:29,252 --> 01:21:31,220
- NAH.
- OOH, STILL HOT.

1970
01:21:33,823 --> 01:21:36,225
AAH! SHARK! SHARK!

1971
01:21:36,258 --> 01:21:38,595
♪ TAN, DON'T BURN
GET A COPPERTONE TAN ♪

1972
01:21:40,363 --> 01:21:41,463
WHAT THE?

1973
01:21:41,497 --> 01:21:43,098
- OH.
- AH.

1974
01:21:43,132 --> 01:21:45,468
OH, HI.

1975
01:21:45,502 --> 01:21:46,603
HEY, HERE'S A SOUVENIR.

1976
01:21:46,637 --> 01:21:48,705
HEY STACY, WAIT UP.

1977
01:21:48,738 --> 01:21:50,140
HEY, ROBBIE.

1978
01:21:50,173 --> 01:21:51,608
- HOW'RE YOU DOING?
- I'M HERE FOR MY COMEUPPANCE.

1979
01:21:51,642 --> 01:21:53,042
LOOK, IS IT TRUE
ABOUT WANDA?

1980
01:21:53,075 --> 01:21:54,110
I HEARD SHE WENT TO AFRICA.

1981
01:21:54,143 --> 01:21:55,745
ACTUALLY TOOK A PLANE
AND EVERYTHING.

1982
01:21:55,778 --> 01:21:58,147
YEAH, SHE ACTUALLY TOOK
A PLANE AND EVERYTHING.

1983
01:21:58,180 --> 01:21:59,448
- WELL GOLLY!
- AH, I CAN'T BELIEVE IT!

1984
01:21:59,482 --> 01:22:00,650
NOBODY IN VISTA VERDE
CAN BELIEVE IT,

1985
01:22:00,683 --> 01:22:02,218
INCLUDING ME,
INCLUDING SUSAN.

1986
01:22:02,252 --> 01:22:03,420
SUSAN, STACY.

1987
01:22:03,453 --> 01:22:05,188
HAVE YOU MET
MY TROPHY CHICK?

1988
01:22:05,222 --> 01:22:07,590
IT'S JUST NOT LIKE HER.

1989
01:22:07,623 --> 01:22:09,625
ARE YOU SURE THIS ISN'T
SOME SCAM TO GET ME BACK?

1990
01:22:09,658 --> 01:22:11,427
UH, EXCUSE ME,
MY KNEE AND YOUR GROIN

1991
01:22:11,460 --> 01:22:12,495
HAVE AN APPOINTMENT.

1992
01:22:12,528 --> 01:22:14,597
WHY DON'T YOU
ASK HER YOURSELF?

1993
01:22:17,000 --> 01:22:19,902
WOW, SHE'S NOT
WEARING GLASSES!

1994
01:22:23,238 --> 01:22:25,008
NUM NUM NUM.

1995
01:22:25,042 --> 01:22:26,475
SO, WHAT DO YOU DO?

1996
01:22:26,508 --> 01:22:27,843
HI, WANDA.

1997
01:22:27,877 --> 01:22:29,512
DUH, OVERRAN YOU THERE, SORRY.

1998
01:22:29,545 --> 01:22:32,048
--TAKE YOU OUT, AND YOU
CAN TELL ME ALL ABOUT AFRICA.

1999
01:22:32,082 --> 01:22:33,983
- HOW ABOUT YOU
BITE ME, TWICE?
- BUT WHY?

2000
01:22:34,017 --> 01:22:36,352
I STILL HAVE THE SAME HAIR.

2001
01:22:36,385 --> 01:22:37,520
SAME VOICE.

2002
01:22:37,553 --> 01:22:39,088
AH, IT DOESN'T MATTER.

2003
01:22:39,122 --> 01:22:40,390
BELIEVE ME,
IT DOESN'T MATTER.

2004
01:22:40,423 --> 01:22:42,725
YOU'VE CHANGED.

2005
01:22:42,758 --> 01:22:45,428
YEAH, I HAVE.

2006
01:22:45,462 --> 01:22:47,897
[CROW GIGGLES]

2007
01:22:47,930 --> 01:22:50,500
OH, WHAT I WOULDN'T
GIVE FOR ALL-- OH, HI.

2008
01:22:50,533 --> 01:22:51,935
WHAT HAPPENED TO HER
IN AFRICA?

2009
01:22:51,968 --> 01:22:54,803
SHE GREW UP.

2010
01:22:54,837 --> 01:22:56,205
MEN CAN'T RESIST WOMEN

2011
01:22:56,238 --> 01:22:59,975
WHO FLY COACH TO AFRICA.

2012
01:23:00,010 --> 01:23:02,178
LORENZO LAMAS IS <i>RENEGADE.</i>

2013
01:23:02,212 --> 01:23:03,347
SHE'S HAD KNEE SURGERY.

2014
01:23:03,380 --> 01:23:04,680
EXCUSE ME.

2015
01:23:04,713 --> 01:23:06,482
I WAS WONDERING IF YOU
COULD HELP ME OUT.

2016
01:23:06,515 --> 01:23:09,785
I'M A STRANGER
AROUND HERE.

2017
01:23:09,818 --> 01:23:13,357
FROM ANOTHER TIME,
ANOTHER PLACE.

2018
01:23:13,390 --> 01:23:16,727
HMM, SORRY,
DOESN'T RING A BELL.

2019
01:23:16,760 --> 01:23:18,995
CRAZY.

2020
01:23:19,028 --> 01:23:20,530
PHRASEY? WHAT THE HELL
DOES THAT MEAN?

2021
01:23:20,563 --> 01:23:21,898
PHRASEY?

2022
01:23:21,932 --> 01:23:23,433
THAT'S A REALLY
GENEROUS HELPING

2023
01:23:23,467 --> 01:23:24,667
OF GUMS WE'RE
GETTING THERE.

2024
01:23:24,700 --> 01:23:26,068
SMILE LIKE A BALEEN WHALE.

2025
01:23:26,102 --> 01:23:28,472
SHE'S FILTERING KRILL
THROUGH THOSE TEETH.

2026
01:23:33,977 --> 01:23:35,878
HAH, SHE LIVED
HAPPILY EVER AFTER.

2027
01:23:35,912 --> 01:23:38,548
IF YOU CALL DOING AN OCCASIONAL
GUEST SHOT ON <i>DOWN THE SHORE</i>

2028
01:23:38,582 --> 01:23:41,283
LIVING HAPPILY EVER AFTER.

2029
01:23:41,317 --> 01:23:42,652
I WOULDN'T.

2030
01:23:42,685 --> 01:23:43,987
OH, GOLAN-GLOBUS.

2031
01:23:44,020 --> 01:23:45,288
THEY PRODUCED <i>LONELY PEOPLE</i>

2032
01:23:45,322 --> 01:23:46,957
WITH JILL CLAYBURGH
AND BARBARA HERSHEY.

2033
01:23:46,990 --> 01:23:48,290
DID YOU SEE THAT, MIKE?

2034
01:23:48,323 --> 01:23:49,492
WELL, NO, CROW,
I DIDN'T SEE THAT

2035
01:23:49,525 --> 01:23:51,227
BECAUSE, WELL, I'M A GUY.

2036
01:23:51,260 --> 01:23:52,762
OH. OH REALLY.

2037
01:23:52,795 --> 01:23:53,930
YEAH, WELL, YOU KNOW,

2038
01:23:53,963 --> 01:23:55,198
I KNOW YOU COULDN'T SEE IT
BECAUSE YOU WERE

2039
01:23:55,232 --> 01:23:56,867
WATCHING <i>BEACHES </i>FOR
THE HUNDREDTH TIME.

2040
01:23:56,900 --> 01:23:59,535
SHH! SHH!

2041
01:23:59,568 --> 01:24:01,938
--TO THE SURFACE
OF THE WORLD.

2042
01:24:01,972 --> 01:24:03,640
WHAT?

2043
01:24:03,673 --> 01:24:05,208
DID THAT HAVE
ANY RELEVANCE?

2044
01:24:05,242 --> 01:24:06,342
WHO CARES? HEY, CROW,

2045
01:24:06,375 --> 01:24:08,043
THE VIDEO STORE CALLED,
THEY HAVE THAT COPY

2046
01:24:08,077 --> 01:24:10,880
OF <i>MEN DON'T LEAVE </i>THEY'VE
BEEN SAVING FOR YOU.

2047
01:24:10,913 --> 01:24:12,448
SHH, SHH.

2048
01:24:12,482 --> 01:24:15,285
THERE IS NO SUCH THING
AS A SURFACE WORLD.

2049
01:24:15,318 --> 01:24:18,053
AND RUMORS OF THE ACTUAL
EXISTENCE OF ALIENS

2050
01:24:18,087 --> 01:24:20,390
ARE WRONG, MISLEADING,

2051
01:24:20,423 --> 01:24:22,058
AND COUNTERPRODUCTIVE
TO THE FUTURE

2052
01:24:22,092 --> 01:24:24,927
OF OUR GREAT CITY-STATES.

2053
01:24:24,960 --> 01:24:26,628
SO THAT'S IRONY, HUH?

2054
01:24:26,662 --> 01:24:28,297
- LET ME TELL YOU.
- YEAH, SURE IS.

2055
01:24:28,330 --> 01:24:30,500
HEY, SAY, MIKE,
THE VIDEO STORE CALLED

2056
01:24:30,533 --> 01:24:33,603
AND, UH, SAID YOUR COPY
OF <i>THE LEMON SISTERS</i>

2057
01:24:33,637 --> 01:24:35,138
IS WAY OVERDUE.

2058
01:24:35,172 --> 01:24:36,672
ANYONE WHO THINKS
THEY MAY HAVE

2059
01:24:36,705 --> 01:24:38,975
HAD CONTACT WITH AN ALIEN,

2060
01:24:39,008 --> 01:24:40,510
FEMALE OR OLDER MALE,

2061
01:24:40,543 --> 01:24:42,812
SHOULD REPORT IMMEDIATELY

2062
01:24:42,845 --> 01:24:44,580
TO GENERAL RYKOV
AT GOVERNMENT HOUSE.

2063
01:24:44,613 --> 01:24:47,183
- THERE IS A REWARD.
- ME!

2064
01:24:47,217 --> 01:24:48,518
PRETTY FUNNY, EH, GUYS?

2065
01:24:48,552 --> 01:24:49,985
YEAH, GREAT, TOM,
HEY CROW,

2066
01:24:50,018 --> 01:24:51,587
HOW'S YOUR NEW DELUXE
COLLECTOR'S EDITION

2067
01:24:51,620 --> 01:24:53,857
OF <i>FOR THE BOYS </i>HOLDING UP?

2068
01:24:53,890 --> 01:24:56,927
FINALLY, THE STATEMENT
STRESSES, ONCE AND FOR ALL,

2069
01:24:56,960 --> 01:24:59,262
ALIENS DO NOT EXIST.

2070
01:24:59,295 --> 01:25:01,563
THE SURFACE WORLD
DOES NOT EXIST,

2071
01:25:01,597 --> 01:25:03,032
AND WANDA SAKNUSSEMM

2072
01:25:03,065 --> 01:25:05,668
IS A MERE FIGMENT
OF YOUR IMAGINATION.

2073
01:25:07,270 --> 01:25:08,772
COOL, A THEME SONG.

2074
01:25:08,805 --> 01:25:10,473
HEY LOOK,
PAULA GREATBATCH.

2075
01:25:10,507 --> 01:25:12,075
LOOK GUYS, GREATBATCH.

2076
01:25:12,108 --> 01:25:14,510
- THAT'S REALLY, REALLY--
- YEAH, REALLY FUNNY, SERVO.

2077
01:25:14,543 --> 01:25:16,545
SAY, MIKE,
HOW'S YOUR EXCLUSIVE

2078
01:25:16,578 --> 01:25:18,715
LIMITED LASERDISC
EDITION OF <i>YENTL?</i>

2079
01:25:18,748 --> 01:25:20,783
GUYS, GUYS, GUYS,
CUT IT OUT.

2080
01:25:20,817 --> 01:25:23,285
LET'S JUST SAY YOU'RE BOTH
INTO REALLY FEMMY MOVIES

2081
01:25:23,318 --> 01:25:24,653
AND LEAVE IT AT THAT, OKAY?

2082
01:25:24,687 --> 01:25:26,088
YOU KNOW, THAT'S
A GOOD POINT, TOM.

2083
01:25:26,122 --> 01:25:28,223
BY THE WAY, COULD YOU DO ME
A FAVOR AND NOT LEAVE YOUR COPY

2084
01:25:28,257 --> 01:25:30,160
OF <i>MYSTIC PIZZA,</i>
<i>THE DIRECTOR'S CUT</i>

2085
01:25:30,193 --> 01:25:31,493
- LYING AROUND?
- OOH.

2086
01:25:31,527 --> 01:25:33,462
YEAH, TOM, AND KEEP
YOUR PLATINUM EDITION

2087
01:25:33,497 --> 01:25:35,465
OF <i>THE FOUR SEASONS</i>
IN YOUR OWN ROOM.

2088
01:25:35,498 --> 01:25:37,633
OH, SURE, CROW,
NO PROBLEM.

2089
